window.__BOOK__={"meta": {"title_en": "The Little Prince", "title_zh": "小王子", "author_en": "Antoine de Saint-Exupéry", "author_zh": "安托万·德·圣埃克苏佩里", "voice": "en-GB-SoniaNeural (edge-tts)", "ipa_note": "音标为宽式音位转写（英语近似发音，不标重音），仅供参考。", "n_chapters": 28, "n_paras": 762, "n_sents": 1635, "audio_paras": 762}, "chapters": [{"id": "ch00", "title_en": "To Leon Werth", "title_zh": "献词", "paras": [{"id": "ch00p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I ask the indulgence of the children who may read this book for dedicating it to a grown-up.", "zh": "请孩子们原谅我把这本书献给一位大人。", "t": [138, 5575]}, {"en": "I have a serious reason: he is the best friend I have in the world.", "zh": "他是我世间最好的朋友。", "t": [5575, 9762]}, {"en": "I have another reason: this grown-up understands everything, even books about children.", "zh": "这位大人洞察一切，即便是对孩子的书也能心领神会。", "t": [9762, 15150]}, {"en": "I have a third reason: he lives in France where he is hungry and cold.", "zh": "他住在法国，忍饥受寒。", "t": [15150, 19675]}, {"en": "He needs cheering up.", "zh": "他亟需慰藉。", "t": [19675, 21462]}, {"en": "If all these reasons are not enough, I will dedicate the book to the child from whom this grown-up grew.", "zh": "若这些理由仍不足够，我便将此书献予那位成人曾是的孩童。", "t": [21462, 27300]}, {"en": "All grown-ups were once children—although few of them remember it.", "zh": "所有大人曾经都是孩子——尽管他们中的许多人已不记得。", "t": [27300, 31388]}, {"en": "And so I correct my dedication: To Leon Werth, when he was a little boy.", "zh": "因此，我将献词更正：献予列翁·维尔特，他曾是孩童时。", "t": [31388, 36000]}]}]}, {"id": "ch01", "title_en": "Chapter I", "title_zh": "第 1 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch01p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Once when I was six years old I saw a magnificent picture in a book, called True Stories from Nature, about the primeval forest.", "zh": "六岁那一年，我在一本描写原始森林的书里看见一幅扣人心弦的图画。", "t": [138, 8012]}, {"en": "It was a picture of a boa constrictor in the act of swallowing an animal.", "zh": "那本书的书名叫做“丛林奇遇记”。", "t": [8012, 12450]}, {"en": "Here is a copy of the drawing.", "zh": "图中画的是正在吞吃野兽的蟒蛇。", "t": [12450, 14112]}]}, {"id": "ch01p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In the book it said: \"Boa constrictors swallow their prey whole, without chewing it.", "zh": "下面是这幅画的复印件。", "t": [112, 5262]}, {"en": "After that they are not able to move, and they sleep through the six months that they need for digestion.\"", "zh": "书中说：“蟒蛇囫囵吞下猎物，肚子撑得它不能动弹，要躺六个月才能把猎物消化掉。", "t": [5262, 10512]}]}, {"id": "ch01p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I pondered deeply, then, over the adventures of the jungle.", "zh": "” 从此，我对丛林的种种奇事产生了无穷尽的遐想。", "t": [138, 4212]}, {"en": "And after some work with a coloured pencil I succeeded in making my first drawing.", "zh": "我也用彩色铅笔绘下我的第一幅画。", "t": [4212, 9150]}, {"en": "My Drawing Number One.", "zh": "我也用彩色铅笔绘下我的第一幅画。", "t": [9150, 11000]}, {"en": "It looked like this:", "zh": "我称它为一号画。", "t": [11000, 12188]}]}, {"id": "ch01p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I showed my masterpiece to the grown-ups, and asked them whether the drawing frightened them.", "zh": "一号画如下： 我把我的杰作拿给大人看，还问他们，我的画是否吓坏了他们。", "t": [138, 4900]}]}, {"id": "ch01p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But they answered: \"Frighten?", "zh": "一号画如下： 我把我的杰作拿给大人看，还问他们，我的画是否吓坏了他们。", "t": [100, 2362]}, {"en": "Why should any one be frightened by a hat?\"", "zh": "他们回答我说：“一顶帽子有什么可怕的？", "t": [2362, 4813]}]}, {"id": "ch01p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "My drawing was not a picture of a hat.", "zh": "他们回答我说：“一顶帽子有什么可怕的？", "t": [112, 2850]}, {"en": "It was a picture of a boa constrictor digesting an elephant.", "zh": "” 我画的不是一顶帽子，而是一条正在消化大象的蟒蛇啊。", "t": [2850, 6838]}, {"en": "But since the grown-ups were not able to understand it, I made another drawing: I drew the inside of the boa constrictor, so that the grown-ups could see it clearly.", "zh": "我又画了一张画，画的是蟒蛇和它肚子里的大象，好让大人看懂我的画。", "t": [6838, 15700]}, {"en": "They always need to have things explained.", "zh": "他们总是需要我们给他们解释的。", "t": [15700, 18275]}, {"en": "My Drawing Number Two looked like this:", "zh": "他们总是需要我们给他们解释的。", "t": [18275, 20525]}]}, {"id": "ch01p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The grown-ups' response, this time, was to advise me to lay aside my drawings of boa constrictors, whether from the inside or the outside, and devote myself instead to geography, history, arithmetic and grammar.", "zh": "我的二号画如下： 大人们劝我，别画这些肚子没打开或打开了的蟒蛇了，把心思放到地理、历史、算术、语法上去吧。", "t": [138, 12875]}, {"en": "That is why, at the age of six, I gave up what might have been a magnificent career as a painter.", "zh": "就这样，我在六岁这一年放弃了画家的光辉生涯。", "t": [12875, 18888]}, {"en": "I had been disheartened by the failure of my Drawing Number One and my Drawing Number Two.", "zh": "一号画、二号画的失败令我垂头丧气。", "t": [18888, 24188]}, {"en": "Grown-ups never understand anything by themselves, and it is tiresome for children to be always and forever explaining things to them.", "zh": "大人们老是需要孩子们费尽唇舌，给他们再三解释，不然就一窍不通，真把我们累得够呛。", "t": [24188, 31500]}]}, {"id": "ch01p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then I chose another profession, and learned to pilot airplanes.", "zh": "我只好选择另一门职业。", "t": [125, 4388]}, {"en": "I have flown a little over all parts of the world; and it is true that geography has been very useful to me.", "zh": "地理确实帮了我的大忙。", "t": [4388, 10600]}, {"en": "At a glance I can distinguish China from Arizona.", "zh": "在空中，我一眼就能认出中国和亚利桑那 [1] ，这样的本领很管用——如果夜航时迷了路。", "t": [10600, 14238]}, {"en": "If one gets lost in the night, such knowledge is valuable.", "zh": "在空中，我一眼就能认出中国和亚利桑那 [1] ，这样的本领很管用——如果夜航时迷了路。", "t": [14238, 17650]}]}, {"id": "ch01p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In the course of this life I have had a great many encounters with a great many people who have been concerned with matters of consequence.", "zh": "我一生与许多重要人物打过交道，我在大人当中生活了很长时间，我仔细地观察过他们，然而我对他们的看法没有多大的改善。", "t": [112, 7388]}, {"en": "I have lived a great deal among grown-ups.", "zh": "我一生与许多重要人物打过交道，我在大人当中生活了很长时间，我仔细地观察过他们，然而我对他们的看法没有多大的改善。", "t": [7388, 10212]}, {"en": "I have seen them intimately, close at hand.", "zh": "我一生与许多重要人物打过交道，我在大人当中生活了很长时间，我仔细地观察过他们，然而我对他们的看法没有多大的改善。", "t": [10212, 13400]}, {"en": "And that hasn't much improved my opinion of them.", "zh": "我始终保留着我的一号画。", "t": [13400, 16113]}]}, {"id": "ch01p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Whenever I met one of them who seemed to me at all clear-sighted, I tried the experiment of showing him my Drawing Number One, which I have always kept.", "zh": "遇到一个我认为略为懂事的大人，我就用这幅画做试验，看他是否真的懂事，但他们总是这样回答我：“这是一顶帽子。", "t": [138, 8312]}, {"en": "I would try to find out, so, if this was a person of true understanding.", "zh": "遇到一个我认为略为懂事的大人，我就用这幅画做试验，看他是否真的懂事，但他们总是这样回答我：“这是一顶帽子。", "t": [8312, 13062]}, {"en": "But, whoever it was, he, or she, would always say: \"That is a hat.\"", "zh": "”听了这样的话，我就不再与他们谈蟒蛇、原始森林、星星了。", "t": [13062, 17774]}]}, {"id": "ch01p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then I would never talk to that person about boa constrictors, or primeval forests, or stars.", "zh": "”听了这样的话，我就不再与他们谈蟒蛇、原始森林、星星了。", "t": [138, 6188]}, {"en": "I would bring myself down to his level.", "zh": "我谈他们能理解的事情，例如桥牌啦，高尔夫球啦，政治啦，领带啦。", "t": [6188, 8800]}, {"en": "I would talk to him about bridge, and golf, and politics, and neckties.", "zh": "大人们便很满意，以为他们认识了一个通情达理、善解人意的人。", "t": [8800, 13750]}, {"en": "And the grown-up would be greatly pleased to have met such a sensible man.", "zh": "大人们便很满意，以为他们认识了一个通情达理、善解人意的人。", "t": [13750, 17624]}]}]}, {"id": "ch02", "title_en": "Chapter II", "title_zh": "第 2 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch02p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So I lived my life alone, without anyone that I could really talk to, until I had an accident with my plane in the Desert of Sahara, six years ago.", "zh": "这种状况一直延续至六年前。", "t": [138, 8812]}, {"en": "Something was broken in my engine.", "zh": "六年前，我的飞机出了故障，发动机里的某个部件被撞坏了，我被迫在撒哈拉沙漠降落。", "t": [8812, 11175]}, {"en": "And as I had with me neither a mechanic nor any passengers, I set myself to attempt the difficult repairs all alone.", "zh": "六年前，我的飞机出了故障，发动机里的某个部件被撞坏了，我被迫在撒哈拉沙漠降落。", "t": [11175, 18238]}, {"en": "It was a question of life or death for me: I had scarcely enough drinking water to last a week.", "zh": "身边没有机械师，没有一个乘客，我只好勉为其难，自己动手，试着修理部件。", "t": [18238, 23888]}, {"en": "The first night, then, I went to sleep on the sand, a thousand miles from any human habitation.", "zh": "我带的水仅够喝一个星期，能否修好飞机，关系到我的生死存亡了。", "t": [23888, 30138]}, {"en": "I was more isolated than a shipwrecked sailor on a raft in the middle of the ocean.", "zh": "第一夜，我在远离人烟、千里之遥的沙漠上睡觉。", "t": [30138, 35088]}, {"en": "Thus you can imagine my amazement, at sunrise, when I was awakened by an odd little voice.", "zh": "比起那些乘着木排，在茫茫大洋中挣扎漂浮的遇险者，我更显得孤独无助。", "t": [35088, 40950]}, {"en": "It said:", "zh": "朝霞初露的时候，一个细细的奇妙的声音把我唤醒。", "t": [40950, 41626]}]}, {"id": "ch02p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If you please-- draw me a sheep!\"", "zh": "朝霞初露的时候，一个细细的奇妙的声音把我唤醒。", "t": [112, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch02p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What!\"", "zh": "朝霞初露的时候，一个细细的奇妙的声音把我唤醒。", "t": [112, 500]}]}, {"id": "ch02p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Draw me a sheep!\"", "zh": "你不难想像我当时有多惊讶了。", "t": [112, 1100]}]}, {"id": "ch02p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I jumped to my feet, completely thunderstruck.", "zh": "你不难想像我当时有多惊讶了。", "t": [138, 3462]}, {"en": "I blinked my eyes hard.", "zh": "这细细的奇妙的声音说： “劳驾……请你给我画一只绵羊吧！", "t": [3462, 5400]}, {"en": "I looked carefully all around me.", "zh": "这细细的奇妙的声音说： “劳驾……请你给我画一只绵羊吧！", "t": [5400, 7738]}, {"en": "And I saw a most extraordinary small person, who stood there examining me with great seriousness.", "zh": "” “你说什么？", "t": [7738, 13662]}, {"en": "Here you may see the best portrait that, later, I was able to make of him.", "zh": "” “给我画一只绵羊……” 我像遭了雷击，一跃而起。", "t": [13662, 18312]}, {"en": "But my drawing is certainly very much less charming than its model.", "zh": "我使劲揉我的眼睛，仔细地看了看，只见一个很奇特的小小的人儿，他正在那儿注视我呢。", "t": [18312, 22050]}]}, {"id": "ch02p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "That, however, is not my fault.", "zh": "下面就是以后我给他画的最为成功的一幅肖像画。", "t": [138, 3025]}, {"en": "The grown-ups discouraged me in my painter's career when I was six years old, and I never learned to draw anything, except boas from the outside and boas from the inside.", "zh": "下面就是以后我给他画的最为成功的一幅肖像画。", "t": [3025, 12125]}]}, {"id": "ch02p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Now I stared at this sudden apparition with my eyes fairly starting out of my head in astonishment.", "zh": "除了画打开肚子和没打开肚子的蟒蛇之外，我没有画过一张画。", "t": [112, 5938]}, {"en": "Remember, I had crashed in the desert a thousand miles from any inhabited region.", "zh": "我大吃一惊，眼睛瞪得溜圆，看着这位突然出现的人儿。", "t": [5938, 11150]}, {"en": "And yet my little man seemed neither to be straying uncertainly among the sands, nor to be fainting from fatigue or hunger or thirst or fear.", "zh": "你们可别忘了，这儿是远离人烟、千里之遥的地方啊。", "t": [11150, 19350]}, {"en": "Nothing about him gave any suggestion of a child lost in the middle of the desert, a thousand miles from any human habitation.", "zh": "我的这个小人儿一点不像迷了路，也不像是累死、饿死、渴死、吓死的鬼魂。", "t": [19350, 26862]}, {"en": "When at last I was able to speak, I said to him:", "zh": "他一点不像迷失于沙漠中的孩子，不像远离人烟、千里之遥的孩子。", "t": [26862, 29863]}]}, {"id": "ch02p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But-- what are you doing here?\"", "zh": "我终于能够张口说话了，我问他： “……你在这儿干什么？", "t": [100, 1574]}]}, {"id": "ch02p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And in answer he repeated, very slowly, as if he were speaking of a matter of great consequence:", "zh": "我终于能够张口说话了，我问他： “……你在这儿干什么？", "t": [138, 5788]}]}, {"id": "ch02p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If you please-- draw me a sheep...\"", "zh": "” 他不慌不忙地重述他的要求，像说一件很严肃的事情： “请你给我画一只绵羊……” 当神秘的东西使得你心惊肉跳的时候，你不敢不听他的命令。", "t": [112, 1887]}]}, {"id": "ch02p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When a mystery is too overpowering, one dare not disobey.", "zh": "” 他不慌不忙地重述他的要求，像说一件很严肃的事情： “请你给我画一只绵羊……” 当神秘的东西使得你心惊肉跳的时候，你不敢不听他的命令。", "t": [138, 4225]}, {"en": "Absurd as it might seem to me, a thousand miles from any human habitation and in danger of death, I took out of my pocket a sheet of paper and my fountain pen.", "zh": "” 他不慌不忙地重述他的要求，像说一件很严肃的事情： “请你给我画一只绵羊……” 当神秘的东西使得你心惊肉跳的时候，你不敢不听他的命令。", "t": [4225, 13550]}, {"en": "But then I remembered how my studies had been concentrated on geography, history, arithmetic, and grammar, and I told the little chap (a little crossly, too) that I did not know how to draw.", "zh": "虽然，身处远离人烟的荒漠，面临死亡的威胁，叫人画画的要求又未免荒堂，我还是从口袋里掏出一张纸和一枝钢笔。", "t": [13550, 24838]}, {"en": "He answered me:", "zh": "我忽然记起，除了钻研地理、历史、算术、语法，我没有画过画，便没好气地冲小人儿说，我不会画画。", "t": [24838, 25800]}]}, {"id": "ch02p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That doesn't matter.", "zh": "我忽然记起，除了钻研地理、历史、算术、语法，我没有画过画，便没好气地冲小人儿说，我不会画画。", "t": [138, 1688]}, {"en": "Draw me a sheep...\"", "zh": "我忽然记起，除了钻研地理、历史、算术、语法，我没有画过画，便没好气地冲小人儿说，我不会画画。", "t": [1688, 2787]}]}, {"id": "ch02p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But I had never drawn a sheep.", "zh": "他说：“不要紧，给我画一只绵羊吧。", "t": [100, 2288]}, {"en": "So I drew for him one of the two pictures I had drawn so often.", "zh": "他说：“不要紧，给我画一只绵羊吧。", "t": [2288, 6375]}, {"en": "It was that of the boa constrictor from the outside.", "zh": "” 我从没画过绵羊，只画过那两张画。", "t": [6375, 9738]}, {"en": "And I was astounded to hear the little fellow greet it with,", "zh": "我就给他画了其中的一张，就是没有打开肚子的蟒蛇。", "t": [9738, 12887]}]}, {"id": "ch02p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No, no, no!", "zh": "我吓了一跳，我听见小人儿说： “不！", "t": [112, 1988]}, {"en": "I do not want an elephant inside a boa constrictor.", "zh": "我吓了一跳，我听见小人儿说： “不！", "t": [1988, 5488]}, {"en": "A boa constrictor is a very dangerous creature, and an elephant is very cumbersome.", "zh": "我不要象在蟒蛇的肚子里。", "t": [5488, 10800]}, {"en": "Where I live, everything is very small.", "zh": "我的家地方不大。", "t": [10800, 13738]}, {"en": "What I need is a sheep.", "zh": "我要绵羊，给我画一只绵羊吧。", "t": [13738, 15500]}, {"en": "Draw me a sheep.\"", "zh": "我要绵羊，给我画一只绵羊吧。", "t": [15500, 16550]}]}, {"id": "ch02p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then I made a drawing.", "zh": "” 我便画了一头羊。", "t": [125, 1563]}]}, {"id": "ch02p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He looked at it carefully, then he said:", "zh": "他仔细看看，然后说： “不好！", "t": [138, 2438]}]}, {"id": "ch02p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.", "zh": "他仔细看看，然后说： “不好！", "t": [100, 1000]}, {"en": "This sheep is already very sickly.", "zh": "这是一头患了重病的羊。", "t": [1000, 3450]}, {"en": "Make me another.\"", "zh": "这是一头患了重病的羊。", "t": [3450, 4475]}]}, {"id": "ch02p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So I made another drawing.", "zh": "给我画另一头吧。", "t": [112, 1700]}]}, {"id": "ch02p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "My friend smiled gently and indulgently.", "zh": "” 我又画了一只羊。", "t": [125, 2888]}]}, {"id": "ch02p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You see yourself,\" he said, \"that this is not a sheep.", "zh": "我的朋友露出亲切可爱的微笑，并没有责怪我的意思，他说： “你瞧瞧，这不是小羊，是公羊，它长着角哩。", "t": [138, 3750]}, {"en": "This is a ram.", "zh": "我的朋友露出亲切可爱的微笑，并没有责怪我的意思，他说： “你瞧瞧，这不是小羊，是公羊，它长着角哩。", "t": [3750, 5100]}, {"en": "It has horns.\"", "zh": "我的朋友露出亲切可爱的微笑，并没有责怪我的意思，他说： “你瞧瞧，这不是小羊，是公羊，它长着角哩。", "t": [5100, 6050]}]}, {"id": "ch02p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then I did my drawing over once more.", "zh": "我的朋友露出亲切可爱的微笑，并没有责怪我的意思，他说： “你瞧瞧，这不是小羊，是公羊，它长着角哩。", "t": [125, 2525]}]}, {"id": "ch02p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But it was rejected too, just like the others.", "zh": "” 我又画了一张。", "t": [100, 2937]}]}, {"id": "ch02p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This one is too old.", "zh": "” 我又画了一张。", "t": [138, 1912]}, {"en": "I want a sheep that will live a long time.\"", "zh": "这一张画和前面两张一样，遭到了他的拒绝： “这只太老了，我要一只能活很久的绵羊。", "t": [1912, 4088]}]}, {"id": "ch02p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "By this time my patience was exhausted, because I was in a hurry to start taking my engine apart.", "zh": "这一张画和前面两张一样，遭到了他的拒绝： “这只太老了，我要一只能活很久的绵羊。", "t": [100, 5775]}]}, {"id": "ch02p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So I tossed off this drawing.", "zh": "” 我急于着手拆卸我的发动机，失去了耐性。", "t": [112, 2225]}, {"en": "And I threw out an explanation with it.", "zh": "我胡乱涂了下面这幅画。", "t": [2225, 4475]}]}, {"id": "ch02p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This is only his box.", "zh": "我胡乱涂了下面这幅画。", "t": [138, 1975]}, {"en": "The sheep you asked for is inside.\"", "zh": "而且我冲他说： “这是一只箱子，你要的绵羊在里面。", "t": [1975, 4088]}]}, {"id": "ch02p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I was very surprised to see a light break over the face of my young judge:", "zh": "而且我冲他说： “这是一只箱子，你要的绵羊在里面。", "t": [138, 4263]}]}, {"id": "ch02p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is exactly the way I wanted it!", "zh": "” 然而我惊讶地看到，我的这位小法官竟眉开眼笑： “我要的正是这样的箱子！", "t": [138, 2688]}, {"en": "Do you think that this sheep will have to have a great deal of grass?\"", "zh": "这只绵羊要很多草吗？", "t": [2688, 6025]}]}, {"id": "ch02p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why?\"", "zh": "这只绵羊要很多草吗？", "t": [125, 625]}]}, {"id": "ch02p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because where I live everything is very small...\"", "zh": "” “为什么你提这个问题？", "t": [138, 2763]}]}, {"id": "ch02p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"There will surely be enough grass for him,\" I said.", "zh": "” “因为我的家太小啦……” “肯定够了。", "t": [138, 3262]}, {"en": "\"It is a very small sheep that I have given you.\"", "zh": "我给你的是一只很小很小的绵羊。", "t": [3262, 5862]}]}, {"id": "ch02p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He bent his head over the drawing:", "zh": "” 他低头看画。", "t": [138, 2000]}]}, {"id": "ch02p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Not so small that-- Look!", "zh": "“没有这个这么小吧……咦！", "t": [112, 2000]}, {"en": "He has gone to sleep...\"", "zh": "“没有这个这么小吧……咦！", "t": [2000, 3275]}]}, {"id": "ch02p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And that is how I made the acquaintance of the little prince.", "zh": "它睡熟了……” 我就这样认识了小王子。", "t": [112, 3200]}]}]}, {"id": "ch03", "title_en": "Chapter III", "title_zh": "第 3 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch03p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It took me a long time to learn where he came from.", "zh": "过了好久好久，我才弄明白他是打哪儿来的。", "t": [138, 3225]}, {"en": "The little prince, who asked me so many questions, never seemed to hear the ones I asked him.", "zh": "小王子向我提了许多问题，却从不理会我对他提的问题。", "t": [3225, 8888]}, {"en": "It was from words dropped by chance that, little by little, everything was revealed to me.", "zh": "我从他无意中吐出的片言只语里，逐渐知道了他的来历。", "t": [8888, 14037]}]}, {"id": "ch03p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The first time he saw my airplane, for instance (I shall not draw my airplane; that would be much too complicated for me), he asked me:", "zh": "例如，当他第一次看见我的飞机的时候（我不愿画飞机，太复杂了），就问我： “这是什么玩艺儿呀？", "t": [138, 7738]}]}, {"id": "ch03p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is that object?\"", "zh": "” “它不是玩艺儿，它会飞。", "t": [100, 1526]}]}, {"id": "ch03p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is not an object.", "zh": "” “它不是玩艺儿，它会飞。", "t": [138, 1938]}, {"en": "It flies.", "zh": "这是飞机，是我的飞机。", "t": [1938, 3125]}, {"en": "It is an airplane.", "zh": "这是飞机，是我的飞机。", "t": [3125, 4675]}, {"en": "It is my airplane.\"", "zh": "这是飞机，是我的飞机。", "t": [4675, 5962]}]}, {"id": "ch03p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And I was proud to have him learn that I could fly.", "zh": "” 我挺自豪地告诉他我会飞。", "t": [138, 2838]}]}, {"id": "ch03p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He cried out, then:", "zh": "他嚷起来： “怎么？", "t": [112, 1587]}]}, {"id": "ch03p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What!", "zh": "你是从天上掉下来的吗？", "t": [112, 875]}, {"en": "You dropped down from the sky?\"", "zh": "你是从天上掉下来的吗？", "t": [875, 2613]}]}, {"id": "ch03p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes,\" I answered, modestly.", "zh": "” “是的。", "t": [125, 2475]}]}, {"id": "ch03p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!", "zh": "”我并没有吹嘘的意思。", "t": [100, 762]}, {"en": "That is funny!\"", "zh": "”我并没有吹嘘的意思。", "t": [762, 1675]}]}, {"id": "ch03p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince broke into a lovely peal of laughter, which irritated me very much.", "zh": "这就奇了……” 小王子发出清脆悦耳的笑声，他这一笑可惹恼了我。", "t": [138, 5450]}, {"en": "I like my misfortunes to be taken seriously.", "zh": "我不喜欢别人对我的不幸打哈哈。", "t": [5450, 8288]}]}, {"id": "ch03p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then he added:", "zh": "我不喜欢别人对我的不幸打哈哈。", "t": [138, 1137]}]}, {"id": "ch03p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"So you, too, come from the sky!", "zh": "然后他又说： “这么说，你也是从天上下来的！", "t": [112, 2838]}, {"en": "Which is your planet?\"", "zh": "然后他又说： “这么说，你也是从天上下来的！", "t": [2838, 4100]}]}, {"id": "ch03p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "At that moment I caught a gleam of light in the impenetrable mystery of his presence; and I demanded, abruptly:", "zh": "你住在哪一个星球上？", "t": [138, 6474]}]}, {"id": "ch03p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do you come from another planet?\"", "zh": "” 这句话犹如一道亮光，让我马上瞥见了他突然出现的秘密。", "t": [100, 1950]}]}, {"id": "ch03p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he did not reply.", "zh": "我以突袭的方式问他： “你是从另一个星球来的？", "t": [100, 1938]}, {"en": "He tossed his head gently, without taking his eyes from my plane:", "zh": "我以突袭的方式问他： “你是从另一个星球来的？", "t": [1938, 5687]}]}, {"id": "ch03p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is true that on that you can't have come from very far away...\"", "zh": "” 他不答。", "t": [138, 3600]}]}, {"id": "ch03p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he sank into a reverie, which lasted a long time.", "zh": "他看着我的飞机，轻轻地点头： “从你乘的这玩艺来看，你确实不可能来自很远的地方……” 他陷入沉思。", "t": [138, 3762]}, {"en": "Then, taking my sheep out of his pocket, he buried himself in the contemplation of his treasure.", "zh": "过了很久，他从口袋里掏出我画的绵羊，低头凝视他的宝贝。", "t": [3762, 9250]}]}, {"id": "ch03p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "You can imagine how my curiosity was aroused by this half-confidence about the \"other planets.\" I made a great effort, therefore, to find out more on this subject.", "zh": "你们不难想像，听了他那句无意透露的“其他星球”的话后，我会怎样惊讶吧。", "t": [112, 9900]}]}, {"id": "ch03p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My little man, where do you come from?", "zh": "我竭力从中探听他的来历： “我的小人儿，你从哪儿来？", "t": [112, 2775]}, {"en": "What is this 'where I live,' of which you speak?", "zh": "你的家在哪儿？", "t": [2775, 5825]}, {"en": "Where do you want to take your sheep?\"", "zh": "你要把你的绵羊牵到哪儿去？", "t": [5825, 7488]}]}, {"id": "ch03p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After a reflective silence he answered:", "zh": "” 他默默不答。", "t": [112, 2513]}]}, {"id": "ch03p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The thing that is so good about the box you have given me is that at night he can use it as his house.\"", "zh": "夜里可以给绵羊做屋子了。", "t": [138, 5388]}]}, {"id": "ch03p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is so.", "zh": "” “是呀，如果你乖，我还要给你一根绳子，白天给你拴羊用。", "t": [125, 1362]}, {"en": "And if you are good I will give you a string, too, so that you can tie him during the day, and a post to tie him to.\"", "zh": "我还要给你一根拴羊的桩。", "t": [1362, 7575]}]}, {"id": "ch03p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince seemed shocked by this offer:", "zh": "” 我的建议显然惹恼了小王子： “拴住它？", "t": [100, 2750]}]}, {"id": "ch03p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Tie him!", "zh": "亏你想得出这样的主意！", "t": [112, 1062]}, {"en": "What a queer idea!\"", "zh": "亏你想得出这样的主意！", "t": [1062, 2274]}]}, {"id": "ch03p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But if you don't tie him,\" I said, \"he will wander off somewhere, and get lost.\"", "zh": "” “你不拴住它，它会乱跑的呀，会走失的呀。", "t": [100, 4663]}]}, {"id": "ch03p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "My friend broke into another peal of laughter:", "zh": "” 我的朋友发出清脆的笑声： “你以为它会跑到哪儿去呢？", "t": [112, 2787]}]}, {"id": "ch03p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But where do you think he would go?\"", "zh": "” 我的朋友发出清脆的笑声： “你以为它会跑到哪儿去呢？", "t": [100, 1863]}]}, {"id": "ch03p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Anywhere.", "zh": "” 我的朋友发出清脆的笑声： “你以为它会跑到哪儿去呢？", "t": [112, 1112]}, {"en": "Straight ahead of him.\"", "zh": "” “到处乱跑呗，朝前跑呗……” 小王子告诉我： “这倒不成问题，我的家小得很呢！", "t": [1112, 2412]}]}, {"id": "ch03p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then the little prince said, earnestly:", "zh": "” “到处乱跑呗，朝前跑呗……” 小王子告诉我： “这倒不成问题，我的家小得很呢！", "t": [138, 2462]}]}, {"id": "ch03p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That doesn't matter.", "zh": "” “到处乱跑呗，朝前跑呗……” 小王子告诉我： “这倒不成问题，我的家小得很呢！", "t": [138, 1700]}, {"en": "Where I live, everything is so small!\"", "zh": "” “到处乱跑呗，朝前跑呗……” 小王子告诉我： “这倒不成问题，我的家小得很呢！", "t": [1700, 4074]}]}, {"id": "ch03p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, with perhaps a hint of sadness, he added:", "zh": "” 他的神色略带忧伤，说： “朝前跑，也跑不了多远……”", "t": [138, 3263]}]}, {"id": "ch03p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Straight ahead of him, nobody can go very far...\"", "zh": "” 他的神色略带忧伤，说： “朝前跑，也跑不了多远……”", "t": [125, 3188]}]}]}, {"id": "ch04", "title_en": "Chapter IV", "title_zh": "第 4 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch04p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I had thus learned a second fact of great importance: this was that the planet the little prince came from was scarcely any larger than a house!", "zh": "就这样，我知道了第二件很重要的事情：他打那儿来的星球比一幢房子大不了多少！", "t": [138, 7825]}]}, {"id": "ch04p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But that did not really surprise me much.", "zh": "我并不因此大惊小怪。", "t": [100, 2838]}, {"en": "I knew very well that in addition to the great planets-- such as the Earth, Jupiter, Mars, Venus-- to which we have given names, there are also hundreds of others, some of which are so small that one has a hard time seeing them through the telescope.", "zh": "有些星球小到连望远镜都难以观测。", "t": [2838, 15925]}, {"en": "When an astronomer discovers one of these he does not give it a name, but only a number.", "zh": "我有充分的证据认为小王子打那儿来的星球就是B612号小行星。", "t": [15925, 21100]}, {"en": "He might call it, for example, \"Asteroid 325.\"", "zh": "我有充分的证据认为小王子打那儿来的星球就是B612号小行星。", "t": [21100, 24913]}]}, {"id": "ch04p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I have serious reason to believe that the planet from which the little prince came is the asteroid known as B-612.", "zh": "这颗小行星仅仅在一九〇九年被一位土耳其天文学家用望远镜看见过一回。", "t": [138, 6700]}]}, {"id": "ch04p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "This asteroid has only once been seen through the telescope.", "zh": "在国际天文会议上，他为他的发现做了雄辩的论证，但没有人相信他的报告。", "t": [125, 4025]}, {"en": "That was by a Turkish astronomer, in 1909.", "zh": "在国际天文会议上，他为他的发现做了雄辩的论证，但没有人相信他的报告。", "t": [4025, 7313]}]}, {"id": "ch04p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On making his discovery, the astronomer had presented it to the International Astronomical Congress, in a great demonstration.", "zh": "因为他穿的是土耳其人的服装。", "t": [138, 7750]}, {"en": "But he was in Turkish costume, and so nobody would believe what he said.", "zh": "大人们就这个德性：以衣冠取人。", "t": [7750, 11813]}]}, {"id": "ch04p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Grown-ups are like that...", "zh": "幸好，为了维护B612小行星的声誉，土耳其独裁者颁布了一条法令，命令百姓改穿欧式服装，否则处以死刑。", "t": [100, 1575]}]}, {"id": "ch04p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Fortunately, however, for the reputation of Asteroid B-612, a Turkish dictator made a law that his subjects, under pain of death, should change to European costume.", "zh": "幸好，为了维护B612小行星的声誉，土耳其独裁者颁布了一条法令，命令百姓改穿欧式服装，否则处以死刑。", "t": [125, 10700]}, {"en": "So in 1920 the astronomer gave his demonstration all over again, dressed with impressive style and elegance.", "zh": "这一回，他得到了大家的认可。", "t": [10700, 17888]}, {"en": "And this time everybody accepted his report.", "zh": "这一回，他得到了大家的认可。", "t": [17888, 20725]}]}, {"id": "ch04p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "If I have told you these details about the asteroid, and made a note of its number for you, it is on account of the grown-ups and their ways.", "zh": "我对你们详细报告发现小行星B612的这些细节，把它的号码告诉你们，都是由于那些大人们的缘故。", "t": [138, 7812]}, {"en": "When you tell them that you have made a new friend, they never ask you any questions about essential matters.", "zh": "因为大人们对数字情有独钟。", "t": [7812, 13712]}, {"en": "They never say to you, \"What does his voice sound like?", "zh": "如果你对他们介绍一个新朋友，他们从不打听他的基本情况，他们从不会问你：“他的嗓子怎么样？", "t": [13712, 17088]}, {"en": "What games does he love best?", "zh": "他喜欢玩什么游戏？", "t": [17088, 19275]}, {"en": "Does he collect butterflies?\" Instead, they demand: \"How old is he?", "zh": "他是否采集蝴蝶标本？", "t": [19275, 24600]}, {"en": "How many brothers has he?", "zh": "”而是问：“他几岁了？", "t": [24600, 26562]}, {"en": "How much does he weigh?", "zh": "有多少个兄弟？", "t": [26562, 28275]}, {"en": "How much money does his father make?\" Only from these figures do they think they have learned anything about him.", "zh": "他的父亲挣多少钱？", "t": [28275, 34362]}]}, {"id": "ch04p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "If you were to say to the grown-ups: \"I saw a beautiful house made of rosy brick, with geraniums in the windows and doves on the roof,\" they would not be able to get any idea of that house at all.", "zh": "如果你告诉大人：“我看见一幢漂亮的红砖房子，窗前摆着天竺葵，鸽子在屋顶栖息……”他们便无法想像这是一幢怎样的房子。", "t": [138, 10750]}, {"en": "You would have to say to them: \"I saw a house that cost $20,000.\" Then they would exclaim: \"Oh, what a pretty house that is!\"", "zh": "你必须对他们说：“我看见一幢值十万法郎的房子！", "t": [10750, 18713]}]}, {"id": "ch04p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Just so, you might say to them: \"The proof that the little prince existed is that he was charming, that he laughed, and that he was looking for a sheep.", "zh": "” 所以，如果你对他们说：“这世上确实存在一位王子，证据就是他可爱俊美，脸带笑容，他要一只绵羊。", "t": [100, 8188]}, {"en": "If anybody wants a sheep, that is a proof that he exists.\" And what good would it do to tell them that?", "zh": "一个人要一只绵羊，就是他存在的证明。", "t": [8188, 14725]}, {"en": "They would shrug their shoulders, and treat you like a child.", "zh": "一个人要一只绵羊，就是他存在的证明。", "t": [14725, 18212]}, {"en": "But if you said to them: \"The planet he came from is Asteroid B-612,\" then they would be convinced, and leave you in peace from their questions.", "zh": "但如果你对他们说：“他打那儿来的星球是小行星B612。", "t": [18212, 26100]}]}, {"id": "ch04p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "They are like that.", "zh": "”他们就深信不疑了，就不会用没完没了的问题烦你了。", "t": [138, 1612]}, {"en": "One must not hold it against them.", "zh": "”他们就深信不疑了，就不会用没完没了的问题烦你了。", "t": [1612, 3875]}, {"en": "Children should always show great forbearance toward grown-up people.", "zh": "他们就这副德性。", "t": [3875, 7662]}]}, {"id": "ch04p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But certainly, for us who understand life, figures are a matter of indifference.", "zh": "我们不要责怪埋怨他们，孩子对大人应当尽量地宽容。", "t": [100, 5425]}, {"en": "I should have liked to begin this story in the fashion of the fairy-tales.", "zh": "当然，我们是理解生活的人，我们才不会把数字放在眼里呢！", "t": [5425, 9562]}, {"en": "I should have like to say: \"Once upon a time there was a little prince who lived on a planet that was scarcely any bigger than himself, and who had need of a sheep...\"", "zh": "我喜欢以讲童话的方式讲这个故事。", "t": [9562, 17862]}]}, {"id": "ch04p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "To those who understand life, that would have given a much greater air of truth to my story.", "zh": "他需要一个朋友。", "t": [100, 5212]}]}, {"id": "ch04p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For I do not want any one to read my book carelessly.", "zh": "”对于理解生活的人，这样讲似乎要真实得多。", "t": [125, 3625]}, {"en": "I have suffered too much grief in setting down these memories.", "zh": "我不喜欢别人漫不经心地读我的书。", "t": [3625, 7412]}, {"en": "Six years have already passed since my friend went away from me, with his sheep.", "zh": "提起这些往事，我还挺伤心的。", "t": [7412, 12325]}, {"en": "If I try to describe him here, it is to make sure that I shall not forget him.", "zh": "我在这儿讲述他的故事，是为了不忘记他。", "t": [12325, 16988]}, {"en": "To forget a friend is sad.", "zh": "忘了朋友是可悲的。", "t": [16988, 19038]}, {"en": "Not every one has had a friend.", "zh": "忘了朋友是可悲的。", "t": [19038, 21275]}, {"en": "And if I forget him, I may become like the grown-ups who are no longer interested in anything but figures...", "zh": "也许有一天我也像大人那样，除了数字，对别的东西都失去兴趣。", "t": [21275, 26874]}]}, {"id": "ch04p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It is for that purpose, again, that I have bought a box of paints and some pencils.", "zh": "为了这个缘故，我买了一盒颜料和几枝铅笔。", "t": [138, 5288]}, {"en": "It is hard to take up drawing again at my age, when I have never made any pictures except those of the boa constrictor from the outside and the boa constrictor from the inside, since I was six.", "zh": "到了我这个年龄才重拾画笔是困难的。", "t": [5288, 15875]}, {"en": "I shall certainly try to make my portraits as true to life as possible.", "zh": "当然，我可以画最逼真的人像画。", "t": [15875, 20288]}, {"en": "But I am not at all sure of success.", "zh": "但能否成功，我把握不大。", "t": [20288, 22912]}, {"en": "One drawing goes along all right, and another has no resemblance to its subject.", "zh": "这一幅画得可以，另一幅却画得不像。", "t": [22912, 27975]}, {"en": "I make some errors, too, in the little prince's height: in one place he is too tall and in another too short.", "zh": "对他的个儿高矮，我也记得不太真切。", "t": [27975, 34712]}, {"en": "And I feel some doubts about the colours of his costume.", "zh": "该给他的衣服抹什么颜色，我也犹豫不决。", "t": [34712, 38038]}, {"en": "So I fumble along as best I can, now good, now bad, and I hope generally fair-to-middling.", "zh": "该给他的衣服抹什么颜色，我也犹豫不决。", "t": [38038, 43825]}]}, {"id": "ch04p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In certain more important details I shall make mistakes, also.", "zh": "我在画纸上抹来抹去，画了张约莫相似的肖像，但某些重要部位也许弄错了。", "t": [138, 4575]}, {"en": "But that is something that will not be my fault.", "zh": "对这一点，你们一定要谅解。", "t": [4575, 7538]}, {"en": "My friend never explained anything to me.", "zh": "对这一点，你们一定要谅解。", "t": [7538, 10438]}, {"en": "He thought, perhaps, that I was like himself.", "zh": "我的朋友从不向我解释，大概他以为我和他一样；可是我呢，很遗憾，我不能透过箱子看到里面的绵羊。", "t": [10438, 13850]}, {"en": "But I, alas, do not know how to see sheep through the walls of boxes.", "zh": "我的朋友从不向我解释，大概他以为我和他一样；可是我呢，很遗憾，我不能透过箱子看到里面的绵羊。", "t": [13850, 18475]}, {"en": "Perhaps I am a little like the grown-ups.", "zh": "也许我有点像大人了。", "t": [18475, 21125]}, {"en": "I have had to grow old.", "zh": "我大概老了。", "t": [21125, 22575]}]}]}, {"id": "ch05", "title_en": "Chapter V", "title_zh": "第 5 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch05p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As each day passed I would learn, in our talk, something about the little prince's planet, his departure from it, his journey.", "zh": "每一天，我都从他那儿获得一些有关星球、启程、旅行的知识。", "t": [138, 7700]}, {"en": "The information would come very slowly, as it might chance to fall from his thoughts.", "zh": "这些知识是逐渐得到的，只要想到什么问题就提什么问题。", "t": [7700, 12675]}, {"en": "It was in this way that I heard, on the third day, about the catastrophe of the baobabs.", "zh": "第三天，我就是这样了解到有关猴面包树的事情的。", "t": [12675, 17687]}]}, {"id": "ch05p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "This time, once more, I had the sheep to thank for it.", "zh": "这一回还真亏了绵羊。", "t": [125, 4012]}, {"en": "For the little prince asked me abruptly-- as if seized by a grave doubt-- \"It is true, isn't it, that sheep eat little bushes?\"", "zh": "因为小王子突然对一件事产生了极大的怀疑，突然问我： “羊吃灌木，这是真的吗？", "t": [4012, 10862]}]}, {"id": "ch05p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is true.\"", "zh": "” “是呀，是真的呀。", "t": [112, 1663]}]}, {"id": "ch05p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "” “是呀，是真的呀。", "t": [100, 850]}, {"en": "I am glad!\"", "zh": "” “啊，那我很高兴。", "t": [850, 1675]}]}, {"id": "ch05p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not understand why it was so important that sheep should eat little bushes.", "zh": "” “啊，那我很高兴。", "t": [138, 4850]}, {"en": "But the little prince added:", "zh": "” 我不明白，羊吃灌木为什么这么重要。", "t": [4850, 6525]}]}, {"id": "ch05p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then it follows that they also eat baobabs?\"", "zh": "小王子又问： “这么说，它们也吃猴面包树啦？", "t": [125, 2787]}]}, {"id": "ch05p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I pointed out to the little prince that baobabs were not little bushes, but, on the contrary, trees as big as castles; and that even if he took a whole herd of elephants away with him, the herd would not eat up one single baobab.", "zh": "” 我提醒小王子，猴面包树不是灌木丛，而是像教堂一样巍峨高大的树。", "t": [138, 12250]}]}, {"id": "ch05p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The idea of the herd of elephants made the little prince laugh.", "zh": "即使他弄一群大象来，它们也啃不完一棵猴面包树。", "t": [138, 3726]}]}, {"id": "ch05p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We would have to put them one on top of the other,\" he said.", "zh": "想到一群象啃猴面包树的情景，小王子忍不住笑了： “那它们非得叠罗汉了……” 他很机灵，指出： “猴面包树的树苗挺小的呢！", "t": [138, 3187]}]}, {"id": "ch05p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he made a wise comment:", "zh": "想到一群象啃猴面包树的情景，小王子忍不住笑了： “那它们非得叠罗汉了……” 他很机灵，指出： “猴面包树的树苗挺小的呢！", "t": [112, 1738]}]}, {"id": "ch05p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Before they grow so big, the baobabs start out by being little.\"", "zh": "想到一群象啃猴面包树的情景，小王子忍不住笑了： “那它们非得叠罗汉了……” 他很机灵，指出： “猴面包树的树苗挺小的呢！", "t": [112, 3962]}]}, {"id": "ch05p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is strictly correct,\" I said.", "zh": "” “你说得对！", "t": [138, 2712]}, {"en": "\"But why do you want the sheep to eat the little baobabs?\"", "zh": "可是你为什么希望你的绵羊吃猴面包树苗呢？", "t": [2712, 5725]}]}, {"id": "ch05p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He answered me at once, \"Oh, come, come!\", as if he were speaking of something that was self-evident.", "zh": "” 他说：“嘿！", "t": [138, 6412]}, {"en": "And I was obliged to make a great mental effort to solve this problem, without any assistance.", "zh": "而要我自己想明白这个问题，我确实要绞尽脑汁了。", "t": [6412, 11812]}]}, {"id": "ch05p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Indeed, as I learned, there were on the planet where the little prince lived-- as on all planets-- good plants and bad plants.", "zh": "是的，小王子的星球和其他星球一样，长着益草，也长着毒草，因此也就有了益草的种子和毒草的种子。", "t": [138, 7112]}, {"en": "In consequence, there were good seeds from good plants, and bad seeds from bad plants.", "zh": "是的，小王子的星球和其他星球一样，长着益草，也长着毒草，因此也就有了益草的种子和毒草的种子。", "t": [7112, 12550]}, {"en": "But seeds are invisible.", "zh": "但种子是看不见的，它们沉埋在土地深处，直至其中一颗突然苏醒……它伸伸懒腰，羞羞答答，向着太阳伸出一株青嫩可爱、娇小玲珑、不伤人的幼苗来。", "t": [12550, 14562]}, {"en": "They sleep deep in the heart of the earth's darkness, until some one among them is seized with the desire to awaken.", "zh": "但种子是看不见的，它们沉埋在土地深处，直至其中一颗突然苏醒……它伸伸懒腰，羞羞答答，向着太阳伸出一株青嫩可爱、娇小玲珑、不伤人的幼苗来。", "t": [14562, 21062]}, {"en": "Then this little seed will stretch itself and begin-- timidly at first-- to push a charming little sprig inoffensively upward toward the sun.", "zh": "但种子是看不见的，它们沉埋在土地深处，直至其中一颗突然苏醒……它伸伸懒腰，羞羞答答，向着太阳伸出一株青嫩可爱、娇小玲珑、不伤人的幼苗来。", "t": [21062, 28850]}, {"en": "If it is only a sprout of radish or the sprig of a rose-bush, one would let it grow wherever it might wish.", "zh": "倘若它是萝卜或玫瑰的幼苗，我们可以任由它茁壮成长；倘若它是有毒的植物，一经认出，我们就必须马上拔除。", "t": [28850, 35075]}, {"en": "But when it is a bad plant, one must destroy it as soon as possible, the very first instant that one recognizes it.", "zh": "小王子的星球上埋着可怕的种子……这就是猴面包树的种子，星球的土壤饱受其害，不及时动手除掉它们，你就永远别想摆脱它们的侵害。", "t": [35075, 41913]}]}, {"id": "ch05p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Now there were some terrible seeds on the planet that was the home of the little prince; and these were the seeds of the baobab.", "zh": "小王子的星球上埋着可怕的种子……这就是猴面包树的种子，星球的土壤饱受其害，不及时动手除掉它们，你就永远别想摆脱它们的侵害。", "t": [125, 6638]}, {"en": "The soil of that planet was infested with them.", "zh": "它的树身枝叶占据整个星球，如果星球小，而猴面包树过多，就会撑破星球。", "t": [6638, 9638]}, {"en": "A baobab is something you will never, never be able to get rid of if you attend to it too late.", "zh": "它的树身枝叶占据整个星球，如果星球小，而猴面包树过多，就会撑破星球。", "t": [9638, 15200]}, {"en": "It spreads over the entire planet.", "zh": "它的树身枝叶占据整个星球，如果星球小，而猴面包树过多，就会撑破星球。", "t": [15200, 17662]}, {"en": "It bores clear through it with its roots.", "zh": "后来小王子对我说：“人早上梳洗之后，一定要小心清理地球，要经常督促自己，要养成良好的习惯。", "t": [17662, 20375]}, {"en": "And if the planet is too small, and the baobabs are too many, they split it in pieces...", "zh": "后来小王子对我说：“人早上梳洗之后，一定要小心清理地球，要经常督促自己，要养成良好的习惯。", "t": [20375, 25337]}]}, {"id": "ch05p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is a question of discipline,\" the little prince said to me later on.", "zh": "猴面包树的苗儿与玫瑰花的苗儿长得极相似，把它们区别开来之后，就要经常督促自己拔除猴面包树苗。", "t": [138, 4225]}, {"en": "\"When you've finished your own toilet in the morning, then it is time to attend to the toilet of your planet, just so, with the greatest care.", "zh": "猴面包树的苗儿与玫瑰花的苗儿长得极相似，把它们区别开来之后，就要经常督促自己拔除猴面包树苗。", "t": [4225, 11962]}, {"en": "You must see to it that you pull up regularly all the baobabs, at the very first moment when they can be distinguished from the rosebushes which they resemble so closely in their earliest youth.", "zh": "” 有一天，他建议我用心画一幅猴面包树的画，要让我们那儿的孩子牢牢记住它。", "t": [11962, 22138]}, {"en": "It is very tedious work,\" the little prince added, \"but very easy.\"", "zh": "他对我说：“有朝一日他们外出旅行，这幅画就派上用场了。", "t": [22138, 26274]}]}, {"id": "ch05p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And one day he said to me: \"You ought to make a beautiful drawing, so that the children where you live can see exactly how all this is.", "zh": "有些时候，耽搁了的工夫造不成多大的恶果，然而对猴面包树的危害却不能轻视。", "t": [138, 7425]}, {"en": "That would be very useful to them if they were to travel some day.", "zh": "我知道，有一颗星球上住着一个懒人，他忽略了剔除三棵猴面包树苗的事儿……” 在小王子的指点下，我画了这个星球。", "t": [7425, 11238]}, {"en": "Sometimes,\" he added, \"there is no harm in putting off a piece of work until another day.", "zh": "我知道，有一颗星球上住着一个懒人，他忽略了剔除三棵猴面包树苗的事儿……” 在小王子的指点下，我画了这个星球。", "t": [11238, 16650]}, {"en": "But when it is a matter of baobabs, that always means a catastrophe.", "zh": "我知道，有一颗星球上住着一个懒人，他忽略了剔除三棵猴面包树苗的事儿……” 在小王子的指点下，我画了这个星球。", "t": [16650, 20962]}, {"en": "I knew a planet that was inhabited by a lazy man.", "zh": "我素来不喜欢装腔作势，摆出一副道学家的面孔训人，但许多人对猴面包树的危害认识不足，在小行星上迷路的人遇到的风险又那么大，我不能不一反平日矜持的常态，大声疾呼：“孩子们，当心猴面包树啊！", "t": [20962, 24488]}, {"en": "He neglected three little bushes...\"", "zh": "我素来不喜欢装腔作势，摆出一副道学家的面孔训人，但许多人对猴面包树的危害认识不足，在小行星上迷路的人遇到的风险又那么大，我不能不一反平日矜持的常态，大声疾呼：“孩子们，当心猴面包树啊！", "t": [24488, 26600]}]}, {"id": "ch05p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So, as the little prince described it to me, I have made a drawing of that planet.", "zh": "我素来不喜欢装腔作势，摆出一副道学家的面孔训人，但许多人对猴面包树的危害认识不足，在小行星上迷路的人遇到的风险又那么大，我不能不一反平日矜持的常态，大声疾呼：“孩子们，当心猴面包树啊！", "t": [125, 5338]}, {"en": "I do not much like to take the tone of a moralist.", "zh": "我素来不喜欢装腔作势，摆出一副道学家的面孔训人，但许多人对猴面包树的危害认识不足，在小行星上迷路的人遇到的风险又那么大，我不能不一反平日矜持的常态，大声疾呼：“孩子们，当心猴面包树啊！", "t": [5338, 8525]}, {"en": "But the danger of the baobabs is so little understood, and such considerable risks would be run by anyone who might get lost on an asteroid, that for once I am breaking through my reserve.", "zh": "”为了向朋友们发出警告，让他们提防早已威胁我们的危险——而他们和我一样，对这样的危险一无所知——我对这幅画下足了功夫。", "t": [8525, 18775]}, {"en": "\"Children,\" I say plainly, \"watch out for the baobabs!\"", "zh": "”为了向朋友们发出警告，让他们提防早已威胁我们的危险——而他们和我一样，对这样的危险一无所知——我对这幅画下足了功夫。", "t": [18775, 22063]}]}, {"id": "ch05p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "My friends, like myself, have been skirting this danger for a long time, without ever knowing it; and so it is for them that I have worked so hard over this drawing.", "zh": "提醒大家警惕危险，是我义不容辞的责任。", "t": [125, 9612]}, {"en": "The lesson which I pass on by this means is worth all the trouble it has cost me.", "zh": "也许你们看了这幅画后会纳闷：“为什么他在这本书里画的其他画没有这张猴面包树的画雄壮，有气势？", "t": [9612, 13988]}]}, {"id": "ch05p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Perhaps you will ask me, \"Why are there no other drawing in this book as magnificent and impressive as this drawing of the baobabs?\"", "zh": "也许你们看了这幅画后会纳闷：“为什么他在这本书里画的其他画没有这张猴面包树的画雄壮，有气势？", "t": [100, 6887]}]}, {"id": "ch05p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The reply is simple.", "zh": "”我的回答很简单：我尽了力去画其他的画，但心有余而力不足。", "t": [138, 1875]}, {"en": "I have tried.", "zh": "”我的回答很简单：我尽了力去画其他的画，但心有余而力不足。", "t": [1875, 3212]}, {"en": "But with the others I have not been successful.", "zh": "”我的回答很简单：我尽了力去画其他的画，但心有余而力不足。", "t": [3212, 6288]}, {"en": "When I made the drawing of the baobabs I was carried beyond myself by the inspiring force of urgent necessity.", "zh": "而画猴面包树的时候，为急迫的需要所激励，我的画便超出了原有的水平。", "t": [6288, 12463]}]}]}, {"id": "ch06", "title_en": "Chapter VI", "title_zh": "第 6 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch06p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Oh, little prince!", "zh": "小王子！", "t": [125, 1925]}, {"en": "Bit by bit I came to understand the secrets of your sad little life...", "zh": "我就是这样逐渐了解到，你过着并不顺心愉快的生活。", "t": [1925, 6362]}, {"en": "For a long time you had found your only entertainment in the quiet pleasure of looking at the sunset.", "zh": "长期以来，你惟一的消遣就是观赏夕阳西下的美景。", "t": [6362, 12112]}, {"en": "I learned that new detail on the morning of the fourth day, when you said to me:", "zh": "你对我说： “我喜欢夕阳。", "t": [12112, 16338]}]}, {"id": "ch06p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am very fond of sunsets.", "zh": "我们去看日落的壮观吧……” “可是要等啊……” “等什么？", "t": [138, 2350]}, {"en": "Come, let us go look at a sunset now.\"", "zh": "我们去看日落的壮观吧……” “可是要等啊……” “等什么？", "t": [2350, 4850]}]}, {"id": "ch06p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But we must wait,\" I said.", "zh": "” “等太阳下山的时刻呀。", "t": [100, 1975]}]}, {"id": "ch06p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Wait?", "zh": "” “等太阳下山的时刻呀。", "t": [125, 1012]}, {"en": "For what?\"", "zh": "” “等太阳下山的时刻呀。", "t": [1012, 1788]}]}, {"id": "ch06p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"For the sunset.", "zh": "” “等太阳下山的时刻呀。", "t": [112, 1600]}, {"en": "We must wait until it is time.\"", "zh": "” “等太阳下山的时刻呀。", "t": [1600, 3538]}]}, {"id": "ch06p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "At first you seemed to be very much surprised.", "zh": "” 你露出惊讶的神气，然后又自觉可笑，说道： “我老以为我是在自己家里呢！", "t": [138, 3225]}, {"en": "And then you laughed to yourself.", "zh": "” 你露出惊讶的神气，然后又自觉可笑，说道： “我老以为我是在自己家里呢！", "t": [3225, 5262]}, {"en": "You said to me:", "zh": "” 这话说得不错。", "t": [5262, 6200]}]}, {"id": "ch06p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am always thinking that I am at home!\"", "zh": "” 这话说得不错。", "t": [138, 2388]}]}, {"id": "ch06p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Just so.", "zh": "” 这话说得不错。", "t": [100, 1300]}, {"en": "Everybody knows that when it is noon in the United States the sun is setting over France.", "zh": "大家都知道，在美国，太阳正在天空的当中，而这时在法国，太阳已经西下。", "t": [1300, 6250]}]}, {"id": "ch06p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "If you could fly to France in one minute, you could go straight into the sunset, right from noon.", "zh": "若能在一分钟之内赶到法国，就可以观看落日的壮景，遗憾的是法国离得太远了。", "t": [138, 5812]}, {"en": "Unfortunately, France is too far away for that.", "zh": "但是，在你那小小的星球上，你只要把椅子挪几步就能看到日落了。", "t": [5812, 9262]}, {"en": "But on your tiny planet, my little prince, all you need do is move your chair a few steps.", "zh": "但是，在你那小小的星球上，你只要把椅子挪几步就能看到日落了。", "t": [9262, 15025]}, {"en": "You can see the day end and the twilight falling whenever you like...", "zh": "什么时候要看夕晖都能看得到…… “有一天，我看了四十三次太阳下山！", "t": [15025, 18700]}]}, {"id": "ch06p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"One day,\" you said to me, \"I saw the sunset forty-four times!\"", "zh": "什么时候要看夕晖都能看得到…… “有一天，我看了四十三次太阳下山！", "t": [125, 4188]}]}, {"id": "ch06p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And a little later you added:", "zh": "” 过了一会儿，你又说： “你知道……一个人愁闷的时候，都爱看西下的夕阳……” “看了四十三次太阳西下的那一天，你的心情差得很吧？", "t": [112, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch06p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know-- one loves the sunset, when one is so sad...\"", "zh": "” 过了一会儿，你又说： “你知道……一个人愁闷的时候，都爱看西下的夕阳……” “看了四十三次太阳西下的那一天，你的心情差得很吧？", "t": [125, 3300]}]}, {"id": "ch06p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Were you so sad, then?\" I asked, \"on the day of the forty-four sunsets?\"", "zh": "” 小王子没有答话。", "t": [112, 5226]}]}, {"id": "ch06p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince made no reply.", "zh": "” 小王子没有答话。", "t": [100, 2312]}]}]}, {"id": "ch07", "title_en": "Chapter VII", "title_zh": "第 7 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch07p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On the fifth day-- again, as always, it was thanks to the sheep-- the secret of the little prince's life was revealed to me.", "zh": "第五天，仍然是多亏了那只绵羊，小王子生活中的秘密才被泄露了出来。", "t": [138, 6912]}, {"en": "Abruptly, without anything to lead up to it, and as if the question had been born of long and silent meditation on his problem, he demanded:", "zh": "他似乎对一个问题反复思考了许久，然后开门见山，直截了当地突然问我： “绵羊吃灌木，它也吃花吗？", "t": [6912, 14913]}]}, {"id": "ch07p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A sheep-- if it eats little bushes, does it eat flowers, too?\"", "zh": "” “绵羊遇见什么吃什么。", "t": [112, 3974]}]}, {"id": "ch07p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A sheep,\" I answered, \"eats anything it finds in its reach.\"", "zh": "” “带刺的花也吃？", "t": [138, 3800]}]}, {"id": "ch07p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Even flowers that have thorns?\"", "zh": "带刺的花也吃。", "t": [112, 1974]}]}, {"id": "ch07p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, even flowers that have thorns.\"", "zh": "” “那刺还有什么作用呢？", "t": [138, 2537]}]}, {"id": "ch07p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then the thorns-- what use are they?\"", "zh": "” 我不知道刺还有什么作用。", "t": [125, 1937]}]}, {"id": "ch07p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not know.", "zh": "” 我不知道刺还有什么作用。", "t": [112, 1562]}, {"en": "At that moment I was very busy trying to unscrew a bolt that had got stuck in my engine.", "zh": "当时我正忙于把发动机上拧得过紧的螺栓弄下来。", "t": [1562, 6800]}, {"en": "I was very much worried, for it was becoming clear to me that the breakdown of my plane was extremely serious.", "zh": "看来故障极其严重，我正在犯愁呢。", "t": [6800, 13175]}, {"en": "And I had so little drinking water left that I had to fear for the worst.", "zh": "“那刺还有什么作用呢？", "t": [13175, 17126]}]}, {"id": "ch07p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The thorns-- what use are they?\"", "zh": "” 小王子一旦提出疑问，就要寻根究底，追问个没完，绝不会中途而废。", "t": [138, 1724]}]}, {"id": "ch07p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince never let go of a question, once he had asked it.", "zh": "” 小王子一旦提出疑问，就要寻根究底，追问个没完，绝不会中途而废。", "t": [138, 4275]}, {"en": "As for me, I was upset over that bolt.", "zh": "我正被螺栓闹得心烦意乱，便顺口答道：“刺不起作用，都是因为花儿心眼太坏！", "t": [4275, 7425]}, {"en": "And I answered with the first thing that came into my head:", "zh": "我正被螺栓闹得心烦意乱，便顺口答道：“刺不起作用，都是因为花儿心眼太坏！", "t": [7425, 10424]}]}, {"id": "ch07p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The thorns are of no use at all.", "zh": "” “哦？", "t": [138, 2450]}, {"en": "Flowers have thorns just for spite!\"", "zh": "” “哦？", "t": [2450, 4576]}]}, {"id": "ch07p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!\"", "zh": "” “哦？", "t": [100, 412]}]}, {"id": "ch07p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "There was a moment of complete silence.", "zh": "” 沉默了一会儿，他悻悻地说： “我不信你说的话！", "t": [138, 2800]}, {"en": "Then the little prince flashed back at me, with a kind of resentfulness:", "zh": "花儿弱不禁风，花儿天真无邪，她们自顾不暇呢。", "t": [2800, 6750]}]}, {"id": "ch07p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I don't believe you!", "zh": "花儿弱不禁风，花儿天真无邪，她们自顾不暇呢。", "t": [138, 1600]}, {"en": "Flowers are weak creatures.", "zh": "花儿弱不禁风，花儿天真无邪，她们自顾不暇呢。", "t": [1600, 3812]}, {"en": "They are naive.", "zh": "花儿弱不禁风，花儿天真无邪，她们自顾不暇呢。", "t": [3812, 5138]}, {"en": "They reassure themselves as best they can.", "zh": "她们身上长了刺，是为了给自己壮胆，为了保护自己……” 我不说话。", "t": [5138, 8075]}, {"en": "They believe that their thorns are terrible weapons...\"", "zh": "她们身上长了刺，是为了给自己壮胆，为了保护自己……” 我不说话。", "t": [8075, 10938]}]}, {"id": "ch07p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not answer.", "zh": "这时我的念头是：“如果这颗螺栓拧不下来，我就用锤子把它砸了。", "t": [138, 1688]}, {"en": "At that instant I was saying to myself: \"If this bolt still won't turn, I am going to knock it out with the hammer.\" Again the little prince disturbed my thoughts.", "zh": "这时我的念头是：“如果这颗螺栓拧不下来，我就用锤子把它砸了。", "t": [1688, 10750]}]}, {"id": "ch07p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And you actually believe that the flowers--\"", "zh": "” 小王子打断我的思路： “你相信，你，相信花……” “别烦我了！", "t": [112, 2350]}]}, {"id": "ch07p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, no!\" I cried.", "zh": "别烦我了！", "t": [112, 2525]}, {"en": "\"No, no no!", "zh": "别烦我了！", "t": [2525, 4025]}, {"en": "I don't believe anything.", "zh": "我什么也不信！", "t": [4025, 5838]}, {"en": "I answered you with the first thing that came into my head.", "zh": "我不过在信口开河啊。", "t": [5838, 9250]}, {"en": "Don't you see-- I am very busy with matters of consequence!\"", "zh": "” 他瞪着我，愣住了。", "t": [9250, 12600]}]}, {"id": "ch07p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He stared at me, thunderstruck.", "zh": "“你在忙正经事！", "t": [138, 2213]}]}, {"id": "ch07p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Matters of consequence!\"", "zh": "“你在忙正经事！", "t": [125, 1650]}]}, {"id": "ch07p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He looked at me there, with my hammer in my hand, my fingers black with engine-grease, bending down over an object, which seemed to him extremely ugly...", "zh": "“你说话的时候像个大人！", "t": [138, 8575]}]}, {"id": "ch07p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You talk just like the grown-ups!\"", "zh": "” 听了这话，我有点难为情。", "t": [138, 1975]}]}, {"id": "ch07p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "That made me a little ashamed.", "zh": "然而他又毫不留情地讲了一句： “你是非不分……你混淆黑白！", "t": [138, 2275]}, {"en": "But he went on, relentlessly:", "zh": "然而他又毫不留情地讲了一句： “你是非不分……你混淆黑白！", "t": [2275, 4412]}]}, {"id": "ch07p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You mix everything up together...", "zh": "” 他真的气坏了。", "t": [138, 2288]}, {"en": "You confuse everything...\"", "zh": "” 他真的气坏了。", "t": [2288, 3788]}]}, {"id": "ch07p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was really very angry.", "zh": "一头金发在风中乱摇。", "t": [138, 2112]}, {"en": "He tossed his golden curls in the breeze.", "zh": "一头金发在风中乱摇。", "t": [2112, 4500]}]}, {"id": "ch07p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I know a planet where there is a certain red-faced gentleman.", "zh": "“我知道一颗行星，上面有一位红脸先生。", "t": [138, 3838]}, {"en": "He has never smelled a flower.", "zh": "他从未嗅过一朵花。", "t": [3838, 5988]}, {"en": "He has never looked at a star.", "zh": "他从未观赏过一颗星星。", "t": [5988, 8000]}, {"en": "He has never loved any one.", "zh": "他从未爱过一个人。", "t": [8000, 10000]}, {"en": "He has never done anything in his life but add up figures.", "zh": "他什么事也没干过，只会做算术中的加法。", "t": [10000, 13600]}, {"en": "And all day he says over and over, just like you: 'I am busy with matters of consequence!' And that makes him swell up with pride.", "zh": "他整天就像你一样，反复地唠叨：‘我是个正经人！", "t": [13600, 21675]}, {"en": "But he is not a man-- he is a mushroom!\"", "zh": "’真是自命不凡，神气活现！", "t": [21675, 23875]}]}, {"id": "ch07p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A what?\"", "zh": "可他不是人，是蘑菇！", "t": [112, 813]}]}, {"id": "ch07p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A mushroom!\"", "zh": "可他不是人，是蘑菇！", "t": [100, 912]}]}, {"id": "ch07p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince was now white with rage.", "zh": "” “是什么？", "t": [138, 2512]}]}, {"id": "ch07p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The flowers have been growing thorns for millions of years.", "zh": "” 小王子气得脸色发白。", "t": [138, 3662]}, {"en": "For millions of years the sheep have been eating them just the same.", "zh": "“几百万年以来，花儿都长着刺；几百万年以来，羊也在吃花。", "t": [3662, 7538]}, {"en": "And is it not a matter of consequence to try to understand why the flowers go to so much trouble to grow thorns, which are never of any use to them?", "zh": "难道我想知道，花儿为什么憋足了劲长没用的刺，这是不正经的事吗？", "t": [7538, 15575]}, {"en": "Is the warfare between the sheep and the flowers not important?", "zh": "这不比红脸胖子的加法更正经，更重要吗？", "t": [15575, 19475]}, {"en": "Is this not of more consequence than a fat red-faced gentleman's sums?", "zh": "这不比红脸胖子的加法更正经，更重要吗？", "t": [19475, 23862]}, {"en": "And if I know-- I, myself-- one flower which is unique in the world, which grows nowhere but on my planet, but which one little sheep can destroy in a single bite some morning, without even noticing what he is doing-- Oh!", "zh": "要是我认识的世界上的一朵独一无二的花，她哪儿也不去，就爱长在我的星球上，可是却在某天早晨，被小绵羊一不留神咬死了，难道这样的事也不重要吗？", "t": [23862, 35900]}, {"en": "You think that is not important!\"", "zh": "要是我认识的世界上的一朵独一无二的花，她哪儿也不去，就爱长在我的星球上，可是却在某天早晨，被小绵羊一不留神咬死了，难道这样的事也不重要吗？", "t": [35900, 37737]}]}, {"id": "ch07p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "His face turned from white to red as he continued:", "zh": "” 他的脸由白转红，然后说： “要是有个人爱上了一朵花，这朵花不长在亿万颗星球上，只长在他的星球上，而他只要仰望星空，想到‘我的花儿就在那儿……’，心就陶醉在幸福里，羊却吃了他心爱的花——这对他而言，简直是整个星空都黯淡无光了，难道这样的事还不重要吗？", "t": [138, 3100]}]}, {"id": "ch07p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If some one loves a flower, of which just one single blossom grows in all the millions and millions of stars, it is enough to make him happy just to look at the stars.", "zh": "” 他的脸由白转红，然后说： “要是有个人爱上了一朵花，这朵花不长在亿万颗星球上，只长在他的星球上，而他只要仰望星空，想到‘我的花儿就在那儿……’，心就陶醉在幸福里，羊却吃了他心爱的花——这对他而言，简直是整个星空都黯淡无光了，难道这样的事还不重要吗？", "t": [138, 9250]}, {"en": "He can say to himself, 'Somewhere, my flower is there...' But if the sheep eats the flower, in one moment all his stars will be darkened...", "zh": "” 他的脸由白转红，然后说： “要是有个人爱上了一朵花，这朵花不长在亿万颗星球上，只长在他的星球上，而他只要仰望星空，想到‘我的花儿就在那儿……’，心就陶醉在幸福里，羊却吃了他心爱的花——这对他而言，简直是整个星空都黯淡无光了，难道这样的事还不重要吗？", "t": [9250, 18075]}, {"en": "And you think that is not important!\" He could not say anything more.", "zh": "” 他说不出话来，突然嚎啕大哭。", "t": [18075, 22538]}, {"en": "His words were choked by sobbing.", "zh": "” 他说不出话来，突然嚎啕大哭。", "t": [22538, 24512]}]}, {"id": "ch07p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The night had fallen.", "zh": "” 他说不出话来，突然嚎啕大哭。", "t": [138, 1750]}, {"en": "I had let my tools drop from my hands.", "zh": "夜幕降临，我扔下手里的工具，顾不得锤子、螺栓、干渴、死亡了。", "t": [1750, 4550]}, {"en": "Of what moment now was my hammer, my bolt, or thirst, or death?", "zh": "夜幕降临，我扔下手里的工具，顾不得锤子、螺栓、干渴、死亡了。", "t": [4550, 9362]}, {"en": "On one star, one planet, my planet, the Earth, there was a little prince to be comforted.", "zh": "在一颗星球上，在我的行星地球上，有一个小王子需要安慰！", "t": [9362, 15425]}, {"en": "I took him in my arms, and rocked him.", "zh": "我把他搂进怀里，轻柔地摇着他。", "t": [15425, 18050]}, {"en": "I said to him:", "zh": "我把他搂进怀里，轻柔地摇着他。", "t": [18050, 19050]}]}, {"id": "ch07p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The flower that you love is not in danger.", "zh": "我把他搂进怀里，轻柔地摇着他。", "t": [138, 2950]}, {"en": "I will draw you a muzzle for your sheep.", "zh": "我把他搂进怀里，轻柔地摇着他。", "t": [2950, 5488]}, {"en": "I will draw you a railing to put around your flower.", "zh": "我抚慰他：“你爱的那朵花不会有危险的……我给你的绵羊画一个口罩……我给你的花儿画一副铠甲……我……”我也不知道我还说了什么话，只觉得自己笨嘴笨舌，不懂得该怎样安慰他，打动他……眼泪的王国太神秘了。", "t": [5488, 8612]}, {"en": "I will--\"", "zh": "我抚慰他：“你爱的那朵花不会有危险的……我给你的绵羊画一个口罩……我给你的花儿画一副铠甲……我……”我也不知道我还说了什么话，只觉得自己笨嘴笨舌，不懂得该怎样安慰他，打动他……眼泪的王国太神秘了。", "t": [8612, 9250]}]}, {"id": "ch07p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not know what to say to him.", "zh": "我抚慰他：“你爱的那朵花不会有危险的……我给你的绵羊画一个口罩……我给你的花儿画一副铠甲……我……”我也不知道我还说了什么话，只觉得自己笨嘴笨舌，不懂得该怎样安慰他，打动他……眼泪的王国太神秘了。", "t": [138, 2338]}, {"en": "I felt awkward and blundering.", "zh": "我抚慰他：“你爱的那朵花不会有危险的……我给你的绵羊画一个口罩……我给你的花儿画一副铠甲……我……”我也不知道我还说了什么话，只觉得自己笨嘴笨舌，不懂得该怎样安慰他，打动他……眼泪的王国太神秘了。", "t": [2338, 4550]}, {"en": "I did not know how I could reach him, where I could overtake him and go on hand in hand with him once more.", "zh": "我抚慰他：“你爱的那朵花不会有危险的……我给你的绵羊画一个口罩……我给你的花儿画一副铠甲……我……”我也不知道我还说了什么话，只觉得自己笨嘴笨舌，不懂得该怎样安慰他，打动他……眼泪的王国太神秘了。", "t": [4550, 9950]}]}, {"id": "ch07p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It is such a secret place, the land of tears.", "zh": "我抚慰他：“你爱的那朵花不会有危险的……我给你的绵羊画一个口罩……我给你的花儿画一副铠甲……我……”我也不知道我还说了什么话，只觉得自己笨嘴笨舌，不懂得该怎样安慰他，打动他……眼泪的王国太神秘了。", "t": [138, 3025]}]}]}, {"id": "ch08", "title_en": "Chapter VIII", "title_zh": "第 8 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch08p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I soon learned to know this flower better.", "zh": "我很快就对这朵花有了更深的了解。", "t": [138, 2825]}, {"en": "On the little prince's planet the flowers had always been very simple.", "zh": "我很快就对这朵花有了更深的了解。", "t": [2825, 7150]}, {"en": "They had only one ring of petals; they took up no room at all; they were a trouble to nobody.", "zh": "小王子生活的星球上长着很朴素的单瓣花，她们一点儿也不占地方，也不扰人，在草地上朝开暮落。", "t": [7150, 12688]}, {"en": "One morning they would appear in the grass, and by night they would have faded peacefully away.", "zh": "而这朵花的种子不知道是从哪儿来的。", "t": [12688, 17875]}, {"en": "But one day, from a seed blown from no one knew where, a new flower had come up; and the little prince had watched very closely over this small sprout which was not like any other small sprouts on his planet.", "zh": "她很可能是新品种的猴面包树苗呢。", "t": [17875, 29100]}, {"en": "It might, you see, have been a new kind of baobab.", "zh": "小王子看着硕大的花苞，预感到她会绽放出奇异的花朵。", "t": [29100, 32413]}]}, {"id": "ch08p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The shrub soon stopped growing, and began to get ready to produce a flower.", "zh": "然而花儿躲在绿莹莹的屋子里精心打扮。", "t": [138, 4700]}, {"en": "The little prince, who was present at the first appearance of a huge bud, felt at once that some sort of miraculous apparition must emerge from it.", "zh": "颜色，慢条斯理地穿衣，一片片地搭配她的花瓣。", "t": [4700, 13125]}, {"en": "But the flower was not satisfied to complete the preparations for her beauty in the shelter of her green chamber.", "zh": "她不肯像虞美人那样，皱巴巴地就往外跑，就亮相。", "t": [13125, 19550]}, {"en": "She chose her colours with the greatest care.", "zh": "唉！", "t": [19550, 22412]}, {"en": "She adjusted her petals one by one.", "zh": "不错，她就是朵极爱俏的花儿。", "t": [22412, 25150]}, {"en": "She did not wish to go out into the world all rumpled, like the field poppies.", "zh": "她神秘兮兮地梳妆打扮了好几天，终于在一天早晨，在太阳出来的那一刻，她露脸亮相了。", "t": [25150, 29988]}, {"en": "It was only in the full radiance of her beauty that she wished to appear.", "zh": "她神秘兮兮地梳妆打扮了好几天，终于在一天早晨，在太阳出来的那一刻，她露脸亮相了。", "t": [29988, 34125]}, {"en": "Oh, yes!", "zh": "精心打扮了几天，算准了出场的时间，她却打着哈欠说： “唉！", "t": [34125, 35475]}, {"en": "She was a coquettish creature!", "zh": "精心打扮了几天，算准了出场的时间，她却打着哈欠说： “唉！", "t": [35475, 37475]}, {"en": "And her mysterious adornment lasted for days and days.", "zh": "精心打扮了几天，算准了出场的时间，她却打着哈欠说： “唉！", "t": [37475, 40800]}]}, {"id": "ch08p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then one morning, exactly at sunrise, she suddenly showed herself.", "zh": "我刚刚睡醒呢……请你原谅……我的妆还零乱呢……” 小王子忍不住赞叹： “您真美啊！", "t": [125, 4376]}]}, {"id": "ch08p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, after working with all this painstaking precision, she yawned and said:", "zh": "我刚刚睡醒呢……请你原谅……我的妆还零乱呢……” 小王子忍不住赞叹： “您真美啊！", "t": [138, 4750]}]}, {"id": "ch08p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "我刚刚睡醒呢……请你原谅……我的妆还零乱呢……” 小王子忍不住赞叹： “您真美啊！", "t": [100, 838]}, {"en": "I am scarcely awake.", "zh": "我刚刚睡醒呢……请你原谅……我的妆还零乱呢……” 小王子忍不住赞叹： “您真美啊！", "t": [838, 2638]}, {"en": "I beg that you will excuse me.", "zh": "” “是吗，”花儿柔声说，“我和太阳同时诞生……” 小王子看准她并非谦恭的女子，不过，她确实美丽动人！", "t": [2638, 4838]}, {"en": "My petals are still all disarranged...\"", "zh": "” “是吗，”花儿柔声说，“我和太阳同时诞生……” 小王子看准她并非谦恭的女子，不过，她确实美丽动人！", "t": [4838, 7212]}]}, {"id": "ch08p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince could not restrain his admiration:", "zh": "” “是吗，”花儿柔声说，“我和太阳同时诞生……” 小王子看准她并非谦恭的女子，不过，她确实美丽动人！", "t": [100, 3275]}]}, {"id": "ch08p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!", "zh": "” “是吗，”花儿柔声说，“我和太阳同时诞生……” 小王子看准她并非谦恭的女子，不过，她确实美丽动人！", "t": [100, 800]}, {"en": "How beautiful you are!\"", "zh": "” “是吗，”花儿柔声说，“我和太阳同时诞生……” 小王子看准她并非谦恭的女子，不过，她确实美丽动人！", "t": [800, 2050]}]}, {"id": "ch08p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Am I not?\" the flower responded, sweetly.", "zh": "“是吃早点的时候了吧。", "t": [125, 3562]}, {"en": "\"And I was born at the same moment as the sun...\"", "zh": "“是吃早点的时候了吧。", "t": [3562, 6187]}]}, {"id": "ch08p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince could guess easily enough that she was not any too modest-- but how moving-- and exciting-- she was!", "zh": "”很快她又说。", "t": [112, 6025]}]}, {"id": "ch08p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I think it is time for breakfast,\" she added an instant later.", "zh": "“劳驾您给我……” 小王子为自己的疏忽而感到羞惭，赶紧找了一壶清水，侍候花儿用餐。", "t": [138, 4162]}, {"en": "\"If you would have the kindness to think of my needs--\"", "zh": "不久，她爱慕虚荣的性情开始折磨他。", "t": [4162, 6788]}]}, {"id": "ch08p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince, completely abashed, went to look for a sprinkling-can of fresh water.", "zh": "例如，有一天，她对小王子说到她身上长的四根刺的用途。", "t": [138, 5788]}, {"en": "So, he tended the flower.", "zh": "例如，有一天，她对小王子说到她身上长的四根刺的用途。", "t": [5788, 7687]}]}, {"id": "ch08p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So, too, she began very quickly to torment him with her vanity-- which was, if the truth be known, a little difficult to deal with.", "zh": "她说： “这儿也许有老虎吧，老虎的爪子锋利得很呢！", "t": [125, 8100]}, {"en": "One day, for instance, when she was speaking of her four thorns, she said to the little prince:", "zh": "再说，老虎不吃草。", "t": [8100, 13537]}]}, {"id": "ch08p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Let the tigers come with their claws!\"", "zh": "”花儿柔声说。", "t": [112, 2175]}]}, {"id": "ch08p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"There are no tigers on my planet,\" the little prince objected.", "zh": "“对不起……” “我一点也不畏惧老虎，但我讨厌风。", "t": [138, 4138]}, {"en": "\"And, anyway, tigers do not eat weeds.\"", "zh": "“对不起……” “我一点也不畏惧老虎，但我讨厌风。", "t": [4138, 6962]}]}, {"id": "ch08p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am not a weed,\" the flower replied, sweetly.", "zh": "您没有屏风吗？", "t": [138, 3263]}]}, {"id": "ch08p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Please excuse me...\"", "zh": "” “你居然讨厌风啊……这可不好。", "t": [112, 1312]}]}, {"id": "ch08p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am not at all afraid of tigers,\" she went on, \"but I have a horror of drafts.", "zh": "”小王子对她有了看法。", "t": [138, 5225]}, {"en": "I suppose you wouldn't have a screen for me?\"", "zh": "“这朵花倒很复杂……” “晚上您用罩子把我罩起来吧。", "t": [5225, 7437]}]}, {"id": "ch08p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A horror of drafts-- that is bad luck, for a plant,\" remarked the little prince, and added to himself, \"This flower is a very complex creature...\"", "zh": "您这儿太冷，位置不好。", "t": [125, 8362]}]}, {"id": "ch08p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"At night I want you to put me under a glass globe.", "zh": "来这儿的时候她还是一颗种子呢，怎么可能了解别的地方呢。", "t": [138, 3325]}, {"en": "It is very cold where you live.", "zh": "来这儿的时候她还是一颗种子呢，怎么可能了解别的地方呢。", "t": [3325, 5575]}, {"en": "In the place I came from--\"", "zh": "她撒的谎幼稚可笑，让人一下子就能识破。", "t": [5575, 7025]}]}, {"id": "ch08p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But she interrupted herself at that point.", "zh": "她撒的谎幼稚可笑，让人一下子就能识破。", "t": [100, 2875]}, {"en": "She had come in the form of a seed.", "zh": "她撒的谎幼稚可笑，让人一下子就能识破。", "t": [2875, 5212]}, {"en": "She could not have known anything of any other worlds.", "zh": "她觉得丢脸，便咳嗽了两三声，想把过错推到小王子身上去： “我要的屏风呢？", "t": [5212, 8500]}, {"en": "Embarrassed over having let herself be caught on the verge of such a naïve untruth, she coughed two or three times, in order to put the little prince in the wrong.", "zh": "……” “我正要去找屏风，是您和我说话的呀！", "t": [8500, 16875]}]}, {"id": "ch08p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The screen?\"", "zh": "” 她又故意咳嗽，存心让他内疚不安。", "t": [138, 862]}]}, {"id": "ch08p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I was just going to look for it when you spoke to me...\"", "zh": "” 她又故意咳嗽，存心让他内疚不安。", "t": [138, 2737]}]}, {"id": "ch08p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then she forced her cough a little more so that he should suffer from remorse just the same.", "zh": "小王子很怜爱她，但她的做作令他生疑。", "t": [138, 4688]}]}, {"id": "ch08p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So the little prince, in spite of all the good will that was inseparable from his love, had soon come to doubt her.", "zh": "他是个做事一丝不苟的人，常把无关紧要的闲话当真，难免招来不少麻烦。", "t": [125, 6712]}, {"en": "He had taken seriously words, which were without importance, and it made him very unhappy.", "zh": "有一天，他向我倾诉他的心事：“我本不该听信她的话的。", "t": [6712, 12037]}]}, {"id": "ch08p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I ought not to have listened to her,\" he confided to me one day.", "zh": "永远也别信花儿讲的话。", "t": [138, 4175]}, {"en": "\"One never ought to listen to the flowers.", "zh": "她们的作用就是供人观赏，供人嗅闻。", "t": [4175, 6825]}, {"en": "One should simply look at them and breathe their fragrance.", "zh": "我的花熏香了我的星球，但我不懂得为此高兴。", "t": [6825, 10250]}, {"en": "Mine perfumed all my planet.", "zh": "我的花熏香了我的星球，但我不懂得为此高兴。", "t": [10250, 12588]}, {"en": "But I did not know how to take pleasure in all her grace.", "zh": "她说的老虎爪子的话，本来应该打动我的心，我却生了她的气。", "t": [12588, 16162]}, {"en": "This tale of claws, which disturbed me so much, should only have filled my heart with tenderness and pity.\"", "zh": "” 他还说： “那时我真是不懂事。", "t": [16162, 22088]}]}, {"id": "ch08p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he continued his confidences:", "zh": "要对一个人下定论，不应听其言，而应观其行。", "t": [112, 2338]}]}, {"id": "ch08p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The fact is that I did not know how to understand anything!", "zh": "要对一个人下定论，不应听其言，而应观其行。", "t": [138, 3725]}, {"en": "I ought to have judged by deeds and not by words.", "zh": "她芬芳馥郁，赏心悦目，我不应抛下她一走了之！", "t": [3725, 7000]}, {"en": "She cast her fragrance and her radiance over me.", "zh": "我不理解她那不聪明的谎言饱含的深情。", "t": [7000, 10262]}, {"en": "I ought never to have run away from her...", "zh": "我不理解她那不聪明的谎言饱含的深情。", "t": [10262, 12875]}, {"en": "I ought to have guessed all the affection that lay behind her poor little stratagems.", "zh": "花儿是缺点不少、但优点也很多的矛盾的东西！", "t": [12875, 17700]}, {"en": "Flowers are so inconsistent!", "zh": "那时我年纪太轻，不懂得珍惜她，爱她。", "t": [17700, 20075]}, {"en": "But I was too young to know how to love her...\"", "zh": "那时我年纪太轻，不懂得珍惜她，爱她。", "t": [20075, 22500]}]}]}, {"id": "ch09", "title_en": "Chapter IX", "title_zh": "第 9 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch09p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I believe that for his escape he took advantage of the migration of a flock of wild birds.", "zh": "我估计他是趁候鸟迁徙时出走的。", "t": [138, 5812]}, {"en": "On the morning of his departure he put his planet in perfect order.", "zh": "出走的那天早晨，他认真收拾整理他的星球，仔细疏通火山口。", "t": [5812, 9875]}, {"en": "He carefully cleaned out his active volcanoes.", "zh": "他有两座活火山，热早饭挺方便的。", "t": [9875, 13138]}, {"en": "He possessed two active volcanoes; and they were very convenient for heating his breakfast in the morning.", "zh": "可是正如他说的：“日后的事很难说！", "t": [13138, 19062]}, {"en": "He also had one volcano that was extinct.", "zh": "”谁知道死火山会不会变活呢？", "t": [19062, 22262]}, {"en": "But, as he said, \"One never knows!\" So he cleaned out the extinct volcano, too.", "zh": "所以他也疏通死火山。", "t": [22262, 28525]}, {"en": "If they are well cleaned out, volcanoes burn slowly and steadily, without any eruptions.", "zh": "火山喷发的道理与炉火一样。", "t": [28525, 34338]}, {"en": "Volcanic eruptions are like fires in a chimney.", "zh": "我们这些人太渺小，没有疏通火山的能力，所以火山才给我们造成很多麻烦。", "t": [34338, 37263]}]}, {"id": "ch09p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On our earth we are obviously much too small to clean out our volcanoes.", "zh": "我们这些人太渺小，没有疏通火山的能力，所以火山才给我们造成很多麻烦。", "t": [138, 4688]}, {"en": "That is why they bring no end of trouble upon us.", "zh": "小王子闷闷地拔除了最后几棵猴面包树苗。", "t": [4688, 7500]}]}, {"id": "ch09p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince also pulled up, with a certain sense of dejection, the last little shoots of the baobabs.", "zh": "他知道自己不会再回来了。", "t": [138, 6588]}, {"en": "He believed that he would never want to return.", "zh": "那天早晨，他觉得所有的家务活干起来都挺亲切的。", "t": [6588, 9475]}, {"en": "But on this last morning all these familiar tasks seemed very precious to him.", "zh": "最后一次给花儿浇水，准备给她盖上罩子，他竟觉得他想哭。", "t": [9475, 14300]}, {"en": "And when he watered the flower for the last time, and prepared to place her under the shelter of her glass globe, he realised that he was very close to tears.", "zh": "”他又说。", "t": [14300, 22413]}]}, {"id": "ch09p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" he said to the flower.", "zh": "她终于对他说：“我以前真傻，请你原谅。", "t": [100, 2137]}]}, {"id": "ch09p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But she made no answer.", "zh": "好好地享受生活吧，愿你幸福。", "t": [100, 1562]}]}, {"id": "ch09p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" he said again.", "zh": "好好地享受生活吧，愿你幸福。", "t": [112, 1750]}]}, {"id": "ch09p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The flower coughed.", "zh": "好好地享受生活吧，愿你幸福。", "t": [112, 1612]}, {"en": "But it was not because she had a cold.", "zh": "” 她并没有责备他的意思。", "t": [1612, 3687]}]}, {"id": "ch09p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have been silly,\" she said to him, at last.", "zh": "他觉得挺意外。", "t": [138, 3388]}, {"en": "\"I ask your forgiveness.", "zh": "他不知所措地站在那儿，高举着罩子。", "t": [3388, 5175]}, {"en": "Try to be happy...\"", "zh": "他不知所措地站在那儿，高举着罩子。", "t": [5175, 6337]}]}, {"id": "ch09p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was surprised by this absence of reproaches.", "zh": "他不理解她的脉脉深情。", "t": [138, 3375]}, {"en": "He stood there all bewildered, the glass globe held arrested in mid-air.", "zh": "“是的，我爱你，”花儿对他说，“你丝毫没察觉到我对你的爱，这是我的错。", "t": [3375, 7788]}, {"en": "He did not understand this quiet sweetness.", "zh": "如今说也没用了。", "t": [7788, 10424]}]}, {"id": "ch09p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Of course I love you,\" the flower said to him.", "zh": "如今说也没用了。", "t": [112, 3125]}, {"en": "\"It is my fault that you have not known it all the while.", "zh": "好好地享受生活吧，愿你幸福……你把这罩子放一边去吧，我不需要它。", "t": [3125, 6312]}, {"en": "That is of no importance.", "zh": "好好地享受生活吧，愿你幸福……你把这罩子放一边去吧，我不需要它。", "t": [6312, 8350]}, {"en": "But you-- you have been just as foolish as I.", "zh": "好好地享受生活吧，愿你幸福……你把这罩子放一边去吧，我不需要它。", "t": [8350, 10525]}, {"en": "Try to be happy...", "zh": "” “可是风……” “我并非如此的弱不禁风……清新的夜风对我的健康有好处，我是一朵花儿嘛。", "t": [10525, 11912]}, {"en": "let the glass globe be.", "zh": "” “可是风……” “我并非如此的弱不禁风……清新的夜风对我的健康有好处，我是一朵花儿嘛。", "t": [11912, 13550]}, {"en": "I don't want it any more.\"", "zh": "” “可是风……” “我并非如此的弱不禁风……清新的夜风对我的健康有好处，我是一朵花儿嘛。", "t": [13550, 14987]}]}, {"id": "ch09p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But the wind--\"", "zh": "” “可是风……” “我并非如此的弱不禁风……清新的夜风对我的健康有好处，我是一朵花儿嘛。", "t": [100, 975]}]}, {"id": "ch09p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My cold is not so bad as all that...", "zh": "” “可是风……” “我并非如此的弱不禁风……清新的夜风对我的健康有好处，我是一朵花儿嘛。", "t": [138, 2512]}, {"en": "the cool night air will do me good.", "zh": "” “可是动物……” “如果我想认识蝴蝶，就必须能承受两三条毛虫。", "t": [2512, 4562]}, {"en": "I am a flower.\"", "zh": "” “可是动物……” “如果我想认识蝴蝶，就必须能承受两三条毛虫。", "t": [4562, 5612]}]}, {"id": "ch09p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But the animals--\"", "zh": "” “可是动物……” “如果我想认识蝴蝶，就必须能承受两三条毛虫。", "t": [112, 1162]}]}, {"id": "ch09p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Well, I must endure the presence of two or three caterpillars if I wish to become acquainted with the butterflies.", "zh": "这似乎是很美的事。", "t": [138, 6625]}, {"en": "It seems that they are very beautiful.", "zh": "要不，谁会看望我呢？", "t": [6625, 9112]}, {"en": "And if not the butterflies-- and the caterpillars-- who will call upon me?", "zh": "我一点不畏惧大的动物，我有爪子呀。", "t": [9112, 13138]}, {"en": "You will be far away...", "zh": "” 她天真地伸出她的四根刺。", "t": [13138, 14662]}, {"en": "as for the large animals-- I am not at all afraid of any of them.", "zh": "” 她天真地伸出她的四根刺。", "t": [14662, 18300]}, {"en": "I have my claws.\"", "zh": "然后又说： “别婆婆妈妈，磨磨蹭蹭的了，闹得人心乱。", "t": [18300, 19487]}]}, {"id": "ch09p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, naïvely, she showed her four thorns.", "zh": "然后又说： “别婆婆妈妈，磨磨蹭蹭的了，闹得人心乱。", "t": [138, 3438]}, {"en": "Then she added:", "zh": "你既已下了决心，那就走吧。", "t": [3438, 4526]}]}, {"id": "ch09p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Don't linger like this.", "zh": "你既已下了决心，那就走吧。", "t": [112, 1850]}, {"en": "You have decided to go away.", "zh": "” 她不愿让小王子看见她哭。", "t": [1850, 4000]}, {"en": "Now go!\"", "zh": "” 她不愿让小王子看见她哭。", "t": [4000, 4662]}]}, {"id": "ch09p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For she did not want him to see her crying.", "zh": "” 她不愿让小王子看见她哭。", "t": [125, 2738]}, {"en": "She was such a proud flower...", "zh": "她是一朵多么骄傲的花儿哟……", "t": [2738, 4575]}]}]}, {"id": "ch10", "title_en": "Chapter X", "title_zh": "第 10 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch10p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He found himself in the neighbourhood of the asteroids 325, 326, 327, 328, 329, and 330.", "zh": "他居住的星球位于小行星325号、326号、327号、328号、329号、330号所在的地区。", "t": [125, 11112]}, {"en": "He began, therefore, by visiting them, in order to add to his knowledge.", "zh": "他居住的星球位于小行星325号、326号、327号、328号、329号、330号所在的地区。", "t": [11112, 17138]}]}, {"id": "ch10p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The first of them was inhabited by a king.", "zh": "于是他决定首先拜访它们，在那儿找事干，并增长见识。", "t": [138, 3012]}, {"en": "Clad in royal purple and ermine, he was seated upon a throne which was at the same time both simple and majestic.", "zh": "325号行星上住着一位国王。", "t": [3012, 9475]}]}, {"id": "ch10p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "他穿着镶有紫红色袖口和领口的白鼬皮衣服，坐在式样简单然而威严的宝座上。", "t": [100, 850]}, {"en": "Here is a subject,\" exclaimed the king, when he saw the little prince coming.", "zh": "他穿着镶有紫红色袖口和领口的白鼬皮衣服，坐在式样简单然而威严的宝座上。", "t": [850, 5163]}]}, {"id": "ch10p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince asked himself:", "zh": "看见小王子，国王大声嚷： “哈！", "t": [138, 2262]}]}, {"id": "ch10p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"How could he recognize me when he had never seen me before?\"", "zh": "来了一个老百姓。", "t": [125, 3338]}]}, {"id": "ch10p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He did not know how the world is simplified for kings.", "zh": "” 小王子心想： “他从未见过我，怎么认得出我呢？", "t": [125, 3488]}, {"en": "To them, all men are subjects.", "zh": "” 小王子心想： “他从未见过我，怎么认得出我呢？", "t": [3488, 5600]}]}, {"id": "ch10p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Approach, so that I may see you better,\" said the king, who felt consumingly proud of being at last a king over somebody.", "zh": "” 他不知道，国王们把世界看得很简单，他们以为普天下的人都是他的百姓。", "t": [138, 6963]}]}, {"id": "ch10p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince looked everywhere to find a place to sit down; but the entire planet was crammed and obstructed by the king's magnificent ermine robe.", "zh": "他对小王子说：“过来，让我好好地瞧瞧你。", "t": [138, 8612]}, {"en": "So he remained standing upright, and, since he was tired, he yawned.", "zh": "” 小王子用眼睛搜寻可坐之处，可是行星被国王豪华的鼬皮塞满了，他只好站着，因为累了，他打了个哈欠。", "t": [8612, 13225]}]}, {"id": "ch10p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is contrary to etiquette to yawn in the presence of a king,\" the monarch said to him.", "zh": "” 小王子用眼睛搜寻可坐之处，可是行星被国王豪华的鼬皮塞满了，他只好站着，因为累了，他打了个哈欠。", "t": [138, 5162]}, {"en": "\"I forbid you to do so.\"", "zh": "“在国王面前打哈欠，违反礼节，我不准你打哈欠。", "t": [5162, 6688]}]}, {"id": "ch10p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I can't help it.", "zh": "“在国王面前打哈欠，违反礼节，我不准你打哈欠。", "t": [138, 1662]}, {"en": "I can't stop myself,\" replied the little prince, thoroughly embarrassed.", "zh": "”国王说道。", "t": [1662, 6312]}, {"en": "\"I have come on a long journey, and I have had no sleep...\"", "zh": "小王子抱歉地说：“我不是有意的。", "t": [6312, 9526]}]}, {"id": "ch10p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah, then,\" the king said.", "zh": "我长途跋涉，没有睡眠……” “既然如此，”国王对他说，“我命令你打哈欠。", "t": [138, 2475]}, {"en": "\"I order you to yawn.", "zh": "我长途跋涉，没有睡眠……” “既然如此，”国王对他说，“我命令你打哈欠。", "t": [2475, 4175]}, {"en": "It is years since I have seen anyone yawning.", "zh": "我长途跋涉，没有睡眠……” “既然如此，”国王对他说，“我命令你打哈欠。", "t": [4175, 7175]}, {"en": "Yawns, to me, are objects of curiosity.", "zh": "我已经多年没看见别人打哈欠了。", "t": [7175, 10700]}, {"en": "Come, now!", "zh": "我已经多年没看见别人打哈欠了。", "t": [10700, 11900]}, {"en": "Yawn again!", "zh": "我已经多年没看见别人打哈欠了。", "t": [11900, 12962]}, {"en": "It is an order.\"", "zh": "依我看，打哈欠挺好玩的。", "t": [12962, 13962]}]}, {"id": "ch10p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That frightens me...", "zh": "依我看，打哈欠挺好玩的。", "t": [112, 1725]}, {"en": "I cannot, any more...\" murmured the little prince, now completely abashed.", "zh": "这是命令。", "t": [1725, 6837]}]}, {"id": "ch10p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Hum!", "zh": "” “您的命令让我害怕……我打不了……”小王子涨红了脸。", "t": [125, 888]}, {"en": "Hum!\" replied the king.", "zh": "” “您的命令让我害怕……我打不了……”小王子涨红了脸。", "t": [888, 2775]}, {"en": "\"Then I-- I order you sometimes to yawn and sometimes to--\"", "zh": "” “您的命令让我害怕……我打不了……”小王子涨红了脸。", "t": [2775, 6100]}]}, {"id": "ch10p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He sputtered a little, and seemed vexed.", "zh": "“嗯，嗯，”国王说，“那么我……我命令你一会儿打，一会儿不打……” 显然，挨了小王子的冲撞，他有点气恼，话也说不流利了。", "t": [138, 2587]}]}, {"id": "ch10p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For what the king fundamentally insisted upon was that his authority should be respected.", "zh": "“嗯，嗯，”国王说，“那么我……我命令你一会儿打，一会儿不打……” 显然，挨了小王子的冲撞，他有点气恼，话也说不流利了。", "t": [125, 5650]}, {"en": "He tolerated no disobedience.", "zh": "“嗯，嗯，”国王说，“那么我……我命令你一会儿打，一会儿不打……” 显然，挨了小王子的冲撞，他有点气恼，话也说不流利了。", "t": [5650, 8350]}, {"en": "He was an absolute monarch.", "zh": "“嗯，嗯，”国王说，“那么我……我命令你一会儿打，一会儿不打……” 显然，挨了小王子的冲撞，他有点气恼，话也说不流利了。", "t": [8350, 10425]}, {"en": "But, because he was a very good man, he made his orders reasonable.", "zh": "国王最关心的是别人尊重他的权威，他不允许别人违抗他的命令，他是一个典型的专制君王，但他毕竟是个善良之辈，下达的命令都合乎情理。", "t": [10425, 14475]}]}, {"id": "ch10p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If I ordered a general,\" he would say, by way of example, \"if I ordered a general to change himself into a sea bird, and if the general did not obey me, that would not be the fault of the general.", "zh": "国王最关心的是别人尊重他的权威，他不允许别人违抗他的命令，他是一个典型的专制君王，但他毕竟是个善良之辈，下达的命令都合乎情理。", "t": [138, 10762]}, {"en": "It would be my fault.\"", "zh": "“要是我向一个将军下令，要他变成海鸟，将军是不愿服从的。", "t": [10762, 12074]}]}, {"id": "ch10p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"May I sit down?\" came now a timid inquiry from the little prince.", "zh": "这样，错不在将军，错在我身上。", "t": [125, 4187]}]}, {"id": "ch10p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I order you to do so,\" the king answered him, and majestically gathered in a fold of his ermine mantle.", "zh": "“我可以坐下来吗？", "t": [138, 5950]}]}, {"id": "ch10p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince was wondering...", "zh": "“我命令你坐下。", "t": [100, 2438]}, {"en": "The planet was tiny.", "zh": "”国王说，他威风凛凛地一挥白鼬皮皇袍的下摆。", "t": [2438, 4175]}, {"en": "Over what could this king really rule?", "zh": "”国王说，他威风凛凛地一挥白鼬皮皇袍的下摆。", "t": [4175, 6188]}]}, {"id": "ch10p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Sire,\" he said to him, \"I beg that you will excuse my asking you a question--\"", "zh": "小王子有个问题弄不明白：这颗星球小得惊人，国王统治什么？", "t": [125, 4612]}]}, {"id": "ch10p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I order you to ask me a question,\" the king hastened to assure him.", "zh": "小王子有个问题弄不明白：这颗星球小得惊人，国王统治什么？", "t": [138, 3900]}]}, {"id": "ch10p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Sire-- over what do you rule?\"", "zh": "“陛下……”他说，“请原谅我向您提个问题……” “我命令你向我提问题……”国王急忙说。", "t": [125, 1975]}]}, {"id": "ch10p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Over everything,\" said the king, with magnificent simplicity.", "zh": "“陛下……”他说，“请原谅我向您提个问题……” “我命令你向我提问题……”国王急忙说。", "t": [112, 4012]}]}, {"id": "ch10p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Over everything?\"", "zh": "“陛下……您统治什么？", "t": [125, 1176]}]}, {"id": "ch10p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The king made a gesture, which took in his planet, the other planets, and all the stars.", "zh": "” “统治一切！", "t": [138, 5212]}]}, {"id": "ch10p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Over all that?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "” 国王指指他的星球，其他星球，所有的星球。", "t": [125, 2674]}]}, {"id": "ch10p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Over all that,\" the king answered.", "zh": "“所有这一切？", "t": [112, 2200]}]}, {"id": "ch10p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For his rule was not only absolute: it was also universal.", "zh": "“所有这一切……”国王答道。", "t": [125, 4112]}]}, {"id": "ch10p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And the stars obey you?\"", "zh": "因为他不但是个专制君主，还是宇宙之王。", "t": [112, 1588]}]}, {"id": "ch10p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Certainly they do,\" the king said.", "zh": "因为他不但是个专制君主，还是宇宙之王。", "t": [125, 2688]}, {"en": "\"They obey instantly.", "zh": "“所有的星星都听命于您吗？", "t": [2688, 4512]}, {"en": "I do not permit insubordination.\"", "zh": "“所有的星星都听命于您吗？", "t": [4512, 6650]}]}, {"id": "ch10p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Such power was a thing for the little prince to marvel at.", "zh": "” “当然啦，”国王说，“它们令出即行。", "t": [125, 3862]}, {"en": "If he had been master of such complete authority, he would have been able to watch the sunset, not forty-four times in one day, but seventy-two, or even a hundred, or even two hundred times, without ever having to move his chair.", "zh": "” 小王子既赞叹又羡慕国王的权威。", "t": [3862, 16975]}, {"en": "And because he felt a bit sad as he remembered his little planet, which he had forsaken, he plucked up his courage to ask the king a favour:", "zh": "想到被他遗弃的小行星，他有点伤感惆怅。", "t": [16975, 24288]}]}, {"id": "ch10p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I should like to see a sunset...", "zh": "想到被他遗弃的小行星，他有点伤感惆怅。", "t": [138, 2100]}, {"en": "do me that kindness...", "zh": "想到被他遗弃的小行星，他有点伤感惆怅。", "t": [2100, 3750]}, {"en": "Order the sun to set...\"", "zh": "想到被他遗弃的小行星，他有点伤感惆怅。", "t": [3750, 5163]}]}, {"id": "ch10p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If I ordered a general to fly from one flower to another like a butterfly, or to write a tragic drama, or to change himself into a sea bird, and if the general did not carry out the order that he had received, which one of us would be in the wrong?\" the king demanded.", "zh": "他壮壮胆，请求国王开恩： “我想观看夕阳西下……求您开恩……命令太阳下去吧……” “如果我命令将军像蝴蝶那样，在花间飞来飞去，或命令他写一部悲剧，或变成海鸟，如果将军接到命令后不愿执行，你说是他的错还是我的错？", "t": [138, 14238]}, {"en": "\"The general, or myself?\"", "zh": "” “那是您的错。", "t": [14238, 15937]}]}, {"id": "ch10p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You,\" said the little prince firmly.", "zh": "” “那是您的错。", "t": [138, 2350]}]}, {"id": "ch10p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Exactly.", "zh": "”小王子不假思索便脱口而出。", "t": [100, 1350]}, {"en": "One much require from each one the duty which each one can perform,\" the king went on.", "zh": "“你说得对，不能强人所难。", "t": [1350, 6612]}, {"en": "\"Accepted authority rests first of all on reason.", "zh": "“权威首先必须建筑在理性上。", "t": [6612, 10125]}, {"en": "If you ordered your people to go and throw themselves into the sea, they would rise up in revolution.", "zh": "如果你命令你的人民跳海，他们定会造反。", "t": [10125, 15688]}, {"en": "I have the right to require obedience because my orders are reasonable.\"", "zh": "我有命令百姓服从的权利，那是因为我的命令合符情理。", "t": [15688, 19650]}]}, {"id": "ch10p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then my sunset?\" the little prince reminded him: for he never forgot a question once he had asked it.", "zh": "”小王子问道。", "t": [138, 5900]}]}, {"id": "ch10p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You shall have your sunset.", "zh": "一旦提出一个问题，他是不会中途而废的。", "t": [138, 2100]}, {"en": "I shall command it.", "zh": "“你会看到你要求的日落的，我会发布命令。", "t": [2100, 3762]}, {"en": "But, according to my science of government, I shall wait until conditions are favourable.\"", "zh": "“你会看到你要求的日落的，我会发布命令。", "t": [3762, 8813]}]}, {"id": "ch10p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"When will that be?\" inquired the little prince.", "zh": "” “什么时候时机才成熟呢？", "t": [138, 3000]}]}, {"id": "ch10p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Hum!", "zh": "” “什么时候时机才成熟呢？", "t": [125, 875]}, {"en": "Hum!\" replied the king; and before saying anything else he consulted a bulky almanac.", "zh": "”小王子问。", "t": [875, 6412]}, {"en": "\"Hum!", "zh": "“嗯，嗯，首先我要查看大皇历。", "t": [6412, 7150]}, {"en": "Hum!", "zh": "“嗯，嗯，首先我要查看大皇历。", "t": [7150, 7900]}, {"en": "That will be about-- about-- that will be this evening about twenty minutes to eight.", "zh": "嗯，嗯，要等到……今晚……十时四十分左右……左右……你会看到他们怎样执行我的命令。", "t": [7900, 12475]}, {"en": "And you will see how well I am obeyed.\"", "zh": "嗯，嗯，要等到……今晚……十时四十分左右……左右……你会看到他们怎样执行我的命令。", "t": [12475, 14588]}]}, {"id": "ch10p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince yawned.", "zh": "” 小王子打了个哈欠。", "t": [138, 1950]}, {"en": "He was regretting his lost sunset.", "zh": "” 小王子打了个哈欠。", "t": [1950, 4575]}, {"en": "And then, too, he was already beginning to be a little bored.", "zh": "他感到惋惜，因为他的要求泡汤了。", "t": [4575, 8137]}]}, {"id": "ch10p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have nothing more to do here,\" he said to the king.", "zh": "再说，他已经有点儿腻烦了。", "t": [138, 3262]}, {"en": "\"So I shall set out on my way again.\"", "zh": "“我在这儿没事可干了，”他对国王说，“我要告辞了！", "t": [3262, 5487]}]}, {"id": "ch10p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do not go,\" said the king, who was very proud of having a subject.", "zh": "” “你别走。", "t": [100, 4512]}, {"en": "\"Do not go.", "zh": "”国王说，拥有一个百姓，对他来说是一件值得自豪的事。", "t": [4512, 5800]}, {"en": "I will make you a Minister!\"", "zh": "”国王说，拥有一个百姓，对他来说是一件值得自豪的事。", "t": [5800, 7300]}]}, {"id": "ch10p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Minister of what?\"", "zh": "”国王说，拥有一个百姓，对他来说是一件值得自豪的事。", "t": [125, 1388]}]}, {"id": "ch10p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Minster of-- of Justice!\"", "zh": "“别走，我任命你为部长！", "t": [112, 1674]}]}, {"id": "ch10p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But there is nobody here to judge!\"", "zh": "“别走，我任命你为部长！", "t": [100, 1987]}]}, {"id": "ch10p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We do not know that,\" the king said to him.", "zh": "” “哪个部的部长？", "t": [138, 3012]}, {"en": "\"I have not yet made a complete tour of my kingdom.", "zh": "” “可这儿没人可审呀！", "t": [3012, 6188]}, {"en": "I am very old.", "zh": "” “可这儿没人可审呀！", "t": [6188, 7750]}, {"en": "There is no room here for a carriage.", "zh": "” “这可就难说了，”国王说，“我还没视察过我的王国呢。", "t": [7750, 10112]}, {"en": "And it tires me to walk.\"", "zh": "” “这可就难说了，”国王说，“我还没视察过我的王国呢。", "t": [10112, 11637]}]}, {"id": "ch10p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, but I have looked already!\" said the little prince, turning around to give one more glance to the other side of the planet.", "zh": "我上了年纪，这儿又没有停马车的地方，走路又太累了。", "t": [112, 7125]}, {"en": "On that side, as on this, there was nobody at all...", "zh": "” “啊，我已经看过了。", "t": [7125, 10487]}]}, {"id": "ch10p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then you shall judge yourself,\" the king answered.", "zh": "”小王子俯身朝星球的另一端又瞟了一眼。", "t": [112, 3212]}, {"en": "\"that is the most difficult thing of all.", "zh": "“那儿也没一个人……” “你就审你自己吧，”国王说，“这是最难办的事。", "t": [3212, 5738]}, {"en": "It is much more difficult to judge oneself than to judge others.", "zh": "“那儿也没一个人……” “你就审你自己吧，”国王说，“这是最难办的事。", "t": [5738, 9612]}, {"en": "If you succeed in judging yourself rightly, then you are indeed a man of true wisdom.\"", "zh": "审自己比审别人难得多。", "t": [9612, 14350]}]}, {"id": "ch10p48", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes,\" said the little prince, \"but I can judge myself anywhere.", "zh": "” “我嘛，”小王子说，“无论在什么地方我都能审自己，无需住在这儿。", "t": [138, 4312]}, {"en": "I do not need to live on this planet.", "zh": "” “我嘛，”小王子说，“无论在什么地方我都能审自己，无需住在这儿。", "t": [4312, 6387]}]}, {"id": "ch10p49", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Hum!", "zh": "” “我嘛，”小王子说，“无论在什么地方我都能审自己，无需住在这儿。", "t": [125, 888]}, {"en": "Hum!\" said the king.", "zh": "” “嗯，嗯，我知道。", "t": [888, 2575]}, {"en": "\"I have good reason to believe that somewhere on my planet there is an old rat.", "zh": "”国王说。", "t": [2575, 7050]}, {"en": "I hear him at night.", "zh": "“在我的星球的某一处，有一只老耗子。", "t": [7050, 8738]}, {"en": "You can judge this old rat.", "zh": "“在我的星球的某一处，有一只老耗子。", "t": [8738, 10812]}, {"en": "From time to time you will condemn him to death.", "zh": "我在夜里听到的。", "t": [10812, 13838]}, {"en": "Thus his life will depend on your justice.", "zh": "隔一段时间判它一次死刑。", "t": [13838, 16700]}, {"en": "But you will pardon him on each occasion; for he must be treated thriftily.", "zh": "这样，它的死活就由你的裁判决定了。", "t": [16700, 21162]}, {"en": "He is the only one we have.\"", "zh": "但你每一次都要免除它的死罪，你要悠着点，因为就只有这一个犯人了。", "t": [21162, 22887]}]}, {"id": "ch10p50", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I,\" replied the little prince, \"do not like to condemn anyone to death.", "zh": "但你每一次都要免除它的死罪，你要悠着点，因为就只有这一个犯人了。", "t": [138, 4888]}, {"en": "And now I think I will go on my way.\"", "zh": "” “我可不喜欢判人死刑。", "t": [4888, 7000]}]}, {"id": "ch10p51", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No,\" said the king.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [125, 1562]}]}, {"id": "ch10p52", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the little prince, having now completed his preparations for departure, had no wish to grieve the old monarch.", "zh": "” “别走。", "t": [100, 6387]}]}, {"id": "ch10p53", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If Your Majesty wishes to be promptly obeyed,\" he said, \"he should be able to give me a reasonable order.", "zh": "小王子已经做好走的准备，但他不愿伤老国王的心，他对老国王说：“如果陛下您希望令出即行，您可以向我下达合理的命令。", "t": [138, 6275]}, {"en": "He should be able, for example, to order me to be gone by the end of one minute.", "zh": "例如说，可以命令我在一分钟之内离开。", "t": [6275, 11450]}, {"en": "It seems to me that conditions are favourable...\"", "zh": "例如说，可以命令我在一分钟之内离开。", "t": [11450, 14100]}]}, {"id": "ch10p54", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As the king made no answer, the little prince hesitated a moment.", "zh": "我认为时机已经成熟……” 国王一言不发。", "t": [138, 4488]}, {"en": "Then, with a sigh, he took his leave.", "zh": "小王子犹豫片刻，然后叹口气，抬腿走了。", "t": [4488, 6950]}]}, {"id": "ch10p55", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I made you my Ambassador,\" the king called out, hastily.", "zh": "国王急忙大叫：“我封你为大使。", "t": [138, 3625]}]}, {"id": "ch10p56", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He had a magnificent air of authority.", "zh": "” 他摆出威风凛凛的神气。", "t": [125, 2500]}]}, {"id": "ch10p57", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The grown-ups are very strange,\" the little prince said to himself, as he continued on his journey.", "zh": "小王子一面赶路，一面自言自语： “大人们真怪。", "t": [138, 5487]}]}]}, {"id": "ch11", "title_en": "Chapter XI", "title_zh": "第 11 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch11p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The second planet was inhabited by a conceited man.", "zh": "第二颗星球住着一个爱慕虚荣的人。", "t": [138, 3476]}]}, {"id": "ch11p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "“啊！", "t": [100, 825]}, {"en": "Ah!", "zh": "“啊！", "t": [825, 1538]}, {"en": "I am about to receive a visit from an admirer!\" he exclaimed from afar, when he first saw the little prince coming.", "zh": "崇拜我的人访问我啦！", "t": [1538, 7800]}]}, {"id": "ch11p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For, to conceited men, all other men are admirers.", "zh": "爱慕虚荣的人以为别人都崇拜他。", "t": [125, 3650]}]}, {"id": "ch11p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“您好。", "t": [112, 2712]}, {"en": "\"That is a queer hat you are wearing.\"", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [2712, 4600]}]}, {"id": "ch11p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is a hat for salutes,\" the conceited man replied.", "zh": "“您的帽子真怪。", "t": [138, 3750]}, {"en": "\"It is to raise in salute when people acclaim me.", "zh": "” “这顶帽子是用来敬礼的，”爱慕虚荣的人说，“有人向我欢呼的时候，我就用它敬礼。", "t": [3750, 6762]}, {"en": "Unfortunately, nobody at all ever passes this way.\"", "zh": "可惜这儿没一个人来。", "t": [6762, 10087]}]}, {"id": "ch11p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes?\" said the little prince, who did not understand what the conceited man was talking about.", "zh": "” “您说什么？", "t": [138, 5600]}]}, {"id": "ch11p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Clap your hands, one against the other,\" the conceited man now directed him.", "zh": "”爱慕虚荣的人建议。", "t": [112, 4737]}]}, {"id": "ch11p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince clapped his hands.", "zh": "小王子依言鼓掌。", "t": [138, 2525]}, {"en": "The conceited man raised his hat in a modest salute.", "zh": "爱慕虚荣的人举起帽子，态度谦恭地行礼。", "t": [2525, 5800]}]}, {"id": "ch11p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This is more entertaining than the visit to the king,\" the little prince said to himself.", "zh": "”小王子暗自想。", "t": [138, 5100]}, {"en": "And he began again to clap his hands, one against the other.", "zh": "爱慕虚荣的人又举帽子行礼。", "t": [5100, 8900]}, {"en": "The conceited man against raised his hat in salute.", "zh": "反复操练了五分钟之后，小王子厌倦了这个单调的游戏。", "t": [8900, 12025]}]}, {"id": "ch11p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After five minutes of this exercise the little prince grew tired of the game's monotony.", "zh": "“该怎样做才能让您放下帽子？", "t": [138, 4812]}]}, {"id": "ch11p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what should one do to make the hat come down?\" he asked.", "zh": "爱慕虚荣的人听不见这句话。", "t": [125, 3512]}]}, {"id": "ch11p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But the conceited man did not hear him.", "zh": "爱慕虚荣的人只听得见赞扬声。", "t": [100, 2738]}, {"en": "Conceited people never hear anything but praise.", "zh": "“你对我真的崇拜到了五体投地？", "t": [2738, 5763]}]}, {"id": "ch11p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do you really admire me very much?\" he demanded of the little prince.", "zh": "”他问小王子。", "t": [100, 4163]}]}, {"id": "ch11p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What does that mean-- 'admire'?\"", "zh": "“什么叫做‘崇拜’？", "t": [112, 1675]}]}, {"id": "ch11p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"To admire mean that you regard me as the handsomest, the best-dressed, the richest, and the most intelligent man on this planet.\"", "zh": "” “‘崇拜’就是承认我是星球上最帅、衣着最讲究、最富有、最聪明的人。", "t": [100, 7512]}]}, {"id": "ch11p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But you are the only man on your planet!\"", "zh": "” “在你的星球上只有你一个人啊！", "t": [100, 2325]}]}, {"id": "ch11p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do me this kindness.", "zh": "” “你就让我享受被人崇拜的快乐吧，仍然崇拜我吧！", "t": [112, 1862]}, {"en": "Admire me just the same.\"", "zh": "” “你就让我享受被人崇拜的快乐吧，仍然崇拜我吧！", "t": [1862, 3450]}]}, {"id": "ch11p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I admire you,\" said the little prince, shrugging his shoulders slightly, \"but what is there in that to interest you so much?\"", "zh": "” “我崇拜你，”小王子耸耸肩，“这有什么值得你快乐的呢？", "t": [138, 6838]}]}, {"id": "ch11p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince went away.", "zh": "” 小王子走了。", "t": [138, 1888]}]}, {"id": "ch11p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The grown-ups are certainly very odd,\" he said to himself, as he continued on his journey.", "zh": "”小王子一边赶路一边对自己说。", "t": [138, 5150]}]}]}, {"id": "ch12", "title_en": "Chapter XII", "title_zh": "第 12 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch12p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The next planet was inhabited by a tippler.", "zh": "下一颗星球住着一个酒鬼。", "t": [112, 3275]}, {"en": "This was a very short visit, but it plunged the little prince into deep dejection.", "zh": "这次访问时间不长，但小王子极为不快。", "t": [3275, 8100]}]}, {"id": "ch12p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What are you doing there?\" he said to the tippler, whom he found settled down in silence before a collection of empty bottles and also a collection of full bottles.", "zh": "”小王子看见酒鬼在喝闷酒，面前摆着一大堆空瓶子和装满了酒的瓶子，就这样问他。", "t": [138, 8525]}]}, {"id": "ch12p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am drinking,\" replied the tippler, with a lugubrious air.", "zh": "”酒鬼闷闷不乐地回答。", "t": [138, 3787]}]}, {"id": "ch12p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why are you drinking?\" demanded the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子问他。", "t": [138, 3000]}]}, {"id": "ch12p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"So that I may forget,\" replied the tippler.", "zh": "”酒鬼答。", "t": [125, 2800]}]}, {"id": "ch12p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Forget what?\" inquired the little prince, who already was sorry for him.", "zh": "”小王子有点可怜他，又问。", "t": [125, 4450]}]}, {"id": "ch12p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Forget that I am ashamed,\" the tippler confessed, hanging his head.", "zh": "“为了忘记羞愧呗。", "t": [125, 4163]}]}, {"id": "ch12p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ashamed of what?\" insisted the little prince, who wanted to help him.", "zh": "“为了什么事羞愧呢？", "t": [125, 4313]}]}, {"id": "ch12p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ashamed of drinking!\" The tippler brought his speech to an end, and shut himself up in an impregnable silence.", "zh": "“我为喝酒羞愧！", "t": [125, 6676]}]}, {"id": "ch12p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince went away, puzzled.", "zh": "小王子大惑不解。", "t": [138, 2650]}]}, {"id": "ch12p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The grown-ups are certainly very, very odd,\" he said to himself, as he continued on his journey.", "zh": "“大人们真是没法理解。", "t": [138, 5750]}]}]}, {"id": "ch13", "title_en": "Chapter XIII", "title_zh": "第 13 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch13p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The fourth planet belonged to a businessman.", "zh": "第四颗星球是商人的星球。", "t": [138, 2975]}, {"en": "This man was so much occupied that he did not even raise his head at the little prince's arrival.", "zh": "小王子到来的时候，商人正埋头忙碌，头也没抬起来。", "t": [2975, 8162]}]}, {"id": "ch13p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" the little prince said to him.", "zh": "“您的香烟已经熄灭了。", "t": [100, 2925]}, {"en": "\"Your cigarette has gone out.\"", "zh": "“您的香烟已经熄灭了。", "t": [2925, 4550]}]}, {"id": "ch13p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Three and two make five.", "zh": "” “三加二等于五，五加七等于十二，十二加三等于十五，你好。", "t": [112, 2125]}, {"en": "Five and seven make twelve.", "zh": "” “三加二等于五，五加七等于十二，十二加三等于十五，你好。", "t": [2125, 4262]}, {"en": "Twelve and three make fifteen.", "zh": "” “三加二等于五，五加七等于十二，十二加三等于十五，你好。", "t": [4262, 6488]}, {"en": "Good morning.", "zh": "十五加七等于二十二，二十二加六等于二十八，我没时间点烟。", "t": [6488, 7675]}, {"en": "Fifteen and seven make twenty-two.", "zh": "十五加七等于二十二，二十二加六等于二十八，我没时间点烟。", "t": [7675, 10425]}, {"en": "Twenty-two and six make twenty-eight.", "zh": "十五加七等于二十二，二十二加六等于二十八，我没时间点烟。", "t": [10425, 13350]}, {"en": "I haven't time to light it again.", "zh": "二十六加五等于三十一。", "t": [13350, 15612]}, {"en": "Twenty-six and five make thirty-one.", "zh": "嗬！", "t": [15612, 18475]}, {"en": "Phew!", "zh": "一共是五亿零一百六十二万二千七百三十一。", "t": [18475, 19262]}, {"en": "Then that makes five-hundred-and-one-million, six-hundred-twenty-two-thousand, seven-hundred-thirty-one.\"", "zh": "” “五亿个什么？", "t": [19262, 25075]}]}, {"id": "ch13p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Five hundred million what?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "五亿零一百……我也闹糊涂了……我的活太忙了！", "t": [125, 3412]}]}, {"id": "ch13p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Eh?", "zh": "五亿零一百……我也闹糊涂了……我的活太忙了！", "t": [138, 888]}, {"en": "Are you still there?", "zh": "我是个正经人，不爱讲废话！", "t": [888, 2288]}, {"en": "Five-hundred-and-one million-- I can't stop...", "zh": "我是个正经人，不爱讲废话！", "t": [2288, 5238]}, {"en": "I have so much to do!", "zh": "二加五等于七……” “五亿零一百万个什么？", "t": [5238, 7000]}, {"en": "I am concerned with matters of consequence.", "zh": "二加五等于七……” “五亿零一百万个什么？", "t": [7000, 10062]}, {"en": "I don't amuse myself with balderdash.", "zh": "”小王子还在追问，他一旦提出问题，绝不中途而废。", "t": [10062, 12750]}, {"en": "Two and five make seven...\"", "zh": "”小王子还在追问，他一旦提出问题，绝不中途而废。", "t": [12750, 14488]}]}, {"id": "ch13p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Five-hundred-and-one million what?\" repeated the little prince, who never in his life had let go of a question once he had asked it.", "zh": "商人抬起头： “我住在这个星球已经五十四年了，只受过三次干扰。", "t": [125, 7162]}]}, {"id": "ch13p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The businessman raised his head.", "zh": "商人抬起头： “我住在这个星球已经五十四年了，只受过三次干扰。", "t": [138, 1950]}]}, {"id": "ch13p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"During the fifty-four years that I have inhabited this planet, I have been disturbed only three times.", "zh": "第一次干扰发生在二十二年前，鬼知道从哪儿掉下一个愣头青，发出的声音大得吓人，弄得我的加法出了四个错；第二次干扰发生在十一年前，我患了关节炎，我缺乏体育锻炼，我没时间闲逛，我是个正经人；第三次……就是这一次！", "t": [138, 6162]}, {"en": "The first time was twenty-two years ago, when some giddy goose fell from goodness knows where.", "zh": "第一次干扰发生在二十二年前，鬼知道从哪儿掉下一个愣头青，发出的声音大得吓人，弄得我的加法出了四个错；第二次干扰发生在十一年前，我患了关节炎，我缺乏体育锻炼，我没时间闲逛，我是个正经人；第三次……就是这一次！", "t": [6162, 11475]}, {"en": "He made the most frightful noise that resounded all over the place, and I made four mistakes in my addition.", "zh": "我刚好算到五亿零一百万个……” “五亿零一百万个什么？", "t": [11475, 17588]}, {"en": "The second time, eleven years ago, I was disturbed by an attack of rheumatism.", "zh": "我刚好算到五亿零一百万个……” “五亿零一百万个什么？", "t": [17588, 22738]}, {"en": "I don't get enough exercise.", "zh": "” 商人知道他休想安宁了： “五亿零一百万个小东西，有时在天上看得到的小东西。", "t": [22738, 24850]}, {"en": "I have no time for loafing.", "zh": "” 商人知道他休想安宁了： “五亿零一百万个小东西，有时在天上看得到的小东西。", "t": [24850, 26975]}, {"en": "The third time-- well, this is it!", "zh": "” 商人知道他休想安宁了： “五亿零一百万个小东西，有时在天上看得到的小东西。", "t": [26975, 29388]}, {"en": "I was saying, then, five-hundred-and-one millions--\"", "zh": "” “苍蝇吗？", "t": [29388, 32675]}]}, {"id": "ch13p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Millions of what?\"", "zh": "” “苍蝇吗？", "t": [125, 1375]}]}, {"id": "ch13p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The businessman suddenly realized that there was no hope of being left in peace until he answered this question.", "zh": "” “蜜蜂吗？", "t": [138, 5775]}]}, {"id": "ch13p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Millions of those little objects,\" he said, \"which one sometimes sees in the sky.\"", "zh": "” “不是，是金色的小东西，能教闲得发慌的人发痴做梦的小东西，可我是正经人，我没时间遐想做梦。", "t": [125, 4988]}]}, {"id": "ch13p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Flies?\"", "zh": "” “啊！", "t": [100, 788]}]}, {"id": "ch13p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, no.", "zh": "” “啊！", "t": [112, 1488]}, {"en": "Little glittering objects.\"", "zh": "” “啊！", "t": [1488, 3200]}]}, {"id": "ch13p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Bees?\"", "zh": "是满天的繁星吗？", "t": [100, 675]}]}, {"id": "ch13p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, no.", "zh": "是满天的繁星吗？", "t": [112, 1488]}, {"en": "Little golden objects that set lazy men to idle dreaming.", "zh": "” “就是这个。", "t": [1488, 5538]}, {"en": "As for me, I am concerned with matters of consequence.", "zh": "” “你要五亿多颗星星做什么？", "t": [5538, 9475]}, {"en": "There is no time for idle dreaming in my life.\"", "zh": "” “是五亿零一百六十二万二千七百三十一颗。", "t": [9475, 12250]}]}, {"id": "ch13p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "” “是五亿零一百六十二万二千七百三十一颗。", "t": [100, 850]}, {"en": "You mean the stars?\"", "zh": "” “是五亿零一百六十二万二千七百三十一颗。", "t": [850, 2050]}]}, {"id": "ch13p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that's it.", "zh": "我是个一丝不苟的人，我务求精确。", "t": [112, 1862]}, {"en": "The stars.\"", "zh": "我是个一丝不苟的人，我务求精确。", "t": [1862, 2662]}]}, {"id": "ch13p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what do you do with five-hundred millions of stars?\"", "zh": "” “你要星星干什么？", "t": [112, 3100]}]}, {"id": "ch13p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Five-hundred-and-one million, six-hundred-twenty-two thousand, seven-hundred-thirty-one.", "zh": "” “是呀。", "t": [125, 5738]}, {"en": "I am concerned with matters of consequence: I am accurate.\"", "zh": "” “你拥有星星？", "t": [5738, 9400]}]}, {"id": "ch13p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what do you do with these stars?\"", "zh": "” “是呀。", "t": [112, 2000]}]}, {"id": "ch13p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What do I do with them?\"", "zh": "” “我见过一个国王，他……” “国王不是‘拥有’，他是‘统治’。", "t": [112, 1412]}]}, {"id": "ch13p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes.\"", "zh": "” “我见过一个国王，他……” “国王不是‘拥有’，他是‘统治’。", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch13p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Nothing.", "zh": "” “我见过一个国王，他……” “国王不是‘拥有’，他是‘统治’。", "t": [112, 1138]}, {"en": "I own them.\"", "zh": "” “我见过一个国王，他……” “国王不是‘拥有’，他是‘统治’。", "t": [1138, 1888]}]}, {"id": "ch13p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You own the stars?\"", "zh": "大不相同。", "t": [138, 1300]}]}, {"id": "ch13p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes.\"", "zh": "大不相同。", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch13p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But I have already seen a king who--\"", "zh": "大不相同。", "t": [100, 2087]}]}, {"id": "ch13p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Kings do not own, they reign over.", "zh": "” “你拥有星星又怎么样呢？", "t": [100, 2788]}, {"en": "It is a very different matter.\"", "zh": "” “拥有了星星，我就成了大富翁呗。", "t": [2788, 4487]}]}, {"id": "ch13p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what good does it do you to own the stars?\"", "zh": "” “成了富翁有什么好处？", "t": [112, 2500]}]}, {"id": "ch13p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It does me the good of making me rich.\"", "zh": "” “成了富翁有什么好处？", "t": [138, 2276]}]}, {"id": "ch13p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what good does it do you to be rich?\"", "zh": "” “如果又有人发现了新的星星，我就把它们买下来呀。", "t": [138, 2300]}]}, {"id": "ch13p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It makes it possible for me to buy more stars, if any are ever discovered.\"", "zh": "” 小王子心想：“这个人的推理方法有点像我见过的那个酒鬼。", "t": [138, 4487]}]}, {"id": "ch13p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This man,\" the little prince said to himself, \"reasons a little like my poor tippler...\"", "zh": "” 他仍然提出问题： “怎样才能拥有星星？", "t": [125, 4962]}]}, {"id": "ch13p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Nevertheless, he still had some more questions.", "zh": "” 他仍然提出问题： “怎样才能拥有星星？", "t": [125, 2988]}]}, {"id": "ch13p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"How is it possible for one to own the stars?\"", "zh": "” 商人烦了，没好气地反问： “你说，这满天的星星属于谁？", "t": [125, 2674]}]}, {"id": "ch13p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"To whom do they belong?\" the businessman retorted, peevishly.", "zh": "” “我不知道。", "t": [112, 3937]}]}, {"id": "ch13p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I don't know.", "zh": "它们不属于任何人。", "t": [125, 1350]}, {"en": "To nobody.\"", "zh": "它们不属于任何人。", "t": [1350, 2176]}]}, {"id": "ch13p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then they belong to me, because I was the first person to think of it.\"", "zh": "因为我是第一个想到要拥有它们的人。", "t": [138, 3876]}]}, {"id": "ch13p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Is that all that is necessary?\"", "zh": "” “光是想就行了吗？", "t": [112, 1938]}]}, {"id": "ch13p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Certainly.", "zh": "” “光是想就行了吗？", "t": [112, 1275]}, {"en": "When you find a diamond that belongs to nobody, it is yours.", "zh": "” “那还用说吗？", "t": [1275, 5238]}, {"en": "When you discover an island that belongs to nobody, it is yours.", "zh": "你发现一颗没有主人的钻石，这颗钻石就归你了。", "t": [5238, 9425]}, {"en": "When you get an idea before any one else, you take out a patent on it: it is yours.", "zh": "你发现一个不属于任何人的岛，这岛就是你的了。", "t": [9425, 14925]}, {"en": "So with me: I own the stars, because nobody else before me ever thought of owning them.\"", "zh": "你头一个想出一个主意，你就可以申请专利，这个主意就是你的了。", "t": [14925, 20062]}]}, {"id": "ch13p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is true,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "而我呢，我拥有星星，因为在我之前没有一个人想过要拥有星星。", "t": [138, 3400]}, {"en": "\"And what do you do with them?\"", "zh": "而我呢，我拥有星星，因为在我之前没有一个人想过要拥有星星。", "t": [3400, 4812]}]}, {"id": "ch13p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I administer them,\" replied the businessman.", "zh": "” “这倒是真的。", "t": [138, 3112]}, {"en": "\"I count them and recount them.", "zh": "”小王子想。", "t": [3112, 5225]}, {"en": "It is difficult.", "zh": "“你要星星做什么用？", "t": [5225, 6688]}, {"en": "But I am a man who is naturally interested in matters of consequence.\"", "zh": "我数它们，一次又一次地数它们。", "t": [6688, 10638]}]}, {"id": "ch13p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince was still not satisfied.", "zh": "”商人说。", "t": [138, 2600]}]}, {"id": "ch13p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"If I owned a silk scarf,\" he said, \"I could put it around my neck and take it away with me.", "zh": "“这是件困难的事，但我是个正经人！", "t": [138, 5475]}, {"en": "If I owned a flower, I could pluck that flower and take it away with me.", "zh": "” 小王子对这个回答还不满意： “我若拥有一条围巾，我可以把它围在脖子上带走；我若拥有一朵花，我可以把它摘下带走；可你摘不下星星呀！", "t": [5475, 9762]}, {"en": "But you cannot pluck the stars from heaven...\"", "zh": "” 小王子对这个回答还不满意： “我若拥有一条围巾，我可以把它围在脖子上带走；我若拥有一朵花，我可以把它摘下带走；可你摘不下星星呀！", "t": [9762, 12138]}]}, {"id": "ch13p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.", "zh": "” 小王子对这个回答还不满意： “我若拥有一条围巾，我可以把它围在脖子上带走；我若拥有一朵花，我可以把它摘下带走；可你摘不下星星呀！", "t": [100, 962]}, {"en": "But I can put them in the bank.\"", "zh": "” “我不能摘星星，但我能把它们存入银行。", "t": [962, 2637]}]}, {"id": "ch13p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Whatever does that mean?\"", "zh": "” “我不能摘星星，但我能把它们存入银行。", "t": [138, 1512]}]}, {"id": "ch13p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That means that I write the number of my stars on a little paper.", "zh": "” “我不能摘星星，但我能把它们存入银行。", "t": [138, 4075]}, {"en": "And then I put this paper in a drawer and lock it with a key.\"", "zh": "” “这是怎么回事？", "t": [4075, 7363]}]}, {"id": "ch13p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And that is all?\"", "zh": "” “我在一张小纸条上写上我的星星的数目，然后把它锁进抽屉里。", "t": [138, 1050]}]}, {"id": "ch13p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is enough,\" said the businessman.", "zh": "” “我在一张小纸条上写上我的星星的数目，然后把它锁进抽屉里。", "t": [125, 2350]}]}, {"id": "ch13p48", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is entertaining,\" thought the little prince.", "zh": "” “就这样？", "t": [138, 3150]}, {"en": "\"It is rather poetic.", "zh": "” “这就行啦！", "t": [3150, 5025]}, {"en": "But it is of no great consequence.\"", "zh": "” 小王子想：“这倒是挺好玩的，还挺有诗意的呢，但算不上是严肃正经的事儿。", "t": [5025, 7200]}]}, {"id": "ch13p49", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On matters of consequence, the little prince had ideas which were very different from those of the grown-ups.", "zh": "” 小王子想：“这倒是挺好玩的，还挺有诗意的呢，但算不上是严肃正经的事儿。", "t": [138, 5888]}]}, {"id": "ch13p50", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I myself own a flower,\" he continued his conversation with the businessman, \"which I water every day.", "zh": "” 对“严肃正经的事儿”，小王子的看法与大人的看法极不相同。", "t": [138, 6388]}, {"en": "I own three volcanoes, which I clean out every week (for I also clean out the one that is extinct; one never knows).", "zh": "小王子说：“我呢，我拥有一朵花，我就天天给它浇水；我拥有三座火山，我就每个星期给它们疏通清理。", "t": [6388, 13612]}, {"en": "It is of some use to my volcanoes, and it is of some use to my flower, that I own them.", "zh": "我也疏通死火山，因为日后的事难说。", "t": [13612, 18962]}, {"en": "But you are of no use to the stars...\"", "zh": "我能做对火山、对花有益的事，才叫做拥有它们。", "t": [18962, 21175]}]}, {"id": "ch13p51", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The businessman opened his mouth, but he found nothing to say in answer.", "zh": "但你却不给星星做有益的事。", "t": [138, 4588]}, {"en": "And the little prince went away.", "zh": "” 商人张口结舌，找不到话回答。", "t": [4588, 6388]}]}, {"id": "ch13p52", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The grown-ups are certainly altogether extraordinary,\" he said simply, talking to himself as he continued on his journey.", "zh": "“大人们真是怪得没法说。", "t": [138, 6900]}]}]}, {"id": "ch14", "title_en": "Chapter XIV", "title_zh": "第 14 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch14p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The fifth planet was very strange.", "zh": "第五颗星球稀奇古怪，它是熠熠繁星中最小的一颗，它仅能容纳一盏路灯和一个点灯人。", "t": [138, 2638]}, {"en": "It was the smallest of all.", "zh": "第五颗星球稀奇古怪，它是熠熠繁星中最小的一颗，它仅能容纳一盏路灯和一个点灯人。", "t": [2638, 4662]}, {"en": "There was just enough room on it for a street lamp and a lamplighter.", "zh": "第五颗星球稀奇古怪，它是熠熠繁星中最小的一颗，它仅能容纳一盏路灯和一个点灯人。", "t": [4662, 8550]}, {"en": "The little prince was not able to reach any explanation of the use of a street lamp and a lamplighter, somewhere in the heavens, on a planet, which had no people, and not one house.", "zh": "小王子怎么想都想不明白，这颗位于太空中不起眼的星球，既没有房屋，又没有居民，这路灯和点灯人有何用途。", "t": [8550, 18750]}, {"en": "But he said to himself, nevertheless:", "zh": "他想：“这个点灯人也许古怪，然而他不会比国王、爱慕虚荣的人、商人、酒鬼更荒谬吧，至少他干的工作还有意义。", "t": [18750, 21213]}]}, {"id": "ch14p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It may well be that this man is absurd.", "zh": "他想：“这个点灯人也许古怪，然而他不会比国王、爱慕虚荣的人、商人、酒鬼更荒谬吧，至少他干的工作还有意义。", "t": [138, 2900]}, {"en": "But he is not so absurd as the king, the conceited man, the businessman, and the tippler.", "zh": "他想：“这个点灯人也许古怪，然而他不会比国王、爱慕虚荣的人、商人、酒鬼更荒谬吧，至少他干的工作还有意义。", "t": [2900, 8600]}, {"en": "For at least his work has some meaning.", "zh": "他想：“这个点灯人也许古怪，然而他不会比国王、爱慕虚荣的人、商人、酒鬼更荒谬吧，至少他干的工作还有意义。", "t": [8600, 11150]}, {"en": "When he lights his street lamp, it is as if he brought one more star to life, or one flower.", "zh": "他点亮路灯，如同给太空增添一颗星星，或一朵鲜花；他熄灭路灯，就是让花儿和星星休息睡眠。", "t": [11150, 16662]}, {"en": "When he puts out his lamp, he sends the flower, or the star, to sleep.", "zh": "他点亮路灯，如同给太空增添一颗星星，或一朵鲜花；他熄灭路灯，就是让花儿和星星休息睡眠。", "t": [16662, 21475]}, {"en": "That is a beautiful occupation.", "zh": "这活儿充满诗意，既然充满诗意，那就是有益的工作。", "t": [21475, 23788]}, {"en": "And since it is beautiful, it is truly useful.\"", "zh": "这活儿充满诗意，既然充满诗意，那就是有益的工作。", "t": [23788, 26726]}]}, {"id": "ch14p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When he arrived on the planet he respectfully saluted the lamplighter.", "zh": "” 他走近星球，毕恭毕敬地向点灯人行礼： “你好。", "t": [138, 4012]}]}, {"id": "ch14p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning.", "zh": "” 他走近星球，毕恭毕敬地向点灯人行礼： “你好。", "t": [112, 1288]}, {"en": "Why have you just put out your lamp?\"", "zh": "你刚才为什么把灯灭了？", "t": [1288, 3162]}]}, {"id": "ch14p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Those are the orders,\" replied the lamplighter.", "zh": "” “这是规定。", "t": [125, 3150]}, {"en": "\"Good morning.\"", "zh": "”点灯人答道。", "t": [3150, 3962]}]}, {"id": "ch14p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What are the orders?\"", "zh": "“早上好。", "t": [125, 1300]}]}, {"id": "ch14p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The orders are that I put out my lamp.", "zh": "” “什么规定？", "t": [138, 2825]}, {"en": "Good evening.\"", "zh": "” “熄灯的规定。", "t": [2825, 3650]}]}, {"id": "ch14p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he lighted his lamp again.", "zh": "晚上好。", "t": [138, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch14p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But why have you just lighted it again?\"", "zh": "” 他点上灯。", "t": [100, 2200]}]}, {"id": "ch14p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Those are the orders,\" replied the lamplighter.", "zh": "” “这是规定。", "t": [125, 2787]}]}, {"id": "ch14p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I do not understand,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“我不明白。", "t": [138, 2863]}]}, {"id": "ch14p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"There is nothing to understand,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [125, 3488]}, {"en": "\"Orders are orders.", "zh": "“用不着明白，”点灯人说，“规定就是规定。", "t": [3488, 5100]}, {"en": "Good morning.\"", "zh": "早上好。", "t": [5100, 5912]}]}, {"id": "ch14p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he put out his lamp.", "zh": "早上好。", "t": [138, 1538]}]}, {"id": "ch14p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then he mopped his forehead with a handkerchief decorated with red squares.", "zh": "然后他用红方格手帕抹抹额头。", "t": [138, 4288]}]}, {"id": "ch14p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I follow a terrible profession.", "zh": "“这活儿可把我累苦了。", "t": [138, 2538]}, {"en": "In the old days it was reasonable.", "zh": "“这活儿可把我累苦了。", "t": [2538, 5000]}, {"en": "I put the lamp out in the morning, and in the evening I lighted it again.", "zh": "从前的规定还合乎情理，早上熄灯，晚上点灯。", "t": [5000, 9325]}, {"en": "I had the rest of the day for relaxation and the rest of the night for sleep.\"", "zh": "熄灯之后休息，点灯之后睡觉……” “现在的规定改了？", "t": [9325, 13412]}]}, {"id": "ch14p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And the orders have been changed since that time?\"", "zh": "” “规定倒没有改，”点灯人说，“倒霉就倒霉在这儿！", "t": [125, 2725]}]}, {"id": "ch14p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The orders have not been changed,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "” “规定倒没有改，”点灯人说，“倒霉就倒霉在这儿！", "t": [138, 3562]}, {"en": "\"That is the tragedy!", "zh": "行星一年转得比一年快，而规定却没有改变！", "t": [3562, 5188]}, {"en": "From year to year the planet has turned more rapidly and the orders have not been changed!\"", "zh": "” “这是怎么回事？", "t": [5188, 10000]}]}, {"id": "ch14p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then what?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "” “现在它一分钟转一次，我连一秒钟的休息时间都没有。", "t": [138, 2512]}]}, {"id": "ch14p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then-- the planet now makes a complete turn every minute, and I no longer have a single second for repose.", "zh": "每分钟要点亮、熄灭一次灯火！", "t": [138, 6425]}, {"en": "Once every minute I have to light my lamp and put it out!\"", "zh": "你这儿一分钟就是一天？", "t": [6425, 9625]}]}, {"id": "ch14p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is very funny!", "zh": "你这儿一分钟就是一天？", "t": [125, 1600]}, {"en": "A day lasts only one minute, here where you live!\"", "zh": "” “怎么不可能，”点灯人说，“我们已经聊了一个月了。", "t": [1600, 4526]}]}, {"id": "ch14p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is not funny at all!\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "” “一个月？", "t": [112, 3088]}, {"en": "\"While we have been talking together a month has gone by.\"", "zh": "” “是的，三十分钟，就是三十天！", "t": [3088, 5987]}]}, {"id": "ch14p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A month?\"", "zh": "晚上好。", "t": [112, 800]}]}, {"id": "ch14p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, a month.", "zh": "晚上好。", "t": [138, 1762]}, {"en": "Thirty minutes.", "zh": "晚上好。", "t": [1762, 3212]}, {"en": "Thirty days.", "zh": "” 点灯人又点亮了路灯。", "t": [3212, 4600]}, {"en": "Good evening.\"", "zh": "” 点灯人又点亮了路灯。", "t": [4600, 5450]}]}, {"id": "ch14p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he lighted his lamp again.", "zh": "” 点灯人又点亮了路灯。", "t": [138, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch14p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As the little prince watched him, he felt that he loved this lamplighter who was so faithful to his orders.", "zh": "小王子看着他，小王子喜欢这个一丝不苟，按章办事的点灯人。", "t": [138, 6062]}, {"en": "He remembered the sunsets, which he himself had gone to seek, in other days, merely by pulling up his chair; and he wanted to help his friend.", "zh": "他很愿意帮助他的朋友。", "t": [6062, 13938]}]}, {"id": "ch14p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know,\" he said, \"I can tell you a way you can rest whenever you want to...\"", "zh": "“你知道吗……我有个办法，你什么时候想休息就可以休息……” “我一直想找个办法呢。", "t": [112, 4288]}]}, {"id": "ch14p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I always want to rest,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "”点灯人说。", "t": [138, 2813]}]}, {"id": "ch14p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For it is possible for a man to be faithful and lazy at the same time.", "zh": "有个办法既能按章办事又能偷懒就好了。", "t": [125, 4588]}, {"en": "The little prince went on with his explanation:", "zh": "小王子继续说道： “你的星球这么小，走三步就绕了一个圈。", "t": [4588, 7288]}]}, {"id": "ch14p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Your planet is so small that three strides will take you all the way around it.", "zh": "小王子继续说道： “你的星球这么小，走三步就绕了一个圈。", "t": [138, 4712]}, {"en": "To be always in the sunshine, you need only walk along rather slowly.", "zh": "你只要放慢脚步，太阳就老在你的头顶上。", "t": [4712, 9075]}, {"en": "When you want to rest, you will walk-- and the day will last as long as you like.\"", "zh": "你想休息的时候，你就往前走……你的白天要多长有多长。", "t": [9075, 13200]}]}, {"id": "ch14p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That doesn't do me much good,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "” “这个办法解决不了我多大的问题，”点灯人说，“我平生喜欢的就是睡觉。", "t": [125, 3338]}, {"en": "\"The one thing I love in life is to sleep.\"", "zh": "” “这个办法解决不了我多大的问题，”点灯人说，“我平生喜欢的就是睡觉。", "t": [3338, 5612]}]}, {"id": "ch14p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then you're unlucky,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "” “那你就太不走运了。", "t": [125, 2676]}]}, {"id": "ch14p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am unlucky,\" said the lamplighter.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [138, 2762]}, {"en": "\"Good morning.\" And he put out his lamp.", "zh": "“我真的不走运。", "t": [2762, 5338]}]}, {"id": "ch14p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That man,\" said the little prince to himself, as he continued farther on his journey, \"that man would be scorned by all the others: by the king, by the conceited man, by the tippler, by the businessman.", "zh": "小王子一面赶路一面想：“这个人会被其他人瞧不起的。", "t": [125, 11788]}, {"en": "Nevertheless he is the only one of them all who does not seem to me ridiculous.", "zh": "可是他是惟一的我不觉得可笑的人，也许因为他没有光顾自己吧！", "t": [11788, 16562]}, {"en": "Perhaps that is because he is thinking of something else besides himself.\"", "zh": "可是他是惟一的我不觉得可笑的人，也许因为他没有光顾自己吧！", "t": [16562, 20526]}]}, {"id": "ch14p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He breathed a sigh of regret, and said to himself, again:", "zh": "可是他是惟一的我不觉得可笑的人，也许因为他没有光顾自己吧！", "t": [125, 3663]}]}, {"id": "ch14p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That man is the only one of them all whom I could have made my friend.", "zh": "” 他惋惜地叹口气，又想： “这个人本来是惟一可做我的朋友的人，但他的星球实在太小了，搁不下两个人……” 小王子不敢承认，他对这颗星球颇有好感的原因是，它得天独厚，二十四小时之内就可以观看一千四百四十次日落。", "t": [138, 4212]}, {"en": "But his planet is indeed too small.", "zh": "” 他惋惜地叹口气，又想： “这个人本来是惟一可做我的朋友的人，但他的星球实在太小了，搁不下两个人……” 小王子不敢承认，他对这颗星球颇有好感的原因是，它得天独厚，二十四小时之内就可以观看一千四百四十次日落。", "t": [4212, 6875]}, {"en": "There is no room on it for two people...\"", "zh": "” 他惋惜地叹口气，又想： “这个人本来是惟一可做我的朋友的人，但他的星球实在太小了，搁不下两个人……” 小王子不敢承认，他对这颗星球颇有好感的原因是，它得天独厚，二十四小时之内就可以观看一千四百四十次日落。", "t": [6875, 8963]}]}, {"id": "ch14p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "What the little prince did not dare confess was that he was sorry most of all to leave this planet, because it was blest every day with 1440 sunsets!", "zh": "” 他惋惜地叹口气，又想： “这个人本来是惟一可做我的朋友的人，但他的星球实在太小了，搁不下两个人……” 小王子不敢承认，他对这颗星球颇有好感的原因是，它得天独厚，二十四小时之内就可以观看一千四百四十次日落。", "t": [100, 9312]}]}]}, {"id": "ch15", "title_en": "Chapter XV", "title_zh": "第 15 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch15p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The sixth planet was ten times larger than the last one.", "zh": "第六颗星球比刚才那颗大十倍。", "t": [138, 3762]}, {"en": "It was inhabited by an old gentleman who wrote voluminous books.", "zh": "星球上住着一位老先生，正在撰写大部头著作。", "t": [3762, 7662]}]}, {"id": "ch15p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, look!", "zh": "看见小王子，他大声嚷： “嗬！", "t": [100, 1438]}, {"en": "Here is an explorer!\" he exclaimed to himself when he saw the little prince coming.", "zh": "来了一个勘探人员！", "t": [1438, 5813]}]}, {"id": "ch15p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince sat down on the table and panted a little.", "zh": "” 小王子有点气喘，坐在桌子上。", "t": [138, 3725]}, {"en": "He had already travelled so much and so far!", "zh": "他赶了大老远的路呢！", "t": [3725, 6338]}]}, {"id": "ch15p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Where do you come from?\" the old gentleman said to him.", "zh": "”老先生问他。", "t": [125, 3075]}]}, {"id": "ch15p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is that big book?\" said the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子问。", "t": [138, 3225]}, {"en": "\"What are you doing?\"", "zh": "“您在这儿干什么？", "t": [3225, 4250]}]}, {"id": "ch15p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am a geographer,\" the old gentleman said to him.", "zh": "”老先生说。", "t": [138, 3063]}]}, {"id": "ch15p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is a geographer?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "“什么叫‘地理学家’？", "t": [125, 2975]}]}, {"id": "ch15p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"A geographer is a scholar who knows the location of all the seas, rivers, towns, mountains, and deserts.\"", "zh": "” “地理学家是学者，知道哪儿有大海、江河、城市、山脉、沙漠。", "t": [138, 7063]}]}, {"id": "ch15p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is very interesting,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [125, 3350]}, {"en": "\"Here at last is a man who has a real profession!\" And he cast a look around him at the planet of the geographer.", "zh": "”他环顾地理学家的行星。", "t": [3350, 10212]}, {"en": "It was the most magnificent and stately planet that he had ever seen.", "zh": "这儿有大洋吗？", "t": [10212, 14075]}]}, {"id": "ch15p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Your planet is very beautiful,\" he said.", "zh": "” “我不可能知道这事。", "t": [138, 3075]}, {"en": "\"Has it any oceans?\"", "zh": "”地理学家说。", "t": [3075, 4463]}]}, {"id": "ch15p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I couldn't tell you,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "“啊（小王子有点失望）！", "t": [138, 2376]}]}, {"id": "ch15p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!\" The little prince was disappointed.", "zh": "” “我不可能知道。", "t": [100, 3300]}, {"en": "\"Has it any mountains?\"", "zh": "”地理学家说。", "t": [3300, 4737]}]}, {"id": "ch15p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I couldn't tell you,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "“有城市、河流、沙漠吗？", "t": [138, 2376]}]}, {"id": "ch15p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And towns, and rivers, and deserts?\"", "zh": "” “我也不可能知道。", "t": [112, 2812]}]}, {"id": "ch15p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I couldn't tell you that, either.\"", "zh": "”地理学家说。", "t": [138, 2100]}]}, {"id": "ch15p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But you are a geographer!\"", "zh": "“可你是地理学家啊！", "t": [100, 1588]}]}, {"id": "ch15p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Exactly,\" the geographer said.", "zh": "” “不错，”地理学家说，“但我不是勘探人员。", "t": [112, 2600]}, {"en": "\"But I am not an explorer.", "zh": "” “不错，”地理学家说，“但我不是勘探人员。", "t": [2600, 4600]}, {"en": "I haven't a single explorer on my planet.", "zh": "我这儿很缺勘探人员。", "t": [4600, 7638]}, {"en": "It is not the geographer who goes out to count the towns, the rivers, the mountains, the seas, the oceans, and the deserts.", "zh": "计算城市、江河、山脉、大海、大洋、沙漠的数目，不是地理学家干的事。", "t": [7638, 15575]}, {"en": "The geographer is much too important to go loafing about.", "zh": "地理学家太重要了，没有工夫四处闲逛。", "t": [15575, 19538]}, {"en": "He does not leave his desk.", "zh": "他必须寸步不离办公室。", "t": [19538, 21525]}, {"en": "But he receives the explorers in his study.", "zh": "他必须寸步不离办公室。", "t": [21525, 24450]}, {"en": "He asks them questions, and he notes down what they recall of their travels.", "zh": "他在办公室接见勘探人员，询问他们，记下他们的回忆。", "t": [24450, 29025]}, {"en": "And if the recollections of any one among them seem interesting to him, the geographer orders an inquiry into that explorer's moral character.\"", "zh": "勘探人员引起了地理学家的兴趣，地理学家就要调查这位勘探人员的品质。", "t": [29025, 36612]}]}, {"id": "ch15p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why is that?\"", "zh": "” “为什么？", "t": [112, 1088]}]}, {"id": "ch15p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because an explorer who told lies would bring disaster on the books of the geographer.", "zh": "” “一个撒谎的勘探人员会给地理学家的书带来灾难，酒喝得太多的也不行。", "t": [112, 5162]}, {"en": "So would an explorer who drank too much.\"", "zh": "” “为什么？", "t": [5162, 7700]}]}, {"id": "ch15p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why is that?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "” “为什么？", "t": [138, 2600]}]}, {"id": "ch15p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because intoxicated men see double.", "zh": "” “酒鬼看的东西是重叠的，地理学家就会在有一座山的地方记下两座山。", "t": [100, 2938]}, {"en": "Then the geographer would note down two mountains in a place where there was only one.\"", "zh": "” 小王子说：“我认识一个人，他会成为糟糕的勘探员。", "t": [2938, 7387]}]}, {"id": "ch15p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I know some one,\" said the little prince, \"who would make a bad explorer.\"", "zh": "” “很可能。", "t": [138, 4100]}]}, {"id": "ch15p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is possible.", "zh": "” “很可能。", "t": [125, 1650]}, {"en": "Then, when the moral character of the explorer is shown to be good, an inquiry is ordered into his discovery.\"", "zh": "” “你亲自去实地调查吗？", "t": [1650, 7975]}]}, {"id": "ch15p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"One goes to see it?\"", "zh": "” “不，那太复杂了。", "t": [125, 1400]}]}, {"id": "ch15p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.", "zh": "我要求勘探人员提供证据。", "t": [100, 1000]}, {"en": "That would be too complicated.", "zh": "我要求勘探人员提供证据。", "t": [1000, 3162]}, {"en": "But one requires the explorer to furnish proofs.", "zh": "比如说，他发现了一座大山，我就要求他带大石来。", "t": [3162, 6550]}, {"en": "For example, if the discovery in question is that of a large mountain, one requires that large stones be brought back from it.\"", "zh": "” 地理学家突然兴奋起来： “你呢，你是从远方来的！", "t": [6550, 13537]}]}, {"id": "ch15p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The geographer was suddenly stirred to excitement.", "zh": "你是勘探队员！", "t": [138, 3075]}]}, {"id": "ch15p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But you-- you come from far away!", "zh": "你给我描写你的星球吧！", "t": [100, 2338]}, {"en": "You are an explorer!", "zh": "” 地理学家打开他的登记册，削尖铅笔。", "t": [2338, 3825]}, {"en": "You shall describe your planet to me!\"", "zh": "” 地理学家打开他的登记册，削尖铅笔。", "t": [3825, 5800]}]}, {"id": "ch15p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, having opened his big register, the geographer sharpened his pencil.", "zh": "他先用铅笔记下勘探人员的口述。", "t": [138, 5100]}, {"en": "The recitals of explorers are put down first in pencil.", "zh": "“请谈吧！", "t": [5100, 9038]}, {"en": "One waits until the explorer has furnished proofs, before putting them down in ink.", "zh": "“啊！", "t": [9038, 13876]}]}, {"id": "ch15p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Well?\" said the geographer expectantly.", "zh": "我们那儿，可没意思了，”小王子说，“它才一点大，我有三座火山：两座活火山，一座死火山，可谁知道以后会有什么变化呢。", "t": [138, 2900]}]}, {"id": "ch15p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, where I live,\" said the little prince, \"it is not very interesting.", "zh": "我们那儿，可没意思了，”小王子说，“它才一点大，我有三座火山：两座活火山，一座死火山，可谁知道以后会有什么变化呢。", "t": [125, 4725]}, {"en": "It is all so small.", "zh": "” “以后的事谁知道呢。", "t": [4725, 6475]}, {"en": "I have three volcanoes.", "zh": "” “以后的事谁知道呢。", "t": [6475, 8438]}, {"en": "Two volcanoes are active and the other is extinct.", "zh": "” “以后的事谁知道呢。", "t": [8438, 11938]}, {"en": "But one never knows.\"", "zh": "“我还有一朵花。", "t": [11938, 13262]}]}, {"id": "ch15p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"One never knows,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "” “我们不记录花的。", "t": [138, 2438]}]}, {"id": "ch15p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have also a flower.\"", "zh": "” “我们不记录花的。", "t": [100, 1637]}]}, {"id": "ch15p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We do not record flowers,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "“为什么不记录花呢？", "t": [138, 2938]}]}, {"id": "ch15p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why is that?", "zh": "它是最美的东西！", "t": [112, 1462]}, {"en": "The flower is the most beautiful thing on my planet!\"", "zh": "” “因为它‘昙花一现’。", "t": [1462, 4450]}]}, {"id": "ch15p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We do not record them,\" said the geographer, \"because they are ephemeral.\"", "zh": "” “什么叫做‘昙花一现’？", "t": [138, 4100]}]}, {"id": "ch15p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What does that mean-- 'ephemeral'?\"", "zh": "” “地理书是一切书籍中最珍贵的书籍，从不会过时。", "t": [138, 1663]}]}, {"id": "ch15p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Geographies,\" said the geographer, \"are the books which, of all books, are most concerned with matters of consequence.", "zh": "山移位，海洋干枯都是极少发生的事。", "t": [100, 7250]}, {"en": "They never become old-fashioned.", "zh": "我们写的是永恒不变的东西。", "t": [7250, 9462]}, {"en": "It is very rarely that a mountain changes its position.", "zh": "” “可是死火山也会复苏。", "t": [9462, 13025]}, {"en": "It is very rarely that an ocean empties itself of its waters.", "zh": "“什么叫做‘昙花一现’？", "t": [13025, 17150]}, {"en": "We write of eternal things.\"", "zh": "” “火山死与不死，在我们看来都是一回事。", "t": [17150, 18875]}]}, {"id": "ch15p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But extinct volcanoes may come to life again,\" the little prince interrupted.", "zh": "”地理学家说。", "t": [100, 5100]}, {"en": "\"What does that mean-- 'ephemeral'?\"", "zh": "“我们重视的是山，山不会改变。", "t": [5100, 6662]}]}, {"id": "ch15p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Whether volcanoes are extinct or alive, it comes to the same thing for us,\" said the geographer.", "zh": "” “什么叫做‘昙花一现’？", "t": [138, 5938]}, {"en": "\"The thing that matters to us is the mountain.", "zh": "他素来如此，一旦提出一个问题，绝不肯放弃。", "t": [5938, 8775]}, {"en": "It does not change.\"", "zh": "他素来如此，一旦提出一个问题，绝不肯放弃。", "t": [8775, 10000]}]}, {"id": "ch15p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But what does that mean-- 'ephemeral'?\" repeated the little prince, who never in his life had let go of a question, once he had asked it.", "zh": "“‘昙花一现’的意思就是‘面临很快消失的危险’。", "t": [100, 7200]}]}, {"id": "ch15p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It means, 'which is in danger of speedy disappearance.'\"", "zh": "” “当然。", "t": [138, 3650]}]}, {"id": "ch15p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Is my flower in danger of speedy disappearance?\"", "zh": "” “我的花会‘昙花一现’，”小王子想，“而她只有四根刺保护自己，应付这个世界！", "t": [112, 3300]}]}, {"id": "ch15p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Certainly it is.\"", "zh": "” “我的花会‘昙花一现’，”小王子想，“而她只有四根刺保护自己，应付这个世界！", "t": [125, 1350]}]}, {"id": "ch15p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My flower is ephemeral,\" the little prince said to himself, \"and she has only four thorns to defend herself against the world.", "zh": "我却抛弃了她，让她孤苦伶仃地待在我家！", "t": [138, 7388]}, {"en": "And I have left her on my planet, all alone!\"", "zh": "” 他头一次体会到悔恨的感觉。", "t": [7388, 10087]}]}, {"id": "ch15p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "That was his first moment of regret.", "zh": "然而他还是鼓起勇气问： “您能否指点我，我该去哪儿访问？", "t": [138, 2662]}, {"en": "But he took courage once more.", "zh": "然而他还是鼓起勇气问： “您能否指点我，我该去哪儿访问？", "t": [2662, 4425]}]}, {"id": "ch15p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What place would you advise me to visit now?\" he asked.", "zh": "然而他还是鼓起勇气问： “您能否指点我，我该去哪儿访问？", "t": [138, 3412]}]}, {"id": "ch15p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The planet Earth,\" replied the geographer.", "zh": "” “到地球上去吧，”地理学家说，“它非常有名……” 小王子走了，一路上都在思念他的花儿。", "t": [138, 3012]}, {"en": "\"It has a good reputation.\"", "zh": "” “到地球上去吧，”地理学家说，“它非常有名……” 小王子走了，一路上都在思念他的花儿。", "t": [3012, 4625]}]}, {"id": "ch15p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince went away, thinking of his flower.", "zh": "” “到地球上去吧，”地理学家说，“它非常有名……” 小王子走了，一路上都在思念他的花儿。", "t": [138, 3250]}]}]}, {"id": "ch16", "title_en": "Chapter XVI", "title_zh": "第 16 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch16p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then the seventh planet was the Earth.", "zh": "第七颗星球就是地球。", "t": [112, 2425]}]}, {"id": "ch16p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The Earth is not just an ordinary planet!", "zh": "地球可不是等闲之辈！", "t": [125, 2975]}, {"en": "One can count; there are 111 kings (not forgetting, to be sure, the Negro kings among them), 7000 geographers, 900,000 businessmen, 7,500,000 tipplers, and 311,000,000 conceited men-- that is to say, about 2,000,000,000 grown-ups.", "zh": "地球上有一百一十一位国王（我当然没有忘记算上黑人国王）、七千位地理学家、九十万个商人、七百五十万个酒鬼、三亿一千一百万个爱慕虚荣的人，也就是说，约莫有二十亿个大人。", "t": [2975, 21150]}]}, {"id": "ch16p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "To give you an idea of the size of the Earth, I will tell you that before the invention of electricity it was necessary to maintain, over the whole of the six continents, a veritable army of 462,511 lamplighters for the street lamps.", "zh": "为了让你们对地球的面积大小有个具体形象的概念，我给你们打个比方。", "t": [100, 14550]}]}, {"id": "ch16p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Seen from a slight distance, that would make a splendid spectacle.", "zh": "我告诉你们，世界上还没有人发明电的时候，六大洲需要维持一支由四十六万二千五百一十一个点灯人组成的真正大军。", "t": [112, 4262]}, {"en": "The movements of this army would be regulated like those of the ballet in the opera.", "zh": "我告诉你们，世界上还没有人发明电的时候，六大洲需要维持一支由四十六万二千五百一十一个点灯人组成的真正大军。", "t": [4262, 9012]}, {"en": "First would come the turn of the lamplighters of New Zealand and Australia.", "zh": "从稍远处眺望这支大军，真是蔚为壮观。", "t": [9012, 13588]}, {"en": "Having set their lamps alight, these would go off to sleep.", "zh": "点灯人的动作犹如芭蕾舞演员的动作：整齐划一，井然有序。", "t": [13588, 17275]}, {"en": "Next, the lamplighters of China and Siberia would enter for their steps in the dance, and then they too would be waved back into the wings.", "zh": "首先上场的是新西兰、澳大利亚的点灯人，他们点亮路灯后就去睡觉。", "t": [17275, 25200]}, {"en": "After that would come the turn of the lamplighters of Russia and the Indies; then those of Africa and Europe, then those of South America; then those of South America; then those of North America.", "zh": "接着加入舞蹈行列的是中国和西伯利亚的点灯人，然后他们也隐没于后台。", "t": [25200, 35938]}, {"en": "And never would they make a mistake in the order of their entry upon the stage.", "zh": "然后轮到俄罗斯和印度的点灯人，接着是非洲和欧洲的，然后是南美洲、北美洲。", "t": [35938, 40288]}, {"en": "It would be magnificent.", "zh": "这支大军的进场顺序从不错乱，真是让人叹为观止。", "t": [40288, 41788]}]}, {"id": "ch16p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Only the man who was in charge of the single lamp at the North Pole, and his colleague who was responsible for the single lamp at the South Pole-- only these two would live free from toil and care: they would be busy twice a year.", "zh": "惟有北极点灯人和他的南极同行，过着悠闲懒散的生活。", "t": [100, 11050]}]}]}, {"id": "ch17", "title_en": "Chapter XVII", "title_zh": "第 17 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch17p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When one wishes to play the wit, he sometimes wanders a little from the truth.", "zh": "好出风头，喜欢卖弄聪明的人，多少会讲几句大话，吹点牛皮。", "t": [125, 4950]}, {"en": "I have not been altogether honest in what I have told you about the lamplighters.", "zh": "我给你们介绍点灯人的时候，也不太老实。", "t": [4950, 9612]}, {"en": "And I realize that I run the risk of giving a false idea of our planet to those who do not know it.", "zh": "我也许让不了解我们星球的人产生误解，造成错觉。", "t": [9612, 15425]}, {"en": "Men occupy a very small place upon the Earth.", "zh": "人在地球上占的位置微乎其微。", "t": [15425, 18788]}, {"en": "If the two billion inhabitants who people its surface were all to stand upright and somewhat crowded together, as they do for some big public assembly, they could easily be put into one public square twenty miles long and twenty miles wide.", "zh": "倘若让散居在地球上的二十亿人口集中在一起开大会，他们可以松快地站在二十英里长二十英里宽的广场上。", "t": [18788, 31650]}, {"en": "All humanity could be piled up on a small Pacific islet.", "zh": "当然，大人们不会相信这些话。", "t": [31650, 35237]}]}, {"id": "ch17p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The grown-ups, to be sure, will not believe you when you tell them that.", "zh": "他们以为自己占了很大的位置，自以为自己像猴面包树那么庞大。", "t": [138, 4450]}, {"en": "They imagine that they fill a great deal of space.", "zh": "那你就建议他们算一算。", "t": [4450, 7512]}, {"en": "They fancy themselves as important as the baobabs.", "zh": "他们不是喜欢数字吗？", "t": [7512, 11075]}, {"en": "You should advise them, then, to make their own calculations.", "zh": "但我劝你们别多此一举了，挺麻烦的，毫无用处的。", "t": [11075, 15125]}, {"en": "They adore figures, and that will please them.", "zh": "相信我的话吧。", "t": [15125, 17962]}, {"en": "But do not waste your time on this extra task.", "zh": "相信我的话吧。", "t": [17962, 21138]}, {"en": "It is unnecessary.", "zh": "小王子来到地球后，看不见一个人影，不由心里纳闷。", "t": [21138, 22850]}, {"en": "You have, I know, confidence in me.", "zh": "小王子来到地球后，看不见一个人影，不由心里纳闷。", "t": [22850, 25400]}]}, {"id": "ch17p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When the little prince arrived on the Earth, he was very much surprised not to see any people.", "zh": "他担心走错了路，到了别的星球了。", "t": [138, 5612]}, {"en": "He was beginning to be afraid he had come to the wrong planet, when a coil of gold, the colour of the moonlight, flashed across the sand.", "zh": "”小王子随口说。", "t": [5612, 12750]}]}, {"id": "ch17p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good evening,\" said the little prince courteously.", "zh": "”小王子问。", "t": [112, 2813]}]}, {"id": "ch17p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good evening,\" said the snake.", "zh": "”蛇回答说。", "t": [100, 1950]}]}, {"id": "ch17p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What planet is this on which I have come down?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "……地球上没人吗？", "t": [138, 4200]}]}, {"id": "ch17p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This is the Earth; this is Africa,\" the snake answered.", "zh": "” “这儿是沙漠，沙漠里是没有人烟的，地球很大。", "t": [100, 3588]}]}, {"id": "ch17p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "”蛇说。", "t": [100, 838]}, {"en": "Then there are no people on the Earth?\"", "zh": "”蛇说。", "t": [838, 2738]}]}, {"id": "ch17p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"This is the desert.", "zh": "小王子坐在一块石头上，抬头看天空： “我在想，星星发亮是否为了让每个人有一天能找到自己的星星。", "t": [125, 1725]}, {"en": "There are no people in the desert.", "zh": "小王子坐在一块石头上，抬头看天空： “我在想，星星发亮是否为了让每个人有一天能找到自己的星星。", "t": [1725, 3875]}, {"en": "The Earth is large,\" said the snake.", "zh": "小王子坐在一块石头上，抬头看天空： “我在想，星星发亮是否为了让每个人有一天能找到自己的星星。", "t": [3875, 6076]}]}, {"id": "ch17p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince sat down on a stone, and raised his eyes toward the sky.", "zh": "你看我的星球，它正好在我的头顶上……可它多么的遥远！", "t": [138, 4263]}]}, {"id": "ch17p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I wonder,\" he said, \"whether the stars are set alight in heaven so that one day each one of us may find his own again...", "zh": "” “它真美。", "t": [138, 7062]}, {"en": "Look at my planet.", "zh": "“你来这儿干什么？", "t": [7062, 8688]}, {"en": "It is right there above us.", "zh": "” “我和一朵花赌气闹别扭呢。", "t": [8688, 10675]}, {"en": "But how far away it is!\"", "zh": "” “我和一朵花赌气闹别扭呢。", "t": [10675, 12238]}]}, {"id": "ch17p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is beautiful,\" the snake said.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [112, 2612]}, {"en": "\"What has brought you here?\"", "zh": "”蛇说。", "t": [2612, 3963]}]}, {"id": "ch17p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have been having some trouble with a flower,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“人在哪儿呢？", "t": [138, 3726]}]}, {"id": "ch17p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!\" said the snake.", "zh": "”小王子终于开口说话。", "t": [138, 1513]}]}, {"id": "ch17p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And they were both silent.", "zh": "“待在沙漠有点孤独……” “跟人在一起也孤独。", "t": [138, 1588]}]}, {"id": "ch17p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Where are the men?\" the little prince at last took up the conversation again.", "zh": "”蛇说。", "t": [138, 4300]}]}, {"id": "ch17p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is a little lonely in the desert...\"", "zh": "小王子久久凝视着它。", "t": [138, 2187]}]}, {"id": "ch17p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is also lonely among men,\" the snake said.", "zh": "“你是奇特的动物，”小王子终于说道，“你像一根指头般细……” “可我比国王的指头强大得多。", "t": [138, 3013]}]}, {"id": "ch17p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince gazed at him for a long time.", "zh": "“你是奇特的动物，”小王子终于说道，“你像一根指头般细……” “可我比国王的指头强大得多。", "t": [138, 2700]}]}, {"id": "ch17p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are a funny animal,\" he said at last.", "zh": "”蛇说。", "t": [138, 3025]}, {"en": "\"You are no thicker than a finger...\"", "zh": "”蛇说。", "t": [3025, 4750]}]}, {"id": "ch17p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But I am more powerful than the finger of a king,\" said the snake.", "zh": "小王子微微一笑。", "t": [100, 3650]}]}, {"id": "ch17p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince smiled.", "zh": "“你没有那么强大吧……你连爪子都没有……你连走路都不会……” “船能送你走远路，可我能送你走更远的路。", "t": [138, 1625]}]}, {"id": "ch17p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are not very powerful.", "zh": "“你没有那么强大吧……你连爪子都没有……你连走路都不会……” “船能送你走远路，可我能送你走更远的路。", "t": [138, 2112]}, {"en": "You haven't even any feet.", "zh": "“你没有那么强大吧……你连爪子都没有……你连走路都不会……” “船能送你走远路，可我能送你走更远的路。", "t": [2112, 4138]}, {"en": "You cannot even travel...\"", "zh": "“你没有那么强大吧……你连爪子都没有……你连走路都不会……” “船能送你走远路，可我能送你走更远的路。", "t": [4138, 5638]}]}, {"id": "ch17p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I can carry you farther than any ship could take you,\" said the snake.", "zh": "” 它盘着小王子的脚踝，像一只金镯子。", "t": [138, 3937]}]}, {"id": "ch17p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He twined himself around the little prince's ankle, like a golden bracelet.", "zh": "” 它盘着小王子的脚踝，像一只金镯子。", "t": [125, 4600]}]}, {"id": "ch17p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Whomever I touch, I send back to the earth from whence he came,\" the snake spoke again.", "zh": "“我碰到谁，就能把他送回他来的地方，”蛇还说，“但你纯洁，你是从星球上来的……” 小王子默默无言。", "t": [138, 5562]}, {"en": "\"But you are innocent and true, and you come from a star...\"", "zh": "“我同情你，在这花岗岩构成的地球上，你这么弱小。", "t": [5562, 8837]}]}, {"id": "ch17p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince made no reply.", "zh": "“我同情你，在这花岗岩构成的地球上，你这么弱小。", "t": [138, 2163]}]}, {"id": "ch17p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You move me to pity-- you are so weak on this Earth made of granite,\" the snake said.", "zh": "如果你有朝一日思念你的星球，我可以帮助你。", "t": [138, 5175]}, {"en": "\"I can help you, some day, if you grow too homesick for your own planet.", "zh": "我可以……” “啊！", "t": [5175, 9825]}, {"en": "I can--\"", "zh": "我完全明白你的意思，”小王子说，“但你的话为什么句句都像谜似的？", "t": [9825, 10475]}]}, {"id": "ch17p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!", "zh": "我完全明白你的意思，”小王子说，“但你的话为什么句句都像谜似的？", "t": [100, 838]}, {"en": "I understand you very well,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "我完全明白你的意思，”小王子说，“但你的话为什么句句都像谜似的？", "t": [838, 4325]}, {"en": "\"But why do you always speak in riddles?\"", "zh": "” “我能解一切谜。", "t": [4325, 6550]}]}, {"id": "ch17p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I solve them all,\" said the snake.", "zh": "”蛇说。", "t": [138, 2200]}]}, {"id": "ch17p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And they were both silent.", "zh": "他们都不讲话了。", "t": [138, 1588]}]}]}, {"id": "ch18", "title_en": "Chapter XVIII", "title_zh": "第 18 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch18p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince crossed the desert and met with only one flower.", "zh": "小王子穿过沙漠，只遇见一朵花。", "t": [138, 4038]}, {"en": "It was a flower with three petals, a flower of no account at all.", "zh": "一朵三瓣的花，一朵极普通平凡的花…… “你好。", "t": [4038, 7937]}]}, {"id": "ch18p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“你好。", "t": [112, 2312]}]}, {"id": "ch18p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the flower.", "zh": "“人在哪儿呢？", "t": [100, 1987]}]}, {"id": "ch18p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Where are the men?\" the little prince asked, politely.", "zh": "”小王子彬彬有礼地问。", "t": [138, 3413]}]}, {"id": "ch18p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The flower had once seen a caravan passing.", "zh": "“人？", "t": [138, 2712]}]}, {"id": "ch18p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Men?\" she echoed.", "zh": "依我看，人是有的，大概六七个吧。", "t": [112, 2012]}, {"en": "\"I think there are six or seven of them in existence.", "zh": "依我看，人是有的，大概六七个吧。", "t": [2012, 5225]}, {"en": "I saw them, several years ago.", "zh": "好几年前我见过他们。", "t": [5225, 7650]}, {"en": "But one never knows where to find them.", "zh": "但我不知道在哪儿能找到他们。", "t": [7650, 10062]}, {"en": "The wind blows them away.", "zh": "风把他们吹散了。", "t": [10062, 11988]}, {"en": "They have no roots, and that makes their life very difficult.\"", "zh": "他们没有根，这就使他们吃尽了苦头。", "t": [11988, 15475]}]}, {"id": "ch18p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [112, 2175]}]}, {"id": "ch18p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" said the flower.", "zh": "”花儿说。", "t": [100, 1874]}]}]}, {"id": "ch19", "title_en": "Chapter XIX", "title_zh": "第 19 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch19p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After that, the little prince climbed a high mountain.", "zh": "小王子登上一座高山。", "t": [125, 3588]}, {"en": "The only mountains he had ever known were the three volcanoes, which came up to his knees.", "zh": "以前他只见过自己的那三座火山，火山很矮，才到他的膝盖。", "t": [3588, 8762]}, {"en": "And he used the extinct volcano as a footstool.", "zh": "死火山只能给他当凳子坐。", "t": [8762, 12100]}, {"en": "\"From a mountain as high as this one,\" he said to himself, \"I shall be able to see the whole planet at one glance, and all the people...\"", "zh": "“站在这座高山上，”他想道，“我一眼就能看见整个星球和所有的人了……” 但他只看见悬崖峭壁。", "t": [12100, 19337]}]}, {"id": "ch19p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he saw nothing, save peaks of rock that were sharpened like needles.", "zh": "“您好……您好……您好……”回声应道。", "t": [100, 4212]}]}, {"id": "ch19p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" he said courteously.", "zh": "“您是谁？", "t": [100, 2300]}]}, {"id": "ch19p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning--Good morning--Good morning,\" answered the echo.", "zh": "“您是谁……您是谁……您是谁……”回声应道。", "t": [100, 3187]}]}, {"id": "ch19p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Who are you?\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“您是谁……您是谁……您是谁……”回声应道。", "t": [138, 2326]}]}, {"id": "ch19p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Who are you--Who are you--Who are you?\" answered the echo.", "zh": "“做我的朋友吧，我很孤单……”他说。", "t": [138, 3100]}]}, {"id": "ch19p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Be my friends.", "zh": "“我很孤单……我很孤单……我很孤单……”回声又答应道。", "t": [112, 1538]}, {"en": "I am all alone,\" he said.", "zh": "“我很孤单……我很孤单……我很孤单……”回声又答应道。", "t": [1538, 3225]}]}, {"id": "ch19p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am all alone--all alone--all alone,\" answered the echo.", "zh": "“多么古怪的星球！", "t": [138, 3400]}]}, {"id": "ch19p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What a queer planet!\" he thought.", "zh": "”小王子想道。", "t": [100, 2425]}, {"en": "\"It is altogether dry, and altogether pointed, and altogether harsh and forbidding.", "zh": "”小王子想道。", "t": [2425, 7638]}, {"en": "And the people have no imagination.", "zh": "“干干巴巴的，尖尖峭峭的，带点咸味儿的，这儿的人缺乏想像力，他们净重复别人讲过的话……而在我的那个星球里，我有一朵花，她总是抢先讲话……”", "t": [7638, 10088]}, {"en": "They repeat whatever one says to them...", "zh": "“干干巴巴的，尖尖峭峭的，带点咸味儿的，这儿的人缺乏想像力，他们净重复别人讲过的话……而在我的那个星球里，我有一朵花，她总是抢先讲话……”", "t": [10088, 12662]}, {"en": "On my planet I had a flower; she always was the first to speak...\"", "zh": "“干干巴巴的，尖尖峭峭的，带点咸味儿的，这儿的人缺乏想像力，他们净重复别人讲过的话……而在我的那个星球里，我有一朵花，她总是抢先讲话……”", "t": [12662, 16613]}]}]}, {"id": "ch20", "title_en": "Chapter XX", "title_zh": "第 20 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch20p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But it happened that after walking for a long time through sand, and rocks, and snow, the little prince at last came upon a road.", "zh": "他终于看见了一条路，条条路都通向有人烟的地方。", "t": [100, 7413]}]}, {"id": "ch20p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And all roads lead to the abodes of men.", "zh": "”他说。", "t": [138, 2574]}]}, {"id": "ch20p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" he said.", "zh": "这是一座盛开着玫瑰花的花园。", "t": [100, 1638]}]}, {"id": "ch20p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was standing before a garden, all a-bloom with roses.", "zh": "“你好。", "t": [125, 3575]}]}, {"id": "ch20p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the roses.", "zh": "小王子看着她们。", "t": [100, 2075]}]}, {"id": "ch20p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince gazed at them.", "zh": "她们一个个全像他的那朵花儿。", "t": [138, 2250]}, {"en": "They all looked like his flower.", "zh": "“你们是谁？", "t": [2250, 3838]}]}, {"id": "ch20p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Who are you?\" he demanded, thunderstruck.", "zh": "”小王子大吃一惊，问她们说。", "t": [138, 2987]}]}, {"id": "ch20p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"We are roses,\" the roses said.", "zh": "“我们是玫瑰花。", "t": [138, 2325]}]}, {"id": "ch20p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he was overcome with sadness.", "zh": "“啊！", "t": [138, 2475]}, {"en": "His flower had told him that she was the only one of her kind in all the universe.", "zh": "”小王子说…… 小王子伤心极了。", "t": [2475, 7275]}, {"en": "And here were five thousand of them, all alike, in one single garden!", "zh": "他的花儿告诉他，大千世界中，她是惟一的玫瑰花。", "t": [7275, 11350]}]}, {"id": "ch20p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"She would be very much annoyed,\" he said to himself, \"if she should see that...", "zh": "可是在这儿，仅仅一座花园里就有五千朵玫瑰花，全都长得一模一样！", "t": [125, 4238]}, {"en": "she would cough most dreadfully, and she would pretend that she was dying, to avoid being laughed at.", "zh": "可是在这儿，仅仅一座花园里就有五千朵玫瑰花，全都长得一模一样！", "t": [4238, 9588]}, {"en": "And I should be obliged to pretend that I was nursing her back to life-- for if I did not do that, to humble myself also, she would really allow herself to die...\"", "zh": "他想：“要是她看见这群玫瑰花，她又要恼羞成怒了……为了挽回面子，她又要装模作样地咳嗽，做出一副要死要活的样子，我也要呵护她，不然，她为了羞辱我，真会寻死的……” 他又想道：“我原以为我拥有一朵独一无二的花，我以为我很富足，原来她只是一朵极平常的花，她，以及我那三座只有我膝盖高的火山——其中一座也许永远都活不了，它们不能使我成为一位伟大的王子了……” 于是，他趴倒在草地上伤心地哭泣。", "t": [9588, 18075]}]}, {"id": "ch20p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then he went on with his reflections: \"I thought that I was rich, with a flower that was unique in all the world; and all I had was a common rose.", "zh": "他想：“要是她看见这群玫瑰花，她又要恼羞成怒了……为了挽回面子，她又要装模作样地咳嗽，做出一副要死要活的样子，我也要呵护她，不然，她为了羞辱我，真会寻死的……” 他又想道：“我原以为我拥有一朵独一无二的花，我以为我很富足，原来她只是一朵极平常的花，她，以及我那三座只有我膝盖高的火山——其中一座也许永远都活不了，它们不能使我成为一位伟大的王子了……” 于是，他趴倒在草地上伤心地哭泣。", "t": [138, 8400]}, {"en": "A common rose, and three volcanoes that come up to my knees-- and one of them perhaps extinct forever...", "zh": "他想：“要是她看见这群玫瑰花，她又要恼羞成怒了……为了挽回面子，她又要装模作样地咳嗽，做出一副要死要活的样子，我也要呵护她，不然，她为了羞辱我，真会寻死的……” 他又想道：“我原以为我拥有一朵独一无二的花，我以为我很富足，原来她只是一朵极平常的花，她，以及我那三座只有我膝盖高的火山——其中一座也许永远都活不了，它们不能使我成为一位伟大的王子了……” 于是，他趴倒在草地上伤心地哭泣。", "t": [8400, 14275]}, {"en": "that doesn't make me a very great prince...\"", "zh": "他想：“要是她看见这群玫瑰花，她又要恼羞成怒了……为了挽回面子，她又要装模作样地咳嗽，做出一副要死要活的样子，我也要呵护她，不然，她为了羞辱我，真会寻死的……” 他又想道：“我原以为我拥有一朵独一无二的花，我以为我很富足，原来她只是一朵极平常的花，她，以及我那三座只有我膝盖高的火山——其中一座也许永远都活不了，它们不能使我成为一位伟大的王子了……” 于是，他趴倒在草地上伤心地哭泣。", "t": [14275, 16388]}]}, {"id": "ch20p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he lay down in the grass and cried.", "zh": "他想：“要是她看见这群玫瑰花，她又要恼羞成怒了……为了挽回面子，她又要装模作样地咳嗽，做出一副要死要活的样子，我也要呵护她，不然，她为了羞辱我，真会寻死的……” 他又想道：“我原以为我拥有一朵独一无二的花，我以为我很富足，原来她只是一朵极平常的花，她，以及我那三座只有我膝盖高的火山——其中一座也许永远都活不了，它们不能使我成为一位伟大的王子了……” 于是，他趴倒在草地上伤心地哭泣。", "t": [138, 2337]}]}]}, {"id": "ch21", "title_en": "Chapter XXI", "title_zh": "第 21 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch21p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It was then that the fox appeared.", "zh": "就在这个时候，出现了一只狐狸。", "t": [138, 2012]}]}, {"id": "ch21p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the fox.", "zh": "“你好。", "t": [100, 1988]}]}, {"id": "ch21p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" the little prince responded politely, although when he turned around he saw nothing.", "zh": "”小王子彬彬有礼地回答，他转过身，但看不见有什么东西。", "t": [138, 5313]}]}, {"id": "ch21p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am right here,\" the voice said, \"under the apple tree.\"", "zh": "“我在这里，”那声音说，“在苹果树下。", "t": [138, 3350]}]}, {"id": "ch21p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Who are you?\" asked the little prince, and added, \"You are very pretty to look at.\"", "zh": "” “你是谁？", "t": [138, 4837]}]}, {"id": "ch21p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am a fox,\" said the fox.", "zh": "”小王子说，“你真漂亮……” “我是狐狸。", "t": [138, 2163]}]}, {"id": "ch21p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Come and play with me,\" proposed the little prince.", "zh": "”狐狸说。", "t": [100, 3325]}, {"en": "\"I am so unhappy.\"", "zh": "”小王子向他建议。", "t": [3325, 4662]}]}, {"id": "ch21p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I cannot play with you,\" the fox said.", "zh": "”小王子向他建议。", "t": [138, 2812]}, {"en": "\"I am not tamed.\"", "zh": "“我非常伤心……” “我不能跟你一起玩，”狐狸说，“我不是驯养的动物。", "t": [2812, 3912]}]}, {"id": "ch21p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "“我非常伤心……” “我不能跟你一起玩，”狐狸说，“我不是驯养的动物。", "t": [100, 800]}, {"en": "Please excuse me,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“我非常伤心……” “我不能跟你一起玩，”狐狸说，“我不是驯养的动物。", "t": [800, 3350]}]}, {"id": "ch21p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But, after some thought, he added: \"What does that mean-- 'tame'?\"", "zh": "” “哦，对不起。", "t": [100, 4037]}]}, {"id": "ch21p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You do not live here,\" said the fox.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [112, 2700]}, {"en": "\"What is it that you are looking for?\"", "zh": "小王子想了想，又问： “什么叫做‘驯养’？", "t": [2700, 4500]}]}, {"id": "ch21p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am looking for men,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "” “你不是本地人。", "t": [138, 3125]}, {"en": "\"What does that mean-- 'tame'?\"", "zh": "”狐狸说。", "t": [3125, 4550]}]}, {"id": "ch21p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Men,\" said the fox.", "zh": "“人有枪，人打猎，太可恶了！", "t": [125, 2138]}, {"en": "\"They have guns, and they hunt.", "zh": "可人也养鸡！", "t": [2138, 4450]}, {"en": "It is very disturbing.", "zh": "这是人惟一的好处。", "t": [4450, 6262]}, {"en": "They also raise chickens.", "zh": "你也找鸡吗？", "t": [6262, 8300]}, {"en": "These are their only interests.", "zh": "” “不！", "t": [8300, 10462]}, {"en": "Are you looking for chickens?\"", "zh": "”小王子说，“我找朋友。", "t": [10462, 11987]}]}, {"id": "ch21p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "什么叫做‘驯养’？", "t": [125, 2450]}, {"en": "\"I am looking for friends.", "zh": "什么叫做‘驯养’？", "t": [2450, 4288]}, {"en": "What does that mean-- 'tame'?\"", "zh": "” “这是一件被人遗忘干净的事了，”狐狸说，“它的意思就是‘建立联系’……” “建立联系？", "t": [4288, 5675]}]}, {"id": "ch21p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is an act too often neglected,\" said the fox.", "zh": "” “这是一件被人遗忘干净的事了，”狐狸说，“它的意思就是‘建立联系’……” “建立联系？", "t": [138, 3762]}, {"en": "It means to establish ties.\"", "zh": "” “这是一件被人遗忘干净的事了，”狐狸说，“它的意思就是‘建立联系’……” “建立联系？", "t": [3762, 5650]}]}, {"id": "ch21p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"'To establish ties'?\"", "zh": "” “当然，”狐狸说，“对我而言，你不过是一个小男孩，和千千万万的小男孩没有两样。", "t": [100, 1500]}]}, {"id": "ch21p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Just that,\" said the fox.", "zh": "” “当然，”狐狸说，“对我而言，你不过是一个小男孩，和千千万万的小男孩没有两样。", "t": [100, 2388]}, {"en": "\"To me, you are still nothing more than a little boy who is just like a hundred thousand other little boys.", "zh": "” “当然，”狐狸说，“对我而言，你不过是一个小男孩，和千千万万的小男孩没有两样。", "t": [2388, 8338]}, {"en": "And I have no need of you.", "zh": "而且我不需要你，你也不需要我。", "t": [8338, 10162]}, {"en": "And you, on your part, have no need of me.", "zh": "而且我不需要你，你也不需要我。", "t": [10162, 13338]}, {"en": "To you, I am nothing more than a fox like a hundred thousand other foxes.", "zh": "对你而言，我只是一只狐狸，和千千万万只狐狸没有两样。", "t": [13338, 18088]}, {"en": "But if you tame me, then we shall need each other.", "zh": "但如果你驯养了我，我们就互相需要了。", "t": [18088, 21125]}, {"en": "To me, you will be unique in all the world.", "zh": "你就是我世界上惟一的人了，我也是你世上惟一的狐狸了……” “我有点明白了。", "t": [21125, 24075]}, {"en": "To you, I shall be unique in all the world...\"", "zh": "你就是我世界上惟一的人了，我也是你世上惟一的狐狸了……” “我有点明白了。", "t": [24075, 26775]}]}, {"id": "ch21p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am beginning to understand,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [138, 3538]}, {"en": "\"There is a flower...", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [3538, 5075]}, {"en": "I think that she has tamed me...\"", "zh": "“有一朵花儿……我认为她驯养了我……” “这可能，”狐狸说，“地球上有各色各样，形形色色的东西……” “啊！", "t": [5075, 6763]}]}, {"id": "ch21p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is possible,\" said the fox.", "zh": "“有一朵花儿……我认为她驯养了我……” “这可能，”狐狸说，“地球上有各色各样，形形色色的东西……” “啊！", "t": [100, 2600]}, {"en": "\"On the Earth one sees all sorts of things.\"", "zh": "“有一朵花儿……我认为她驯养了我……” “这可能，”狐狸说，“地球上有各色各样，形形色色的东西……” “啊！", "t": [2600, 5050]}]}, {"id": "ch21p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, but this is not on the Earth!\" said the little prince.", "zh": "她不在地球上。", "t": [112, 3475]}]}, {"id": "ch21p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The fox seemed perplexed, and very curious.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [138, 3063]}]}, {"id": "ch21p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"On another planet?\"", "zh": "狐狸露出大惊的神色。", "t": [138, 1350]}]}, {"id": "ch21p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes.\"", "zh": "“在另一个星球上？", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch21p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Are there hunters on this planet?\"", "zh": "“在另一个星球上？", "t": [112, 2038]}]}, {"id": "ch21p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.\"", "zh": "” “是的。", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch21p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah, that is interesting!", "zh": "” “那颗星球上，有猎人吗？", "t": [138, 2050]}, {"en": "Are there chickens?\"", "zh": "” “那颗星球上，有猎人吗？", "t": [2050, 3137]}]}, {"id": "ch21p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No.\"", "zh": "” “没有。", "t": [100, 600]}]}, {"id": "ch21p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Nothing is perfect,\" sighed the fox.", "zh": "” “没有。", "t": [125, 2550]}]}, {"id": "ch21p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he came back to his idea.", "zh": "有鸡吗？", "t": [100, 1888]}]}, {"id": "ch21p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My life is very monotonous,\" the fox said.", "zh": "” “没有。", "t": [138, 3325]}, {"en": "\"I hunt chickens; men hunt me.", "zh": "” “世上就没有十全十美的东西。", "t": [3325, 5888]}, {"en": "All the chickens are just alike, and all the men are just alike.", "zh": "”狐狸叹了一口气。", "t": [5888, 9800]}, {"en": "And, in consequence, I am a little bored.", "zh": "狐狸又扯回原先的话题： “我的生活枯燥乏味，异常单调。", "t": [9800, 13088]}, {"en": "But if you tame me, it will be as if the sun came to shine on my life.", "zh": "我逮鸡，人逮我。", "t": [13088, 17550]}, {"en": "I shall know the sound of a step that will be different from all the others.", "zh": "但如果你驯养我，我的生活就会充满阳光。", "t": [17550, 21650]}, {"en": "Other steps send me hurrying back underneath the ground.", "zh": "我能辨得出与众不同的脚步声。", "t": [21650, 25250]}, {"en": "Yours will call me, like music, out of my burrow.", "zh": "别人的脚步声吓得我赶紧钻回地洞。", "t": [25250, 28800]}, {"en": "And then look: you see the grain-fields down yonder?", "zh": "你的脚步声却像悦耳的音乐，召唤我走出洞穴。", "t": [28800, 32250]}, {"en": "I do not eat bread.", "zh": "你的脚步声却像悦耳的音乐，召唤我走出洞穴。", "t": [32250, 33912]}, {"en": "Wheat is of no use to me.", "zh": "你瞧！", "t": [33912, 35812]}, {"en": "The wheat fields have nothing to say to me.", "zh": "你看那儿，那不是一片麦田吗？", "t": [35812, 38450]}, {"en": "And that is sad.", "zh": "你看那儿，那不是一片麦田吗？", "t": [38450, 39850]}, {"en": "But you have hair that is the colour of gold.", "zh": "我不吃面包，我不需要小麦，麦田引不起我的想像力。", "t": [39850, 42638]}, {"en": "Think how wonderful that will be when you have tamed me!", "zh": "说到这个，实在可悲！", "t": [42638, 45925]}, {"en": "The grain, which is also golden, will bring me back the thought of you.", "zh": "说到这个，实在可悲！", "t": [45925, 50262]}, {"en": "And I shall love to listen to the wind in the wheat...\"", "zh": "但你的头发是金灿灿的，它会叫我想起你的，我就会爱上风吹麦子的声音……”狐狸没说下去，对小王子瞧了好久，又说： “请你……驯养我吧！", "t": [50262, 52974]}]}, {"id": "ch21p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The fox gazed at the little prince, for a long time.", "zh": "但你的头发是金灿灿的，它会叫我想起你的，我就会爱上风吹麦子的声音……”狐狸没说下去，对小王子瞧了好久，又说： “请你……驯养我吧！", "t": [138, 3263]}]}, {"id": "ch21p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Please-- tame me!\" he said.", "zh": "但你的头发是金灿灿的，它会叫我想起你的，我就会爱上风吹麦子的声音……”狐狸没说下去，对小王子瞧了好久，又说： “请你……驯养我吧！", "t": [100, 1674]}]}, {"id": "ch21p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I want to, very much,\" the little prince replied.", "zh": "” “我很愿意，”小王子回答说，“但我的时间不多，我还要寻找朋友，还要了解许多新鲜的事物。", "t": [138, 3762]}, {"en": "\"But I have not much time.", "zh": "” “我很愿意，”小王子回答说，“但我的时间不多，我还要寻找朋友，还要了解许多新鲜的事物。", "t": [3762, 5725]}, {"en": "I have friends to discover, and a great many things to understand.\"", "zh": "” “我很愿意，”小王子回答说，“但我的时间不多，我还要寻找朋友，还要了解许多新鲜的事物。", "t": [5725, 9538]}]}, {"id": "ch21p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"One only understands the things that one tames,\" said the fox.", "zh": "” “人只认识自己驯养的东西。", "t": [138, 4288]}, {"en": "\"Men have no more time to understand anything.", "zh": "”狐狸说。", "t": [4288, 7312]}, {"en": "They buy things all ready made at the shops.", "zh": "“人再没时间认识什么事物。", "t": [7312, 10112]}, {"en": "But there is no shop anywhere where one can buy friendship, and so men have no friends any more.", "zh": "他们到商店买现成的东西，但没有一家商店是出售朋友的，人也就没有朋友了。", "t": [10112, 15612]}, {"en": "If you want a friend, tame me...\"", "zh": "如果你想要朋友，你就驯养我吧！", "t": [15612, 17513]}]}, {"id": "ch21p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What must I do, to tame you?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "” “我该做些什么呢？", "t": [125, 3613]}]}, {"id": "ch21p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You must be very patient,\" replied the fox.", "zh": "“需要非常的耐心。", "t": [138, 3400]}, {"en": "\"First you will sit down at a little distance from me-- like that-- in the grass.", "zh": "“首先你要离我稍远点，坐着，像这样，坐在草地上。", "t": [3400, 7912]}, {"en": "I shall look at you out of the corner of my eye, and you will say nothing.", "zh": "我斜瞟着你，你什么也别对我说。", "t": [7912, 12162]}, {"en": "Words are the source of misunderstandings.", "zh": "语言是误会的源泉。", "t": [12162, 15088]}, {"en": "But you will sit a little closer to me, every day...\"", "zh": "可是每天你可以坐得稍近一点……” 翌日，小王子又来了。", "t": [15088, 18087]}]}, {"id": "ch21p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The next day the little prince came back.", "zh": "可是每天你可以坐得稍近一点……” 翌日，小王子又来了。", "t": [138, 2450]}]}, {"id": "ch21p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It would have been better to come back at the same hour,\" said the fox.", "zh": "“最好在同一个时间来，”狐狸说，“例如，如果你是下午四点钟来的，从三点钟开始，我就开始感觉到幸福的滋味了。", "t": [138, 4075]}, {"en": "\"If, for example, you come at four o'clock in the afternoon, then at three o'clock I shall begin to be happy.", "zh": "越接近四点钟，我越觉得幸福。", "t": [4075, 10400]}, {"en": "I shall feel happier and happier as the hour advances.", "zh": "到了四点钟，我就心神恍惚，坐立不安了。", "t": [10400, 14112]}, {"en": "At four o'clock, I shall already be worrying and jumping about.", "zh": "到了四点钟，我就心神恍惚，坐立不安了。", "t": [14112, 18125]}, {"en": "I shall show you how happy I am!", "zh": "我发现了幸福的价值，但是如果你不按时来，我就不知道几点钟该装扮我的心，仪式还是需要的。", "t": [18125, 20412]}, {"en": "But if you come at just any time, I shall never know at what hour my heart is to be ready to greet you...", "zh": "我发现了幸福的价值，但是如果你不按时来，我就不知道几点钟该装扮我的心，仪式还是需要的。", "t": [20412, 26175]}, {"en": "One must observe the proper rites...\"", "zh": "”小王子问。", "t": [26175, 28350]}]}, {"id": "ch21p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is a rite?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "“这也是一件被人遗忘干净了的事情。", "t": [138, 2750]}]}, {"id": "ch21p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Those also are actions too often neglected,\" said the fox.", "zh": "”狐狸说。", "t": [125, 4388]}, {"en": "\"They are what make one day different from other days, one hour from other hours.", "zh": "“仪式就是使得某一日不同于其他日子，某一个小时不同于别的小时。", "t": [4388, 9125]}, {"en": "There is a rite, for example, among my hunters.", "zh": "比如说，猎人们有个仪式，每逢星期四，他们就与村里的姑娘们跳舞，星期四就成了再美妙不过的日子了！", "t": [9125, 12688]}, {"en": "Every Thursday they dance with the village girls.", "zh": "比如说，猎人们有个仪式，每逢星期四，他们就与村里的姑娘们跳舞，星期四就成了再美妙不过的日子了！", "t": [12688, 15762]}, {"en": "So Thursday is a wonderful day for me!", "zh": "比如说，猎人们有个仪式，每逢星期四，他们就与村里的姑娘们跳舞，星期四就成了再美妙不过的日子了！", "t": [15762, 18412]}, {"en": "I can take a walk as far as the vineyards.", "zh": "我也就可以到葡萄园里去闲逛了。", "t": [18412, 21175]}, {"en": "But if the hunters danced at just any time, every day would be like every other day, and I should never have any vacation at all.\"", "zh": "如果猎人跳舞不挑日子，每一天都一样，我就没有假期了。", "t": [21175, 27962]}]}, {"id": "ch21p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So the little prince tamed the fox.", "zh": "小王子要走的时候到了。", "t": [112, 2662]}, {"en": "And when the hour of his departure drew near--", "zh": "“啊！", "t": [2662, 5100]}]}, {"id": "ch21p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah,\" said the fox, \"I shall cry.\"", "zh": "”狐狸说，“……我想哭了。", "t": [125, 2525]}]}, {"id": "ch21p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is your own fault,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "” “这就是你的不对了，”小王子说，“我一点也不想伤害你，但你却要我驯养你……” “不错。", "t": [138, 3150]}, {"en": "\"I never wished you any sort of harm; but you wanted me to tame you...\"", "zh": "” “这就是你的不对了，”小王子说，“我一点也不想伤害你，但你却要我驯养你……” “不错。", "t": [3150, 7000]}]}, {"id": "ch21p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is so,\" said the fox.", "zh": "”狐狸说。", "t": [112, 2574]}]}, {"id": "ch21p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But now you are going to cry!\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“但你却想哭！", "t": [100, 2938]}]}, {"id": "ch21p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is so,\" said the fox.", "zh": "”狐狸说。", "t": [112, 2574]}]}, {"id": "ch21p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then it has done you no good at all!\"", "zh": "“那你是一无所获了！", "t": [125, 1988]}]}, {"id": "ch21p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It has done me good,\" said the fox, \"because of the colour of the wheat fields.\" And then he added:", "zh": "” “我有收获的，”狐狸说，“我得到了小麦的颜色。", "t": [138, 5926]}]}, {"id": "ch21p48", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Go and look again at the roses.", "zh": "” 然后他又说： “你去探望玫瑰花们吧，你就会明白，你的玫瑰花是世界上独一无二的花儿。", "t": [100, 2338]}, {"en": "You will understand now that yours is unique in all the world.", "zh": "” 然后他又说： “你去探望玫瑰花们吧，你就会明白，你的玫瑰花是世界上独一无二的花儿。", "t": [2338, 6312]}, {"en": "Then come back to say goodbye to me, and I will make you a present of a secret.\"", "zh": "然后你回来与我告别，我会送你一桩秘密作为礼物。", "t": [6312, 10612]}]}, {"id": "ch21p49", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince went away, to look again at the roses.", "zh": "然后你回来与我告别，我会送你一桩秘密作为礼物。", "t": [138, 3400]}]}, {"id": "ch21p50", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are not at all like my rose,\" he said.", "zh": "” 小王子探望玫瑰花们，并对她们说： “你们一点也不像我的玫瑰，你们还无足轻重，没有人驯养你们，你们也没有驯养任何人。", "t": [138, 3000]}, {"en": "\"As yet you are nothing.", "zh": "” 小王子探望玫瑰花们，并对她们说： “你们一点也不像我的玫瑰，你们还无足轻重，没有人驯养你们，你们也没有驯养任何人。", "t": [3000, 4712]}, {"en": "No one has tamed you, and you have tamed no one.", "zh": "” 小王子探望玫瑰花们，并对她们说： “你们一点也不像我的玫瑰，你们还无足轻重，没有人驯养你们，你们也没有驯养任何人。", "t": [4712, 8075]}, {"en": "You are like my fox when I first knew him.", "zh": "你们的今天如同我的狐狸的昨天。", "t": [8075, 10912]}, {"en": "He was only a fox like a hundred thousand other foxes.", "zh": "你们的今天如同我的狐狸的昨天。", "t": [10912, 14500]}, {"en": "But I have made him my friend, and now he is unique in all the world.\"", "zh": "昨天的他与千千万万的狐狸一样，但自从我让他做了我的朋友，他就是世上绝无仅有的狐狸了。", "t": [14500, 18338]}]}, {"id": "ch21p51", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the roses were very much embarrassed.", "zh": "昨天的他与千千万万的狐狸一样，但自从我让他做了我的朋友，他就是世上绝无仅有的狐狸了。", "t": [138, 2525]}]}, {"id": "ch21p52", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are beautiful, but you are empty,\" he went on.", "zh": "” 玫瑰花们听了心里怪不自在的。", "t": [138, 3712]}, {"en": "\"One could not die for you.", "zh": "” 玫瑰花们听了心里怪不自在的。", "t": [3712, 5562]}, {"en": "To be sure, an ordinary passer-by would think that my rose looked just like you-- the rose that belongs to me.", "zh": "“你们长得很美，但你们的感情世界一片空白。", "t": [5562, 11650]}, {"en": "But in herself alone she is more important than all the hundreds of you other roses: because it is she that I have watered; because it is she that I have put under the glass globe; because it is she that I have sheltered behind the screen; because it is for her that I have killed the caterpillars (except the two or three that we saved to become butterflies); because it is she that I have listened to, when she grumbled, or boasted, or even sometimes when she said nothing.", "zh": "我为她杀死了几条毛虫（除了两三条我没杀，要让它们变成蝴蝶），我倾听她的抱怨，或她的吹嘘，有时也看着她默默无语的样子，因为她是我的玫瑰。", "t": [11650, 36138]}, {"en": "Because she is my rose.", "zh": "“别了。", "t": [36138, 37638]}]}, {"id": "ch21p53", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he went back to meet the fox.", "zh": "“别了。", "t": [138, 2026]}]}, {"id": "ch21p54", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" he said.", "zh": "“别了。", "t": [100, 1574]}]}, {"id": "ch21p55", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Goodbye,\" said the fox.", "zh": "”他说…… “别了，”狐狸说，“这就是我的秘密，它很简单：用心去看才能看清楚，用眼睛是看不见本质的东西的。", "t": [100, 2288]}, {"en": "\"And now here is my secret, a very simple secret: It is only with the heart that one can see rightly; what is essential is invisible to the eye.\"", "zh": "”他说…… “别了，”狐狸说，“这就是我的秘密，它很简单：用心去看才能看清楚，用眼睛是看不见本质的东西的。", "t": [2288, 10512]}]}, {"id": "ch21p56", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What is essential is invisible to the eye,\" the little prince repeated, so that he would be sure to remember.", "zh": "”小王子重复念叨这句话，为了把它牢牢记住。", "t": [125, 6075]}]}, {"id": "ch21p57", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is the time you have wasted for your rose that makes your rose so important.\"", "zh": "“你为你的玫瑰失去的时间，使你的玫瑰变得重要了。", "t": [138, 4374]}]}, {"id": "ch21p58", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is the time I have wasted for my rose--\" said the little prince, so that he would be sure to remember.", "zh": "” “我为我的玫瑰失去的时间，使我的玫瑰……”小王子说道，为了把它记住。", "t": [138, 5413]}]}, {"id": "ch21p59", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Men have forgotten this truth,\" said the fox.", "zh": "“人忘记了这条真理，”狐狸说，“但你不该忘。", "t": [112, 3275]}, {"en": "\"But you must not forget it.", "zh": "“人忘记了这条真理，”狐狸说，“但你不该忘。", "t": [3275, 5362]}, {"en": "You become responsible, forever, for what you have tamed.", "zh": "你应该永远对你驯养的对象负责，你要对你的玫瑰负责……” “我要对我的玫瑰负责……”小王子反复念叨狐狸的教诲，为了牢牢记住它。", "t": [5362, 9350]}, {"en": "You are responsible for your rose...\"", "zh": "你应该永远对你驯养的对象负责，你要对你的玫瑰负责……” “我要对我的玫瑰负责……”小王子反复念叨狐狸的教诲，为了牢牢记住它。", "t": [9350, 11387]}]}, {"id": "ch21p60", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am responsible for my rose,\" the little prince repeated, so that he would be sure to remember.", "zh": "你应该永远对你驯养的对象负责，你要对你的玫瑰负责……” “我要对我的玫瑰负责……”小王子反复念叨狐狸的教诲，为了牢牢记住它。", "t": [138, 5475]}]}]}, {"id": "ch22", "title_en": "Chapter XXII", "title_zh": "第 22 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch22p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [112, 2312]}]}, {"id": "ch22p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the railway switchman.", "zh": "”扳道工说。", "t": [100, 2513]}]}, {"id": "ch22p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What do you do here?\" the little prince asked.", "zh": "” “我给旅客们分组。", "t": [125, 2737]}]}, {"id": "ch22p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I sort out travellers, in bundles of a thousand,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "”扳道工说。", "t": [138, 4588]}, {"en": "\"I send off the trains that carry them; now to the right, now to the left.\"", "zh": "“载乘客的火车也由我调度，它们有时开往左方，有时开往右方。", "t": [4588, 8888]}]}, {"id": "ch22p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And a brilliantly lighted express train shook the switchman's cabin as it rushed by with a roar like thunder.", "zh": "” 一列灯火通明的火车风驰电掣般奔来，轰隆隆的响声震得调度室抖动摇晃。", "t": [138, 5962]}]}, {"id": "ch22p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"They are in a great hurry,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [125, 3212]}, {"en": "\"What are they looking for?\"", "zh": "“他们寻找什么？", "t": [3212, 4563]}]}, {"id": "ch22p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Not even the locomotive engineer knows that,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "” “坐在火车头上的人也不知道他们要寻找什么。", "t": [125, 3788]}]}, {"id": "ch22p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And a second brilliantly lighted express thundered by, in the opposite direction.", "zh": "第二列灯火通明的火车轰隆隆地，从相反的方向奔驰而来。", "t": [125, 4813]}]}, {"id": "ch22p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Are they coming back already?\" demanded the little prince.", "zh": "“他们已经回来了？", "t": [138, 3388]}]}, {"id": "ch22p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"These are not the same ones,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "”小王子问…… “这列车坐的不是刚才那些人。", "t": [125, 3100]}, {"en": "\"It is an exchange.\"", "zh": "”扳道工说。", "t": [3100, 4325]}]}, {"id": "ch22p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Were they not satisfied where they were?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "“这是对开的火车。", "t": [138, 3776]}]}, {"id": "ch22p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"No one is ever satisfied where he is,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "” “人总是这山望着那山高的。", "t": [125, 3500]}]}, {"id": "ch22p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And they heard the roaring thunder of a third brilliantly lighted express.", "zh": "第三列灯火通明的火车也轰隆隆地响起来了。", "t": [138, 4124]}]}, {"id": "ch22p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Are they pursuing the first travellers?\" demanded the little prince.", "zh": "“他们在追赶第一批旅客吗？", "t": [138, 3913]}]}, {"id": "ch22p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"They are pursuing nothing at all,\" said the switchman.", "zh": "”小王子问。", "t": [138, 3375]}, {"en": "\"They are asleep in there, or if they are not asleep they are yawning.", "zh": "“他们从不追赶人，”扳道工说，“他们在车厢里睡大觉或打哈欠，只有孩子们才把鼻子贴在玻璃窗上看外面的世界。", "t": [3375, 7125]}, {"en": "Only the children are flattening their noses against the windowpanes.\"", "zh": "” “只有孩子才知道他们要寻觅什么。", "t": [7125, 10963]}]}, {"id": "ch22p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Only the children know what they are looking for,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [112, 4200]}, {"en": "\"They waste their time over a rag doll and it becomes very important to them; and if anybody takes it away from them, they cry...\"", "zh": "“他们花不少时间与布娃娃玩，布娃娃变得很重要，如果有人抢走他们的布娃娃，他们就哭鼻子……” “他们是有运气的人……”", "t": [4200, 11200]}]}, {"id": "ch22p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"They are lucky,\" the switchman said.", "zh": "“他们花不少时间与布娃娃玩，布娃娃变得很重要，如果有人抢走他们的布娃娃，他们就哭鼻子……” “他们是有运气的人……”", "t": [138, 2213]}]}]}, {"id": "ch23", "title_en": "Chapter XXIII", "title_zh": "第 23 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch23p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [112, 2312]}]}, {"id": "ch23p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Good morning,\" said the merchant.", "zh": "”商人说。", "t": [100, 2500]}, {"en": "This was a merchant who sold pills that had been invented to quench thirst.", "zh": "这位商人贩卖解渴的药丸。", "t": [2500, 6962]}, {"en": "You need only swallow one pill a week, and you would feel no need of anything to drink.", "zh": "“为什么你卖这种药？", "t": [6962, 11476]}]}, {"id": "ch23p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why are you selling those?\" asked the little prince.", "zh": "”小王子问。", "t": [125, 3063]}]}, {"id": "ch23p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because they save a tremendous amount of time,\" said the merchant.", "zh": "“为了节省更多的时间，”商人说，“专家们计算过，每个星期能节省五十三分钟。", "t": [100, 4125]}, {"en": "\"Computations have been made by experts.", "zh": "“为了节省更多的时间，”商人说，“专家们计算过，每个星期能节省五十三分钟。", "t": [4125, 7238]}, {"en": "With these pills, you save fifty-three minutes in every week.\"", "zh": "” “节省的这五十三分钟，有什么用途？", "t": [7238, 10913]}]}, {"id": "ch23p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And what do I do with those fifty-three minutes?\"", "zh": "” “节省的这五十三分钟，有什么用途？", "t": [112, 2712]}]}, {"id": "ch23p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Anything you like...\"", "zh": "” “人可以干自己愿意干的事……” 小王子想：“要是我节省下这五十三分钟，我就要悠闲自在地朝一泓泉水走去……”", "t": [100, 1300]}]}, {"id": "ch23p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"As for me,\" said the little prince to himself, \"if I had fifty-three minutes to spend as I liked, I should walk at my leisure toward a spring of fresh water.\"", "zh": "” “人可以干自己愿意干的事……” 小王子想：“要是我节省下这五十三分钟，我就要悠闲自在地朝一泓泉水走去……”", "t": [138, 8512]}]}]}, {"id": "ch24", "title_en": "Chapter XXIV", "title_zh": "第 24 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch24p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "It was now the eighth day since I had had my accident in the desert, and I had listened to the story of the merchant as I was drinking the last drop of my water supply.", "zh": "我的飞机在沙漠出故障的第八天，我听到了商人的故事，此时我储存的水已喝完了，一滴不剩。", "t": [138, 8713]}]}, {"id": "ch24p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah,\" I said to the little prince, \"these memories of yours are very charming; but I have not yet succeeded in repairing my plane; I have nothing more to drink; and I, too, should be very happy if I could walk at my leisure toward a spring of fresh water!\"", "zh": "你的这些回忆挺美好的，但我还没修好我的飞机，我的水也喝完了，如果我能悠闲自在地向一泓泉水走过去，我也会很幸福快活的！", "t": [125, 13663]}]}, {"id": "ch24p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My friend the fox--\" the little prince said to me.", "zh": "” “我的朋友狐狸告诉我……” “我的小人儿，别再说狐狸的事了！", "t": [138, 2662]}]}, {"id": "ch24p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"My dear little man, this is no longer a matter that has anything to do with the fox!\"", "zh": "” “为什么？", "t": [112, 4825]}]}, {"id": "ch24p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Why not?\"", "zh": "” “因为我快渴死了……” 他听不懂我说的理由。", "t": [112, 850]}]}, {"id": "ch24p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Because I am about to die of thirst...\"", "zh": "” “因为我快渴死了……” 他听不懂我说的理由。", "t": [100, 2237]}]}, {"id": "ch24p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He did not follow my reasoning, and he answered me:", "zh": "他说道： “有个朋友真好，哪怕命在旦夕。", "t": [138, 2950]}]}, {"id": "ch24p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is a good thing to have had a friend, even if one is about to die.", "zh": "他说道： “有个朋友真好，哪怕命在旦夕。", "t": [138, 4238]}, {"en": "I, for instance, am very glad to have had a fox as a friend...\"", "zh": "我很满意狐狸做了我的朋友……” 我想：“他不知道危险的可怕，他从未尝过饥渴的滋味。", "t": [4238, 8175]}]}, {"id": "ch24p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"He has no way of guessing the danger,\" I said to myself.", "zh": "我很满意狐狸做了我的朋友……” 我想：“他不知道危险的可怕，他从未尝过饥渴的滋味。", "t": [138, 3850]}, {"en": "\"He has never been either hungry or thirsty.", "zh": "他只要一点儿阳光就满足了……” 他看着我，似乎猜中了我的念头： “我也渴……我们去找一口井吧……” 我做了个无法可想的手势。", "t": [3850, 6650]}, {"en": "A little sunshine is all he needs...\"", "zh": "他只要一点儿阳光就满足了……” 他看着我，似乎猜中了我的念头： “我也渴……我们去找一口井吧……” 我做了个无法可想的手势。", "t": [6650, 8875]}]}, {"id": "ch24p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he looked at me steadily, and replied to my thought:", "zh": "他只要一点儿阳光就满足了……” 他看着我，似乎猜中了我的念头： “我也渴……我们去找一口井吧……” 我做了个无法可想的手势。", "t": [100, 3250]}]}, {"id": "ch24p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am thirsty, too.", "zh": "他只要一点儿阳光就满足了……” 他看着我，似乎猜中了我的念头： “我也渴……我们去找一口井吧……” 我做了个无法可想的手势。", "t": [100, 2138]}, {"en": "Let us look for a well...\"", "zh": "在一望无际的沙漠中寻一口井，这不是太荒唐了吗？", "t": [2138, 3637]}]}, {"id": "ch24p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I made a gesture of weariness.", "zh": "在一望无际的沙漠中寻一口井，这不是太荒唐了吗？", "t": [138, 2462]}, {"en": "It is absurd to look for a well, at random, in the immensity of the desert.", "zh": "在一望无际的沙漠中寻一口井，这不是太荒唐了吗？", "t": [2462, 7162]}, {"en": "But nevertheless we started walking.", "zh": "但我们还是出发去寻找了。", "t": [7162, 9350]}]}, {"id": "ch24p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "When we had trudged along for several hours, in silence, the darkness fell, and the stars began to come out.", "zh": "夜幕降临，天上现出星星。", "t": [138, 6838]}, {"en": "Thirst had made me a little feverish, and I looked at them as if I were in a dream.", "zh": "由于干渴，我在发烧，看见星星，还以为自己在梦中呢。", "t": [6838, 11675]}, {"en": "The little prince's last words came reeling back into my memory:", "zh": "小王子说的话也似乎在我的脑海中跳跃。", "t": [11675, 15325]}]}, {"id": "ch24p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then you are thirsty, too?\" I demanded.", "zh": "”我问他。", "t": [125, 3250]}]}, {"id": "ch24p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he did not reply to my question.", "zh": "”我问他。", "t": [100, 2650]}, {"en": "He merely said to me:", "zh": "他不回答我的问题，只简单地对我说： “水对心也有好处……” 我听不懂他的话，但我不做声……我知道不应该问他。", "t": [2650, 3900]}]}, {"id": "ch24p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Water may also be good for the heart...\"", "zh": "他不回答我的问题，只简单地对我说： “水对心也有好处……” 我听不懂他的话，但我不做声……我知道不应该问他。", "t": [125, 2412]}]}, {"id": "ch24p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not understand this answer, but I said nothing.", "zh": "他不回答我的问题，只简单地对我说： “水对心也有好处……” 我听不懂他的话，但我不做声……我知道不应该问他。", "t": [138, 3700]}, {"en": "I knew very well that it was impossible to cross-examine him.", "zh": "他走乏了，坐了下来。", "t": [3700, 7126]}]}, {"id": "ch24p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was tired.", "zh": "我靠着他坐下。", "t": [138, 1512]}, {"en": "He sat down.", "zh": "我靠着他坐下。", "t": [1512, 2888]}, {"en": "I sat down beside him.", "zh": "我靠着他坐下。", "t": [2888, 4850]}, {"en": "And, after a little silence, he spoke again: \"The stars are beautiful, because of a flower that cannot be seen.\"", "zh": "沉默了一会，他又说： “星星美丽，因为里面有一朵看不见的花。", "t": [4850, 11424]}]}, {"id": "ch24p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I replied, \"Yes, that is so.\" And, without saying anything more, I looked across the ridges of sand that were stretched out before us in the moonlight.", "zh": "”然后我不做声，看着月光下的起伏的沙丘。", "t": [138, 9300]}]}, {"id": "ch24p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The desert is beautiful,\" the little prince added.", "zh": "我素来喜爱沙漠。", "t": [138, 3112]}]}, {"id": "ch24p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And that was true.", "zh": "我们坐在沙丘上。", "t": [112, 1625]}, {"en": "I have always loved the desert.", "zh": "我们无所见，我们无所闻。", "t": [1625, 3862]}, {"en": "One sits down on a desert sand dune, sees nothing, hears nothing.", "zh": "然而，有什么东西在静静地发光…… “沙漠美丽，因为沙漠的某处隐藏着一口井。", "t": [3862, 8475]}, {"en": "Yet through the silence something throbs, and gleams...", "zh": "然而，有什么东西在静静地发光…… “沙漠美丽，因为沙漠的某处隐藏着一口井。", "t": [8475, 11712]}]}, {"id": "ch24p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What makes the desert beautiful,\" said the little prince, \"is that somewhere it hides a well...\"", "zh": "”小王子说。", "t": [125, 5200]}]}, {"id": "ch24p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I was astonished by a sudden understanding of that mysterious radiation of the sands.", "zh": "我吃了一惊，因为我突然明白，沙漠中那神秘的闪闪发亮的东西是什么了。", "t": [138, 5562]}, {"en": "When I was a little boy I lived in an old house, and legend told us that a treasure was buried there.", "zh": "传说里面埋藏着一件宝物。", "t": [5562, 11375]}, {"en": "To be sure, no one had ever known how to find it; perhaps no one had ever even looked for it.", "zh": "也许甚至没人去找它。", "t": [11375, 17088]}, {"en": "But it cast an enchantment over that house.", "zh": "但它像给这幢屋子施了魔法，让它凭空增添了吸引力。", "t": [17088, 20050]}, {"en": "My home was hiding a secret in the depths of its heart...", "zh": "但它像给这幢屋子施了魔法，让它凭空增添了吸引力。", "t": [20050, 23362]}]}, {"id": "ch24p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes,\" I said to the little prince.", "zh": "房里埋藏着秘密…… “你说得对，”我对小王子说，“房子也好，星星、沙漠也好，美化它们的东西是肉眼看不见的！", "t": [138, 2775]}, {"en": "\"The house, the stars, the desert-- what gives them their beauty is something that is invisible!\"", "zh": "房里埋藏着秘密…… “你说得对，”我对小王子说，“房子也好，星星、沙漠也好，美化它们的东西是肉眼看不见的！", "t": [2775, 8013]}]}, {"id": "ch24p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am glad,\" he said, \"that you agree with my fox.\"", "zh": "” “我很欣慰，”他说，“你同意狐狸的看法。", "t": [138, 3387]}]}, {"id": "ch24p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As the little prince dropped off to sleep, I took him in my arms and set out walking once more.", "zh": "” 小王子入睡了。", "t": [138, 5700]}, {"en": "I felt deeply moved, and stirred.", "zh": "我把他抱在怀里，继续走我们的路。", "t": [5700, 8388]}, {"en": "It seemed to me that I was carrying a very fragile treasure.", "zh": "我受了感动。", "t": [8388, 12100]}, {"en": "It seemed to me, even, that there was nothing more fragile on all Earth.", "zh": "我甚至觉得地球上没有比他更脆弱的东西了。", "t": [12100, 16600]}, {"en": "In the moonlight I looked at his pale forehead, his closed eyes, his locks of hair that trembled in the wind, and I said to myself: \"What I see here is nothing but a shell.", "zh": "借着银色的月光，我细细看他苍白的前额、闭着的双目、随风抖动的绺绺秀发。", "t": [16600, 26550]}, {"en": "What is most important is invisible...\"", "zh": "我心想：“我看见的只是一具躯壳，最重要的东西是看不见的……” 他半张的嘴唇上泛出浅浅的微笑。", "t": [26550, 28950]}]}, {"id": "ch24p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "As his lips opened slightly with the suspicious of a half-smile, I said to myself, again: \"What moves me so deeply, about this little prince who is sleeping here, is his loyalty to a flower-- the image of a rose that shines through his whole being like the flame of a lamp, even when he is asleep...\" And I felt him to be more fragile still.", "zh": "我又想：“这位睡着了的小王子打动了我，而打动了我的是他对花的忠贞。", "t": [100, 18888]}, {"en": "I felt the need of protecting him, as if he himself were a flame that might be extinguished by a little puff of wind...", "zh": "灯是需要我们小心保护的，一股风就会把它吹灭……我就这样走着，曙光初露时我看见了那口井。", "t": [18888, 25187]}]}, {"id": "ch24p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And, as I walked on so, I found the well, at daybreak.", "zh": "灯是需要我们小心保护的，一股风就会把它吹灭……我就这样走着，曙光初露时我看见了那口井。", "t": [112, 4026]}]}]}, {"id": "ch25", "title_en": "Chapter XXV", "title_zh": "第 25 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch25p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Men,\" said the little prince, \"set out on their way in express trains, but they do not know what they are looking for.", "zh": "“人挤在快车的车厢里，”小王子说，“却不知道他们要寻找什么。", "t": [125, 6688]}, {"en": "Then they rush about, and get excited, and turn round and round...\"", "zh": "他们焦躁不安，团团乱转……” 他又说： “这又何苦呢……” 我们找到的井不像撒哈拉沙漠的井。", "t": [6688, 10712]}]}, {"id": "ch25p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he added: \"It is not worth the trouble...\"", "zh": "他们焦躁不安，团团乱转……” 他又说： “这又何苦呢……” 我们找到的井不像撒哈拉沙漠的井。", "t": [112, 2625]}]}, {"id": "ch25p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The well that we had come to was not like the wells of the Sahara.", "zh": "撒哈拉沙漠的井是在沙里挖个洞，而我们找到的这口井与村子里的井一样，可是这儿没有一个村子。", "t": [125, 4038]}, {"en": "The wells of the Sahara are mere holes dug in the sand.", "zh": "撒哈拉沙漠的井是在沙里挖个洞，而我们找到的这口井与村子里的井一样，可是这儿没有一个村子。", "t": [4038, 7525]}, {"en": "This one was like a well in a village.", "zh": "撒哈拉沙漠的井是在沙里挖个洞，而我们找到的这口井与村子里的井一样，可是这儿没有一个村子。", "t": [7525, 10012]}, {"en": "But there was no village here, and I thought I must be dreaming...", "zh": "我以为我正在做梦。", "t": [10012, 13400]}]}, {"id": "ch25p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is strange,\" I said to the little prince.", "zh": "“这就奇了，”我对小王子说，“这井一切齐备：辘轳，水桶，绳子……” 他笑了，抓住绳子，转动辘轳。", "t": [138, 3075]}, {"en": "\"Everything is ready for use: the pulley, the bucket, the rope...\"", "zh": "“这就奇了，”我对小王子说，“这井一切齐备：辘轳，水桶，绳子……” 他笑了，抓住绳子，转动辘轳。", "t": [3075, 7175]}]}, {"id": "ch25p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He laughed, touched the rope, and set the pulley to working.", "zh": "辘轳吱吱呀呀地叫唤，活像一只老风信鸡在风长睡时的叫唤。", "t": [138, 4138]}, {"en": "And the pulley moaned, like an old weathervane, which the wind has long since forgotten.", "zh": "辘轳吱吱呀呀地叫唤，活像一只老风信鸡在风长睡时的叫唤。", "t": [4138, 8812]}]}, {"id": "ch25p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Do you hear?\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“你听，”小王子说，“我们唤醒了这口井。", "t": [138, 2812]}, {"en": "\"We have wakened the well, and it is singing...\"", "zh": "它在唱歌呢……” 我不忍心看他劳力费神。", "t": [2812, 5326]}]}, {"id": "ch25p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I did not want him to tire himself with the rope.", "zh": "“让我来干吧，”我对他说，“你干这活太重了。", "t": [138, 2850]}]}, {"id": "ch25p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Leave it to me,\" I said.", "zh": "“让我来干吧，”我对他说，“你干这活太重了。", "t": [112, 2188]}, {"en": "\"It is too heavy for you.\"", "zh": "“让我来干吧，”我对他说，“你干这活太重了。", "t": [2188, 3724]}]}, {"id": "ch25p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I hoisted the bucket slowly to the edge of the well and set it there-- happy, tired as I was, over my achievement.", "zh": "” 我轻轻把水桶提到井口，垂直放进井内。", "t": [138, 6938]}, {"en": "The song of the pulley was still in my ears, and I could see the sunlight shimmer in the still trembling water.", "zh": "“我渴望的就是这样的水，”小王子说，“让我喝上几口……”我明白他要寻找什么了。", "t": [6938, 12713]}]}, {"id": "ch25p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am thirsty for this water,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "“我渴望的就是这样的水，”小王子说，“让我喝上几口……”我明白他要寻找什么了。", "t": [138, 3600]}, {"en": "\"Give me some of it to drink...\"", "zh": "我把桶举到他的唇边。", "t": [3600, 5263]}]}, {"id": "ch25p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And I understood what he had been looking for.", "zh": "他闭着双目喝水。", "t": [138, 2463]}]}, {"id": "ch25p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I raised the bucket to his lips.", "zh": "这水不仅是饮料，它还是别的东西。", "t": [138, 2488]}, {"en": "He drank, his eyes closed.", "zh": "这水不仅是饮料，它还是别的东西。", "t": [2488, 4838]}, {"en": "It was as sweet as some special festival treat.", "zh": "它是经过星光下的跋涉，在辘轳的歌声中和在我双臂的努力下诞生的。", "t": [4838, 8150]}, {"en": "This water was indeed a different thing from ordinary nourishment.", "zh": "它是经过星光下的跋涉，在辘轳的歌声中和在我双臂的努力下诞生的。", "t": [8150, 12375]}, {"en": "Its sweetness was born of the walk under the stars, the song of the pulley, and the effort of my arms.", "zh": "它像礼物一样愉悦心灵。", "t": [12375, 18412]}, {"en": "It was good for the heart, like a present.", "zh": "我还是小男孩的时候，圣诞树上挂的灯、子夜弥撒的音乐、甜蜜的微笑，是我收到的圣诞礼物的光芒。", "t": [18412, 21275]}, {"en": "When I was a little boy, the lights of the Christmas tree, the music of the Midnight Mass, the tenderness of smiling faces, used to make up, so, the radiance of the gifts I received.", "zh": "“你们这儿的人在一个园里种植五千株玫瑰……但他们却找不到他们寻觅的东西……” “他们没找到。", "t": [21275, 31800]}]}, {"id": "ch25p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The men where you live,\" said the little prince, \"raise five thousand roses in the same garden-- and they do not find in it what they are looking for.\"", "zh": "”我说…… “然而他们寻找的东西可以在一朵玫瑰或一点点水里找到的……” “不错。", "t": [138, 7500]}]}, {"id": "ch25p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"They do not find it,\" I replied.", "zh": "”我回答说。", "t": [138, 2250]}]}, {"id": "ch25p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And yet what they are looking for could be found in one single rose, or in a little water.\"", "zh": "小王子又说： “然而肉眼是看不见的，要用心灵去寻找。", "t": [138, 5124]}]}, {"id": "ch25p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, that is true,\" I said.", "zh": "” 我喝了水，呼吸畅通了。", "t": [112, 2337]}]}, {"id": "ch25p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And the little prince added:", "zh": "天亮时分，沙子颜色如蜜。", "t": [138, 1750]}]}, {"id": "ch25p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But the eyes are blind.", "zh": "我也喜欢蜜般的颜色。", "t": [100, 1925]}, {"en": "One must look with the heart...\"", "zh": "我也喜欢蜜般的颜色。", "t": [1925, 3600]}]}, {"id": "ch25p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I had drunk the water.", "zh": "但为什么我的心里总有点不快乐呢？", "t": [138, 1925]}, {"en": "I breathed easily.", "zh": "但为什么我的心里总有点不快乐呢？", "t": [1925, 3525]}, {"en": "At sunrise the sand is the colour of honey.", "zh": "…… “你可要履行诺言啊。", "t": [3525, 6400]}, {"en": "And that honey colour was making me happy, too.", "zh": "”小王子轻声对我说，他又靠近我坐着。", "t": [6400, 9675]}, {"en": "What brought me, then, this sense of grief?", "zh": "“什么诺言？", "t": [9675, 12413]}]}, {"id": "ch25p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You must keep your promise,\" said the little prince, softly, as he sat down beside me once more.", "zh": "” “你知道的呀……给我的绵羊画一个口罩，我要对我的花儿负责呀！", "t": [138, 5863]}]}, {"id": "ch25p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What promise?\"", "zh": "” 我从口袋里掏出画稿。", "t": [112, 1075]}]}, {"id": "ch25p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know-- a muzzle for my sheep...", "zh": "” 我从口袋里掏出画稿。", "t": [138, 2288]}, {"en": "I am responsible for this flower...\"", "zh": "小王子看后，笑着对我说： “你画的猴面包树有点像卷心菜……” “呀！", "t": [2288, 4300]}]}, {"id": "ch25p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I took my rough drafts of drawings out of my pocket.", "zh": "小王子看后，笑着对我说： “你画的猴面包树有点像卷心菜……” “呀！", "t": [138, 3662]}, {"en": "The little prince looked them over, and laughed as he said:", "zh": "” 我还为我画的猴面包树自鸣得意呢！", "t": [3662, 6863]}]}, {"id": "ch25p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Your baobabs-- they look a little like cabbages.\"", "zh": "“你画的狐狸……它的耳朵……有点像角……太长了！", "t": [138, 2662]}]}, {"id": "ch25p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh!\"", "zh": "“你画的狐狸……它的耳朵……有点像角……太长了！", "t": [100, 412]}]}, {"id": "ch25p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I had been so proud of my baobabs!", "zh": "“你画的狐狸……它的耳朵……有点像角……太长了！", "t": [138, 2262]}]}, {"id": "ch25p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Your fox-- his ears look a little like horns; and they are too long.\"", "zh": "“你不公平，小人儿。", "t": [138, 3788]}]}, {"id": "ch25p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he laughed again.", "zh": "“你不公平，小人儿。", "t": [138, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch25p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You are not fair, little prince,\" I said.", "zh": "我并不会画画，只会画打开了肚子的蟒蛇和没打开肚子的蟒蛇。", "t": [138, 3200]}, {"en": "\"I don't know how to draw anything except boa constrictors from the outside and boa constrictors from the inside.\"", "zh": "很不错的嘛，孩子们看得懂的。", "t": [3200, 9287]}]}, {"id": "ch25p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Oh, that will be all right,\" he said, \"children understand.\"", "zh": "”他说。", "t": [125, 3962]}]}, {"id": "ch25p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "So then I made a pencil sketch of a muzzle.", "zh": "我用铅笔画了一个口罩，把它交给他的时候，我的心揪得紧紧的： “你已有了我不知道的计划吧……” 但他避而不答。", "t": [125, 2912]}, {"en": "And as I gave it to him my heart was torn.", "zh": "我用铅笔画了一个口罩，把它交给他的时候，我的心揪得紧紧的： “你已有了我不知道的计划吧……” 但他避而不答。", "t": [2912, 5388]}]}, {"id": "ch25p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You have plans that I do not know about,\" I said.", "zh": "我用铅笔画了一个口罩，把它交给他的时候，我的心揪得紧紧的： “你已有了我不知道的计划吧……” 但他避而不答。", "t": [138, 3124]}]}, {"id": "ch25p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he did not answer me.", "zh": "他只对我说： “你知道，我落到地球上……明天已是一周年了……” 然后，沉默片刻，他又说： “当时我就落在附近……” 他的脸红了。", "t": [100, 1875]}, {"en": "He said to me, instead:", "zh": "他只对我说： “你知道，我落到地球上……明天已是一周年了……” 然后，沉默片刻，他又说： “当时我就落在附近……” 他的脸红了。", "t": [1875, 3600]}]}, {"id": "ch25p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know-- my descent to the earth...", "zh": "他只对我说： “你知道，我落到地球上……明天已是一周年了……” 然后，沉默片刻，他又说： “当时我就落在附近……” 他的脸红了。", "t": [138, 2362]}, {"en": "Tomorrow will be its anniversary.\"", "zh": "他只对我说： “你知道，我落到地球上……明天已是一周年了……” 然后，沉默片刻，他又说： “当时我就落在附近……” 他的脸红了。", "t": [2362, 4313]}]}, {"id": "ch25p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then, after a silence, he went on:", "zh": "他只对我说： “你知道，我落到地球上……明天已是一周年了……” 然后，沉默片刻，他又说： “当时我就落在附近……” 他的脸红了。", "t": [125, 2776]}]}, {"id": "ch25p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I came down very near here.\"", "zh": "不知何故，我有说不出来的惆怅悲哀。", "t": [138, 1900]}]}, {"id": "ch25p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he flushed.", "zh": "不知何故，我有说不出来的惆怅悲哀。", "t": [138, 1088]}]}, {"id": "ch25p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And once again, without understanding why, I had a queer sense of sorrow.", "zh": "不知何故，我有说不出来的惆怅悲哀。", "t": [138, 4975]}, {"en": "One question, however, occurred to me:", "zh": "我提出了一个问题： “这么说，一个星期之前，认识你的那天早上，你不是偶尔一人来到这远离人烟的沙漠的？", "t": [4975, 7588]}]}, {"id": "ch25p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then it was not by chance that on the morning when I first met you-- a week ago-- you were strolling along like that, all alone, a thousand miles from any inhabited region?", "zh": "你要回到你的降落点去？", "t": [125, 9250]}, {"en": "You were on the your back to the place where you landed?\"", "zh": "我犹豫着又问： “也许是为了纪念降落周年？", "t": [9250, 11926]}]}, {"id": "ch25p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince flushed again.", "zh": "我犹豫着又问： “也许是为了纪念降落周年？", "t": [138, 1850]}]}, {"id": "ch25p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And I added, with some hesitancy:", "zh": "……” 小王子的脸再次红了。", "t": [112, 2388]}]}, {"id": "ch25p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Perhaps it was because of the anniversary?\"", "zh": "他从不回答我提的问题。", "t": [100, 2500]}]}, {"id": "ch25p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "The little prince flushed once more.", "zh": "但一个人脸红，就意味着默认，意味着做了“是的”的回答，对吧？", "t": [138, 2500]}, {"en": "He never answered questions-- but when one flushes does that not mean \"Yes\"?", "zh": "但一个人脸红，就意味着默认，意味着做了“是的”的回答，对吧？", "t": [2500, 6600]}]}, {"id": "ch25p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah,\" I said to him, \"I am a little frightened--\"", "zh": "”我对他说，“我怕……” 他却对我说： “现在你该干活了。", "t": [138, 3087]}]}, {"id": "ch25p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he interrupted me.", "zh": "”我对他说，“我怕……” 他却对我说： “现在你该干活了。", "t": [100, 1475]}]}, {"id": "ch25p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Now you must work.", "zh": "”我对他说，“我怕……” 他却对我说： “现在你该干活了。", "t": [125, 1762]}, {"en": "You must return to your engine.", "zh": "你该到你的机器旁忙活儿了。", "t": [1762, 3900]}, {"en": "I will be waiting for you here.", "zh": "你该到你的机器旁忙活儿了。", "t": [3900, 6012]}, {"en": "Come back tomorrow evening...\"", "zh": "我在这儿等你，明天晚上再来……” 但我不放心。", "t": [6012, 7687]}]}, {"id": "ch25p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But I was not reassured.", "zh": "我在这儿等你，明天晚上再来……” 但我不放心。", "t": [100, 2112]}, {"en": "I remembered the fox.", "zh": "我在这儿等你，明天晚上再来……” 但我不放心。", "t": [2112, 3938]}, {"en": "One runs the risk of weeping a little, if one lets himself be tamed...", "zh": "我想起了狐狸的事，让别人驯养，难免要掉掉眼泪……", "t": [3938, 8037]}]}]}, {"id": "ch26", "title_en": "Chapter XXVI", "title_zh": "第 26 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch26p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Beside the well there was the ruin of an old stonewall.", "zh": "井旁有一堵断墙残壁。", "t": [138, 3600]}, {"en": "When I came back from my work, the next evening, I saw from some distance away my little price sitting on top of a wall, with his feet dangling.", "zh": "第二天晚上，我干完活回来，远远看见我的小王子坐在残壁上，双腿悬空。", "t": [3600, 11962]}, {"en": "And I heard him say:", "zh": "不完全在这里！", "t": [11962, 13225]}]}, {"id": "ch26p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Then you don't remember.", "zh": "不完全在这里！", "t": [138, 1862]}, {"en": "This is not the exact spot.\"", "zh": "” 无疑有另一个声音回了他的话，因为他反驳说： “没错！", "t": [1862, 3637]}]}, {"id": "ch26p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Another voice must have answered him, for he replied to it:", "zh": "没错！", "t": [112, 3413]}]}, {"id": "ch26p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, yes!", "zh": "没错！", "t": [100, 1588]}, {"en": "It is the right day, but this is not the place.\"", "zh": "就是这一天，但不是这个地方……” 我向断墙残壁走过去，我看不见也听不见有什么人在那儿。", "t": [1588, 4325]}]}, {"id": "ch26p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I continued my walk toward the wall.", "zh": "就是这一天，但不是这个地方……” 我向断墙残壁走过去，我看不见也听不见有什么人在那儿。", "t": [138, 2762]}, {"en": "At no time did I see or hear anyone.", "zh": "就是这一天，但不是这个地方……” 我向断墙残壁走过去，我看不见也听不见有什么人在那儿。", "t": [2762, 5600]}, {"en": "The little prince, however, replied once again:", "zh": "然而小王子又反驳了： “……当然，你会看到我留在沙地上的足迹，看到它是从哪儿开始的。", "t": [5600, 8738]}]}, {"id": "ch26p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"--Exactly.", "zh": "然而小王子又反驳了： “……当然，你会看到我留在沙地上的足迹，看到它是从哪儿开始的。", "t": [100, 1350]}, {"en": "You will see where my track begins, in the sand.", "zh": "然而小王子又反驳了： “……当然，你会看到我留在沙地上的足迹，看到它是从哪儿开始的。", "t": [1350, 4650]}, {"en": "You have nothing to do but wait for me there.", "zh": "然而小王子又反驳了： “……当然，你会看到我留在沙地上的足迹，看到它是从哪儿开始的。", "t": [4650, 7300]}, {"en": "I shall be there tonight.\"", "zh": "你在那儿等我就行了。", "t": [7300, 8775]}]}, {"id": "ch26p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I was only twenty metres from the wall, and I still saw nothing.", "zh": "今夜我会在那儿等你。", "t": [138, 3776]}]}, {"id": "ch26p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After a silence the little prince spoke again:", "zh": "” 我离开墙才二十米，还是一无所见。", "t": [138, 2826]}]}, {"id": "ch26p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You have good poison?", "zh": "小王子沉默片刻后又说： “你有毒液吗？", "t": [138, 1812]}, {"en": "You are sure that it will not make me suffer too long?\"", "zh": "小王子沉默片刻后又说： “你有毒液吗？", "t": [1812, 4637]}]}, {"id": "ch26p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I stopped in my tracks, my heart torn asunder; but still I did not understand.", "zh": "你能肯定不让我经受很久的痛苦？", "t": [138, 5150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Now go away,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "我仍然听不懂他的话。", "t": [125, 2875]}, {"en": "\"I want to get down from the wall.\"", "zh": "“现在你走吧。", "t": [2875, 4674]}]}, {"id": "ch26p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I dropped my eyes, then, to the foot of the wall-- and I leaped into the air.", "zh": "“我要跳下去了！", "t": [138, 4850]}, {"en": "There before me, facing the little prince, was one of those yellow snakes that take just thirty seconds to bring your life to an end.", "zh": "一条黄蛇正仰头朝向小王子。", "t": [4850, 12300]}, {"en": "Even as I was digging into my pocked to get out my revolver I made a running step back.", "zh": "我一面伸手到口袋里掏手枪，一面飞步冲过去。", "t": [12300, 17625]}, {"en": "But, at the noise I made, the snake let himself flow easily across the sand like the dying spray of a fountain, and, in no apparent hurry, disappeared, with a light metallic sound, among the stones.", "zh": "蛇听到我的脚步声，轻轻地溜进沙里，如颓然跌落的水柱，不慌不忙地钻进石缝里，发出轻微的金属的声音。", "t": [17625, 29337]}]}, {"id": "ch26p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I reached the wall just in time to catch my little man in my arms; his face was white as snow.", "zh": "这位王子的脸雪一般的苍白。", "t": [138, 5562]}]}, {"id": "ch26p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What does this mean?\" I demanded.", "zh": "“怎么回事，你和蛇说话了？", "t": [138, 2988]}, {"en": "\"Why are you talking with snakes?\"", "zh": "” 我解下他从不离身的金围巾，用水湿湿他的太阳穴，给他喝水。", "t": [2988, 4724]}]}, {"id": "ch26p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I had loosened the golden muffler that he always wore.", "zh": "” 我解下他从不离身的金围巾，用水湿湿他的太阳穴，给他喝水。", "t": [138, 3538]}, {"en": "I had moistened his temples, and had given him some water to drink.", "zh": "现在我不敢再向他提什么问题了。", "t": [3538, 7838]}, {"en": "And now I did not dare ask him any more questions.", "zh": "他神情凝重地看着我，双臂搂住我的脖子。", "t": [7838, 11238]}, {"en": "He looked at me very gravely, and put his arms around my neck.", "zh": "我感觉到他的心的狂跳，如同中弹濒死的小鸟。", "t": [11238, 15338]}, {"en": "I felt his heart beating like the heart of a dying bird, shot with someone's rifle...", "zh": "他对我说：“你找到了机器的毛病，我很高兴。", "t": [15338, 20125]}]}, {"id": "ch26p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I am glad that you have found what was the matter with your engine,\" he said.", "zh": "你可以回家了……” “你怎么知道的？", "t": [138, 4512]}, {"en": "\"Now you can go back home--\"", "zh": "” 我来找他，正是要告诉他：出乎我的意料，我竟修好了我的飞机。", "t": [4512, 6000]}]}, {"id": "ch26p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"How do you know about that?\"", "zh": "” 我来找他，正是要告诉他：出乎我的意料，我竟修好了我的飞机。", "t": [125, 1550]}]}, {"id": "ch26p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I was just coming to tell him that my work had been successful, beyond anything that I had dared to hope.", "zh": "” 我来找他，正是要告诉他：出乎我的意料，我竟修好了我的飞机。", "t": [138, 5750]}]}, {"id": "ch26p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He made no answer to my question, but he added: \"I, too, am going back home today...\"", "zh": "他不回答我的问题，却又说： “今天我也要回家了……” 然后，他神色凄伤，黯然说道： “我的家要远多了……也难回去得多……” 我感觉到发生了非比寻常的事情。", "t": [125, 5463]}]}, {"id": "ch26p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Then, sadly-- \"It is much farther...", "zh": "他不回答我的问题，却又说： “今天我也要回家了……” 然后，他神色凄伤，黯然说道： “我的家要远多了……也难回去得多……” 我感觉到发生了非比寻常的事情。", "t": [100, 2538]}, {"en": "it is much more difficult...\"", "zh": "他不回答我的问题，却又说： “今天我也要回家了……” 然后，他神色凄伤，黯然说道： “我的家要远多了……也难回去得多……” 我感觉到发生了非比寻常的事情。", "t": [2538, 3976]}]}, {"id": "ch26p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I realised clearly that something extraordinary was happening.", "zh": "我把他搂进怀里，如同他是个小孩子。", "t": [138, 3988]}, {"en": "I was holding him close in my arms as if he were a little child; and yet it seemed to me that he was rushing headlong toward an abyss from which I could do nothing to restrain him...", "zh": "然而我觉得他直往深渊里坠下去，我一点也抓不住他…… 他目光严肃，落到远方。", "t": [3988, 12850]}]}, {"id": "ch26p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "His look was very serious, like some one lost far away.", "zh": "“我有你的绵羊，我有给绵羊住的箱子。", "t": [138, 3687]}]}, {"id": "ch26p22", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I have your sheep.", "zh": "我有口罩……” 他凄凉地笑笑。", "t": [125, 1588]}, {"en": "And I have the sheep's box.", "zh": "我有口罩……” 他凄凉地笑笑。", "t": [1588, 3575]}, {"en": "And I have the muzzle...\"", "zh": "我等了许久。", "t": [3575, 4824]}]}, {"id": "ch26p23", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he gave me a sad smile.", "zh": "我感觉到他的身体逐渐恢复了温暖。", "t": [138, 1800]}]}, {"id": "ch26p24", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I waited a long time.", "zh": "我感觉到他的身体逐渐恢复了温暖。", "t": [138, 1925]}, {"en": "I could see that he was reviving little by little.", "zh": "“小人儿，你害怕了……” 当然，他害怕！", "t": [1925, 4725]}]}, {"id": "ch26p25", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Dear little man,\" I said to him, \"you are afraid...\"", "zh": "他温和地笑笑： “今晚我会更害怕！", "t": [112, 3237]}]}, {"id": "ch26p26", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was afraid, there was no doubt about that.", "zh": "他温和地笑笑： “今晚我会更害怕！", "t": [138, 3212]}, {"en": "But he laughed lightly.", "zh": "” 我又一次体会到无可奈何的感觉。", "t": [3212, 4487]}]}, {"id": "ch26p27", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall be much more afraid this evening...\"", "zh": "我全身冰冷。", "t": [138, 2350]}]}, {"id": "ch26p28", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Once again I felt myself frozen by the sense of something irreparable.", "zh": "我知道，听不见他的笑声，我会忍受不了的。", "t": [138, 4638]}, {"en": "And I knew that I could not bear the thought of never hearing that laughter any more.", "zh": "他的笑声对我来说，如同沙漠里的一口井。", "t": [4638, 9038]}, {"en": "For me, it was like a spring of fresh water in the desert.", "zh": "“小人儿，我还想听到你的笑声……” 但他对我说： “今夜是我到这儿的一周年。", "t": [9038, 12450]}]}, {"id": "ch26p29", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Little man,\" I said, \"I want to hear you laugh again.\"", "zh": "“小人儿，我还想听到你的笑声……” 但他对我说： “今夜是我到这儿的一周年。", "t": [138, 3288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p30", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he said to me:", "zh": "我的星星正好在我去年降落处的正上方……” “小人儿，蛇呀、约会呀、星星的故事，莫非都是一场噩梦？", "t": [100, 1162]}]}, {"id": "ch26p31", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Tonight, it will be a year...", "zh": "我的星星正好在我去年降落处的正上方……” “小人儿，蛇呀、约会呀、星星的故事，莫非都是一场噩梦？", "t": [100, 2000]}, {"en": "my star, then, can be found right above the place where I came to the Earth, a year ago...\"", "zh": "我的星星正好在我去年降落处的正上方……” “小人儿，蛇呀、约会呀、星星的故事，莫非都是一场噩梦？", "t": [2000, 7076]}]}, {"id": "ch26p32", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Little man,\" I said, \"tell me that it is only a bad dream-- this affair of the snake, and the meeting-place, and the star...\"", "zh": "……” 但他不回答我的问题。", "t": [112, 6875]}]}, {"id": "ch26p33", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he did not answer my plea.", "zh": "他对我说： “最重要的东西，是肉眼看不到的……” “当然……” “花儿也是这样，如果你爱上了一朵长在一颗星星里的花儿，夜里看看星空，你会觉得甜蜜。", "t": [100, 2238]}, {"en": "He said to me, instead:", "zh": "他对我说： “最重要的东西，是肉眼看不到的……” “当然……” “花儿也是这样，如果你爱上了一朵长在一颗星星里的花儿，夜里看看星空，你会觉得甜蜜。", "t": [2238, 3950]}]}, {"id": "ch26p34", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"The thing that is important is the thing that is not seen...\"", "zh": "他对我说： “最重要的东西，是肉眼看不到的……” “当然……” “花儿也是这样，如果你爱上了一朵长在一颗星星里的花儿，夜里看看星空，你会觉得甜蜜。", "t": [138, 3287]}]}, {"id": "ch26p35", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, I know...\"", "zh": "他对我说： “最重要的东西，是肉眼看不到的……” “当然……” “花儿也是这样，如果你爱上了一朵长在一颗星星里的花儿，夜里看看星空，你会觉得甜蜜。", "t": [100, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p36", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is just as it is with the flower.", "zh": "所有的星星都像开了花。", "t": [138, 2625]}, {"en": "If you love a flower that lives on a star, it is sweet to look at the sky at night.", "zh": "所有的星星都像开了花。", "t": [2625, 7438]}, {"en": "All the stars are a-bloom with flowers...\"", "zh": "” “不错……” “水也是这样。", "t": [7438, 9862]}]}, {"id": "ch26p37", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, I know...\"", "zh": "你给我喝的水，有了辘轳和绳子，水就如同音乐……你记得……它是甘甜的。", "t": [100, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p38", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is just as it is with the water.", "zh": "你给我喝的水，有了辘轳和绳子，水就如同音乐……你记得……它是甘甜的。", "t": [138, 2575]}, {"en": "Because of the pulley, and the rope, what you gave me to drink was like music.", "zh": "” “不错。", "t": [2575, 7325]}, {"en": "You remember-- how good it was.\"", "zh": "” “不错。", "t": [7325, 8987]}]}, {"id": "ch26p39", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Yes, I know...\"", "zh": "” “夜里你仰望星空吧，我的那颗星太渺小，没法子告诉你它在哪儿。", "t": [100, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p40", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And at night you will look up at the stars.", "zh": "” “夜里你仰望星空吧，我的那颗星太渺小，没法子告诉你它在哪儿。", "t": [138, 2725]}, {"en": "Where I live everything is so small that I cannot show you where my star is to be found.", "zh": "这样更好……你就把我的星看做是万千星星中的一颗吧，这样你就会爱看所有的星星……它们全都成了你的朋友。", "t": [2725, 7800]}, {"en": "It is better, like that.", "zh": "这样更好……你就把我的星看做是万千星星中的一颗吧，这样你就会爱看所有的星星……它们全都成了你的朋友。", "t": [7800, 9912]}, {"en": "My star will just be one of the stars, for you.", "zh": "这样更好……你就把我的星看做是万千星星中的一颗吧，这样你就会爱看所有的星星……它们全都成了你的朋友。", "t": [9912, 13325]}, {"en": "And so you will love to watch all the stars in the heavens...", "zh": "然后我会赠给你一份礼物……” 他还在笑。", "t": [13325, 16475]}, {"en": "they will all be your friends.", "zh": "然后我会赠给你一份礼物……” 他还在笑。", "t": [16475, 18238]}, {"en": "And, besides, I am going to make you a present...\"", "zh": "“啊，小人儿，小人儿，我喜欢听你的笑声！", "t": [18238, 21388]}]}, {"id": "ch26p41", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He laughed again.", "zh": "“啊，小人儿，小人儿，我喜欢听你的笑声！", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p42", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah, little prince, dear little prince!", "zh": "” “这正是我给你的礼物……这就和水一样……” “你想说什么？", "t": [138, 3225]}, {"en": "I love to hear that laughter!\"", "zh": "” “这正是我给你的礼物……这就和水一样……” “你想说什么？", "t": [3225, 4763]}]}, {"id": "ch26p43", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That is my present.", "zh": "” “这正是我给你的礼物……这就和水一样……” “你想说什么？", "t": [138, 1788]}, {"en": "Just that.", "zh": "” “这正是我给你的礼物……这就和水一样……” “你想说什么？", "t": [1788, 3025]}, {"en": "It will be as it was when we drank the water...\"", "zh": "” “不同的人有不同的星星。", "t": [3025, 5625]}]}, {"id": "ch26p44", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What are you trying to say?\"", "zh": "” “不同的人有不同的星星。", "t": [125, 1550]}]}, {"id": "ch26p45", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"All men have the stars,\" he answered, \"but they are not the same things for different people.", "zh": "星星是旅行的人的向导，星星只是其他人的小灯，星星是学者研究的问题，星星是我说过的那个商人的金子。", "t": [138, 5362]}, {"en": "For some, who are travellers, the stars are guides.", "zh": "但所有的星星都沉默不语。", "t": [5362, 8988]}, {"en": "For others they are no more than little lights in the sky.", "zh": "但所有的星星都沉默不语。", "t": [8988, 12400]}, {"en": "For others, who are scholars, they are problems.", "zh": "你的那颗星星是别人没有的……” “你想说什么？", "t": [12400, 15838]}, {"en": "For my businessman they were wealth.", "zh": "你的那颗星星是别人没有的……” “你想说什么？", "t": [15838, 18125]}, {"en": "But all these stars are silent.", "zh": "” “既然我住在天上一颗星星里，既然我在其中一颗星星里笑，这就如同所有的星星都在冲你笑，你就拥有无数会笑的星星了！", "t": [18125, 20488]}, {"en": "You-- you alone-- will have the stars as no one else has them--\"", "zh": "” “既然我住在天上一颗星星里，既然我在其中一颗星星里笑，这就如同所有的星星都在冲你笑，你就拥有无数会笑的星星了！", "t": [20488, 23688]}]}, {"id": "ch26p46", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"What are you trying to say?\"", "zh": "” “既然我住在天上一颗星星里，既然我在其中一颗星星里笑，这就如同所有的星星都在冲你笑，你就拥有无数会笑的星星了！", "t": [125, 1550]}]}, {"id": "ch26p47", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"In one of the stars I shall be living.", "zh": "” 他还在笑。", "t": [138, 2662]}, {"en": "In one of them I shall be laughing.", "zh": "” 他还在笑。", "t": [2662, 4912]}, {"en": "And so it will be as if all the stars were laughing, when you look at the sky at night...", "zh": "“你得到了安慰之后（人常常自我安慰），你会为认识我而高兴。", "t": [4912, 9588]}, {"en": "you-- only you-- will have stars that can laugh!\" And he laughed again.", "zh": "你会成为我永远的朋友，你会想与我一起笑。", "t": [9588, 13150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p48", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"And when your sorrow is comforted (time soothes all sorrows) you will be content that you have known me.", "zh": "有时候，当你想笑而打开窗户的时候……你的朋友看见你仰望星空独自发笑，他们一定会惊讶，你就对他们说：‘是的，我看见星星就要笑！", "t": [138, 6075]}, {"en": "You will always be my friend.", "zh": "有时候，当你想笑而打开窗户的时候……你的朋友看见你仰望星空独自发笑，他们一定会惊讶，你就对他们说：‘是的，我看见星星就要笑！", "t": [6075, 8200]}, {"en": "You will want to laugh with me.", "zh": "有时候，当你想笑而打开窗户的时候……你的朋友看见你仰望星空独自发笑，他们一定会惊讶，你就对他们说：‘是的，我看见星星就要笑！", "t": [8200, 10100]}, {"en": "And you will sometimes open your window, so, for that pleasure...", "zh": "’他们会以为你神经出了毛病。", "t": [10100, 13825]}, {"en": "and your friends will be properly astonished to see you laughing as you look up at the sky!", "zh": "’他们会以为你神经出了毛病。", "t": [13825, 18312]}, {"en": "Then you will say to them, 'Yes, the stars always make me laugh!' And they will think you are crazy.", "zh": "“这样一来，我给你的不是星星，而是一大批会笑的小铃铛……” 他还在笑。", "t": [18312, 24450]}, {"en": "It will be a very shabby trick that I shall have played on you...\"", "zh": "然后他收敛了笑容： “今晚……你知道……你不要来了。", "t": [24450, 27688]}]}, {"id": "ch26p49", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he laughed again.", "zh": "然后他收敛了笑容： “今晚……你知道……你不要来了。", "t": [138, 1288]}]}, {"id": "ch26p50", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It will be as if, in place of the stars, I had given you a great number of little bells that knew how to laugh...\"", "zh": "” “我不会离开你的。", "t": [138, 6337]}]}, {"id": "ch26p51", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he laughed again.", "zh": "” “我会很难看的……会像个死人，别来看我的死了的样子，没有必要。", "t": [138, 1688]}, {"en": "Then he quickly became serious:", "zh": "” “我会很难看的……会像个死人，别来看我的死了的样子，没有必要。", "t": [1688, 3700]}]}, {"id": "ch26p52", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Tonight-- you know...", "zh": "” “我不会离开你的。", "t": [100, 1338]}, {"en": "do not come,\" said the little prince.", "zh": "” “我不会离开你的。", "t": [1338, 3563]}]}, {"id": "ch26p53", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall not leave you,\" I said.", "zh": "” 他露出忧心忡忡的神色。", "t": [138, 2063]}]}, {"id": "ch26p54", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall look as if I were suffering.", "zh": "” 他露出忧心忡忡的神色。", "t": [138, 2438]}, {"en": "I shall look a little as if I were dying.", "zh": "“我跟你讲这些话……也是因为蛇，不该让它伤害你……蛇是凶残的动物，高兴时也咬人……” “我不离开你。", "t": [2438, 5100]}, {"en": "It is like that.", "zh": "“我跟你讲这些话……也是因为蛇，不该让它伤害你……蛇是凶残的动物，高兴时也咬人……” “我不离开你。", "t": [5100, 6562]}, {"en": "Do not come to see that.", "zh": "“我跟你讲这些话……也是因为蛇，不该让它伤害你……蛇是凶残的动物，高兴时也咬人……” “我不离开你。", "t": [6562, 8450]}, {"en": "It is not worth the trouble...\"", "zh": "“我跟你讲这些话……也是因为蛇，不该让它伤害你……蛇是凶残的动物，高兴时也咬人……” “我不离开你。", "t": [8450, 10013]}]}, {"id": "ch26p55", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall not leave you.\"", "zh": "“我跟你讲这些话……也是因为蛇，不该让它伤害你……蛇是凶残的动物，高兴时也咬人……” “我不离开你。", "t": [138, 1376]}]}, {"id": "ch26p56", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But he was worried.", "zh": "“我跟你讲这些话……也是因为蛇，不该让它伤害你……蛇是凶残的动物，高兴时也咬人……” “我不离开你。", "t": [112, 1250]}]}, {"id": "ch26p57", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I tell you-- it is also because of the snake.", "zh": "” 他想起什么，随即放宽了心： “真的，蛇咬的第二口不再有毒液……” 那天夜里我没看见他离开我。", "t": [138, 3050]}, {"en": "He must not bite you.", "zh": "” 他想起什么，随即放宽了心： “真的，蛇咬的第二口不再有毒液……” 那天夜里我没看见他离开我。", "t": [3050, 4750]}, {"en": "Snakes-- they are malicious creatures.", "zh": "” 他想起什么，随即放宽了心： “真的，蛇咬的第二口不再有毒液……” 那天夜里我没看见他离开我。", "t": [4750, 7188]}, {"en": "This one might bite you just for fun...\"", "zh": "他是悄悄走的。", "t": [7188, 9275]}]}, {"id": "ch26p58", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"I shall not leave you.\"", "zh": "他是悄悄走的。", "t": [138, 1376]}]}, {"id": "ch26p59", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But a thought came to reassure him:", "zh": "我终于赶上他。", "t": [100, 2126]}]}, {"id": "ch26p60", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It is true that they have no more poison for a second bite.\"", "zh": "他大步走着，步子迈得又大又坚决。", "t": [138, 3388]}]}, {"id": "ch26p61", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "That night I did not see him set out on his way.", "zh": "他见了我，只说了一句：“呀，你在这儿……” 他牵住我的手。", "t": [138, 3375]}, {"en": "He got away from me without making a sound.", "zh": "他见了我，只说了一句：“呀，你在这儿……” 他牵住我的手。", "t": [3375, 6288]}, {"en": "When I succeeded in catching up with him he was walking along with a quick and resolute step.", "zh": "然后他苦恼地说： “你不该来的。", "t": [6288, 11662]}, {"en": "He said to me merely:", "zh": "我会像个死人，其实我不是真死……” 我不做声。", "t": [11662, 12875]}]}, {"id": "ch26p62", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Ah!", "zh": "我会像个死人，其实我不是真死……” 我不做声。", "t": [100, 825]}, {"en": "You are there...\"", "zh": "我会像个死人，其实我不是真死……” 我不做声。", "t": [825, 1612]}]}, {"id": "ch26p63", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he took me by the hand.", "zh": "我会像个死人，其实我不是真死……” 我不做声。", "t": [138, 2012]}, {"en": "But he was still worrying.", "zh": "“你知道吧，路途太远，我拖不动这副皮囊，它太沉了。", "t": [2012, 3438]}]}, {"id": "ch26p64", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"It was wrong of you to come.", "zh": "“你知道吧，路途太远，我拖不动这副皮囊，它太沉了。", "t": [138, 1988]}, {"en": "You will suffer.", "zh": "“你知道吧，路途太远，我拖不动这副皮囊，它太沉了。", "t": [1988, 3388]}, {"en": "I shall look as if I were dead; and that will not be true...\"", "zh": "” 我不做声。", "t": [3388, 6676]}]}, {"id": "ch26p65", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I said nothing.", "zh": "“也不过如同蜕了旧壳，一副旧壳不值得悲哀……” 我还是不做声。", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p66", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You understand...", "zh": "“也不过如同蜕了旧壳，一副旧壳不值得悲哀……” 我还是不做声。", "t": [138, 1388]}, {"en": "it is too far.", "zh": "“也不过如同蜕了旧壳，一副旧壳不值得悲哀……” 我还是不做声。", "t": [1388, 2725]}, {"en": "I cannot carry this body with me.", "zh": "“也不过如同蜕了旧壳，一副旧壳不值得悲哀……” 我还是不做声。", "t": [2725, 5038]}, {"en": "It is too heavy.\"", "zh": "他有点泄气了，但还在竭力安慰我： “你知道，想起你，我的心会温暖的。", "t": [5038, 6163]}]}, {"id": "ch26p67", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I said nothing.", "zh": "他有点泄气了，但还在竭力安慰我： “你知道，想起你，我的心会温暖的。", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p68", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"But it will be like an old abandoned shell.", "zh": "他有点泄气了，但还在竭力安慰我： “你知道，想起你，我的心会温暖的。", "t": [112, 2738]}, {"en": "There is nothing sad about old shells...\"", "zh": "他有点泄气了，但还在竭力安慰我： “你知道，想起你，我的心会温暖的。", "t": [2738, 4988]}]}, {"id": "ch26p69", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I said nothing.", "zh": "他有点泄气了，但还在竭力安慰我： “你知道，想起你，我的心会温暖的。", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p70", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He was a little discouraged.", "zh": "以后我也会仰望星空，所有的星星会成了带有生锈辘轳的井，所有的星星给我倒水喝……” 我还是不做声。", "t": [138, 2162]}, {"en": "But he made one more effort:", "zh": "以后我也会仰望星空，所有的星星会成了带有生锈辘轳的井，所有的星星给我倒水喝……” 我还是不做声。", "t": [2162, 3876]}]}, {"id": "ch26p71", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know, it will be very nice.", "zh": "以后我也会仰望星空，所有的星星会成了带有生锈辘轳的井，所有的星星给我倒水喝……” 我还是不做声。", "t": [138, 2500]}, {"en": "I, too, shall look at the stars.", "zh": "以后我也会仰望星空，所有的星星会成了带有生锈辘轳的井，所有的星星给我倒水喝……” 我还是不做声。", "t": [2500, 5200]}, {"en": "All the stars will be wells with a rusty pulley.", "zh": "“那会是多有趣的事情！", "t": [5200, 8325]}, {"en": "All the stars will pour out fresh water for me to drink...\"", "zh": "“那会是多有趣的事情！", "t": [8325, 11713]}]}, {"id": "ch26p72", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I said nothing.", "zh": "你会有五亿个小铃铛，我有五亿口井……” 他也不做声了，因为他哭了…… “就在这儿吧。", "t": [138, 1150]}]}, {"id": "ch26p73", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"That will be so amusing!", "zh": "你会有五亿个小铃铛，我有五亿口井……” 他也不做声了，因为他哭了…… “就在这儿吧。", "t": [112, 2000]}, {"en": "You will have five hundred million little bells, and I shall have five hundred million springs of fresh water...\"", "zh": "你让我独自走一步。", "t": [2000, 7774]}]}, {"id": "ch26p74", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he too said nothing more, because he was crying...", "zh": "” 他坐了下来，因为他害怕了。", "t": [112, 3025]}]}, {"id": "ch26p75", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"Here it is.", "zh": "他还说： “你知道……我的花……我要对她负责！", "t": [138, 1325]}, {"en": "Let me go on by myself.\"", "zh": "他还说： “你知道……我的花……我要对她负责！", "t": [1325, 3062]}]}, {"id": "ch26p76", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And he sat down, because he was afraid.", "zh": "她弱不禁风！", "t": [138, 3025]}, {"en": "Then he said, again:", "zh": "她聪明纯洁！", "t": [3025, 4512]}]}, {"id": "ch26p77", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"You know-- my flower...", "zh": "她一无所有！", "t": [138, 1712]}, {"en": "I am responsible for her.", "zh": "她一无所有！", "t": [1712, 3712]}, {"en": "And she is so weak!", "zh": "只凭四根刺保护自己，抵御世上的侵害……” 我瘫坐在地上。", "t": [3712, 5262]}, {"en": "She is so naïve!", "zh": "只凭四根刺保护自己，抵御世上的侵害……” 我瘫坐在地上。", "t": [5262, 6938]}, {"en": "She has four thorns, of no use at all, to protect herself against all the world...\"", "zh": "因为我站不住了。", "t": [6938, 11900]}]}, {"id": "ch26p78", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I too sat down, because I was not able to stand up any longer.", "zh": "他说： “我的话……讲完了……” 他还犹豫了片刻，然后站起来，向前走了一步。", "t": [138, 3900]}]}, {"id": "ch26p79", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "\"There now-- that is all...\"", "zh": "他说： “我的话……讲完了……” 他还犹豫了片刻，然后站起来，向前走了一步。", "t": [125, 1388]}]}, {"id": "ch26p80", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "He still hesitated a little; then he got up.", "zh": "而我不能动弹。", "t": [138, 3462]}, {"en": "He took one step.", "zh": "而我不能动弹。", "t": [3462, 5075]}, {"en": "I could not move.", "zh": "他的脚踝边闪了一道黄光。", "t": [5075, 6162]}]}, {"id": "ch26p81", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "There was nothing but a flash of yellow close to his ankle.", "zh": "他凝然不动。", "t": [138, 3600]}, {"en": "He remained motionless for an instant.", "zh": "好一会儿之后，他像大树倒地似的倒下。", "t": [3600, 6262]}, {"en": "He did not cry out.", "zh": "好一会儿之后，他像大树倒地似的倒下。", "t": [6262, 7975]}, {"en": "He fell as gently as a tree falls.", "zh": "因为这儿是沙地，他倒下去的时候，一点声音都没有。", "t": [7975, 10588]}, {"en": "There was not even any sound, because of the sand.", "zh": "因为这儿是沙地，他倒下去的时候，一点声音都没有。", "t": [10588, 13587]}]}]}, {"id": "ch27", "title_en": "Chapter XXVII", "title_zh": "第 27 章", "paras": [{"id": "ch27p00", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And now six years have already gone by...", "zh": "当然，这已是六年前的事了……我从来没对别人讲过这个故事。", "t": [112, 2462]}]}, {"id": "ch27p01", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "I have never yet told this story.", "zh": "当然，这已是六年前的事了……我从来没对别人讲过这个故事。", "t": [138, 2462]}, {"en": "The companions who met me on my return were well content to see me alive.", "zh": "当然，这已是六年前的事了……我从来没对别人讲过这个故事。", "t": [2462, 7000]}, {"en": "I was sad, but I told them: \"I am tired.\"", "zh": "我的同事们看见我活着回来，都替我庆幸。", "t": [7000, 9963]}]}, {"id": "ch27p02", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Now my sorrow is comforted a little.", "zh": "我的同事们看见我活着回来，都替我庆幸。", "t": [112, 2712]}, {"en": "That is to say-- not entirely.", "zh": "我的同事们看见我活着回来，都替我庆幸。", "t": [2712, 4838]}, {"en": "But I know that he did go back to his planet, because I did not find his body at daybreak.", "zh": "我的同事们看见我活着回来，都替我庆幸。", "t": [4838, 10188]}, {"en": "It was not such a heavy body...", "zh": "我神色哀伤，但我告诉他们：“这是因为累……” 现在，我的离愁别绪已经减轻了一些。", "t": [10188, 12138]}, {"en": "and at night I love to listen to the stars.", "zh": "我神色哀伤，但我告诉他们：“这是因为累……” 现在，我的离愁别绪已经减轻了一些。", "t": [12138, 14712]}, {"en": "It is like five hundred million little bells...", "zh": "我神色哀伤，但我告诉他们：“这是因为累……” 现在，我的离愁别绪已经减轻了一些。", "t": [14712, 17413]}]}, {"id": "ch27p03", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But there is one extraordinary thing...", "zh": "我神色哀伤，但我告诉他们：“这是因为累……” 现在，我的离愁别绪已经减轻了一些。", "t": [100, 2225]}, {"en": "when I drew the muzzle for the little prince, I forgot to add the leather strap to it.", "zh": "也就是说……还没有完全消除。", "t": [2225, 6800]}, {"en": "He will never have been able to fasten it on his sheep.", "zh": "也就是说……还没有完全消除。", "t": [6800, 10012]}, {"en": "So now I keep wondering: what is happening on his planet?", "zh": "我很明白，他回他的星球去了，因为天亮时我没找到他的尸体。", "t": [10012, 13812]}, {"en": "Perhaps the sheep has eaten the flower...", "zh": "我很明白，他回他的星球去了，因为天亮时我没找到他的尸体。", "t": [13812, 16013]}]}, {"id": "ch27p04", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "At one time I say to myself: \"Surely not!", "zh": "我很明白，他回他的星球去了，因为天亮时我没找到他的尸体。", "t": [138, 3450]}, {"en": "The little prince shuts his flower under her glass globe every night, and he watches over his sheep very carefully...\" Then I am happy.", "zh": "我很明白，他回他的星球去了，因为天亮时我没找到他的尸体。", "t": [3450, 11425]}, {"en": "And there is sweetness in the laughter of all the stars.", "zh": "他的躯体并不沉重……我喜欢在夜里倾听星星的呢喃，它们就像五亿个小铃铛…… 可是出了非同寻常的事了：我给小王子画了口罩，但我忘了给口罩配上皮带！", "t": [11425, 14337]}]}, {"id": "ch27p05", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "But at another time I say to myself: \"At some moment or other one is absent-minded, and that is enough!", "zh": "他的躯体并不沉重……我喜欢在夜里倾听星星的呢喃，它们就像五亿个小铃铛…… 可是出了非同寻常的事了：我给小王子画了口罩，但我忘了给口罩配上皮带！", "t": [100, 6562]}, {"en": "On some one evening he forgot the glass globe, or the sheep got out, without making any noise, in the night...\" And then the little bells are changed to tears...", "zh": "他的躯体并不沉重……我喜欢在夜里倾听星星的呢喃，它们就像五亿个小铃铛…… 可是出了非同寻常的事了：我给小王子画了口罩，但我忘了给口罩配上皮带！", "t": [6562, 15775]}]}, {"id": "ch27p06", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Here, then, is a great mystery.", "zh": "他别想把口罩套上羊嘴了。", "t": [138, 2775]}, {"en": "For you who also love the little prince, and for me, nothing in the universe can be the same if somewhere, we do not know where, a sheep that we never saw has-- yes or no?-- eaten a rose...", "zh": "我于是想：“他的星球发生了什么事呢？", "t": [2775, 13050]}]}, {"id": "ch27p07", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Look up at the sky.", "zh": "绵羊很可能吃了花儿……” 有时我又想：“一定不会的！", "t": [112, 1712]}, {"en": "Ask yourselves: is it yes or no?", "zh": "绵羊很可能吃了花儿……” 有时我又想：“一定不会的！", "t": [1712, 4500]}, {"en": "Has the sheep eaten the flower?", "zh": "绵羊很可能吃了花儿……” 有时我又想：“一定不会的！", "t": [4500, 6575]}, {"en": "And you will see how everything changes...", "zh": "绵羊很可能吃了花儿……” 有时我又想：“一定不会的！", "t": [6575, 8912]}]}, {"id": "ch27p08", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "And no grown-up will ever understand that this is a matter of so much importance!", "zh": "绵羊很可能吃了花儿……” 有时我又想：“一定不会的！", "t": [138, 4562]}]}, {"id": "ch27p09", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "This is, to me, the loveliest and saddest landscape in the world.", "zh": "小王子每天夜里把他的花儿罩在玻璃罩里，他一定会看管好他的绵羊……”于是我放心了，天上所有的星星都温和地微笑。", "t": [125, 4638]}, {"en": "It is the same as that on the preceding page, but I have drawn it again to impress it on your memory.", "zh": "小王子每天夜里把他的花儿罩在玻璃罩里，他一定会看管好他的绵羊……”于是我放心了，天上所有的星星都温和地微笑。", "t": [4638, 10388]}, {"en": "It is here that the little prince appeared on Earth, and disappeared.", "zh": "小王子每天夜里把他的花儿罩在玻璃罩里，他一定会看管好他的绵羊……”于是我放心了，天上所有的星星都温和地微笑。", "t": [10388, 14037]}]}, {"id": "ch27p10", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Look at it carefully so that you will be sure to recognise it in case you travel some day to the African desert.", "zh": "有时我想：“人总免不了有疏忽大意的时候，这就够糟的了！", "t": [100, 6325]}, {"en": "And, if you should come upon this spot, please do not hurry on.", "zh": "有时我想：“人总免不了有疏忽大意的时候，这就够糟的了！", "t": [6325, 10375]}, {"en": "Wait for a time, exactly under the star.", "zh": "有时我想：“人总免不了有疏忽大意的时候，这就够糟的了！", "t": [10375, 13400]}, {"en": "Then, if a little man appears who laughs, who has golden hair and who refuses to answer questions, you will know who he is.", "zh": "要是有天晚上他忘了给花罩上玻璃罩，或者绵羊在夜里悄悄地溜出来呢……”于是，铃铛全变成了泪珠…… 这件事始终是无法解开的谜。", "t": [13400, 20825]}, {"en": "If this should happen, please comfort me.", "zh": "要是有天晚上他忘了给花罩上玻璃罩，或者绵羊在夜里悄悄地溜出来呢……”于是，铃铛全变成了泪珠…… 这件事始终是无法解开的谜。", "t": [20825, 23525]}, {"en": "Send me word that he has come back.", "zh": "要是有天晚上他忘了给花罩上玻璃罩，或者绵羊在夜里悄悄地溜出来呢……”于是，铃铛全变成了泪珠…… 这件事始终是无法解开的谜。", "t": [23525, 25687]}]}, {"id": "ch27p11", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Saint-Exupéry: A Short Biography", "zh": "要是有天晚上他忘了给花罩上玻璃罩，或者绵羊在夜里悄悄地溜出来呢……”于是，铃铛全变成了泪珠…… 这件事始终是无法解开的谜。", "t": [100, 2688]}]}, {"id": "ch27p12", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "His friends called him Saint-Ex.", "zh": "要是有天晚上他忘了给花罩上玻璃罩，或者绵羊在夜里悄悄地溜出来呢……”于是，铃铛全变成了泪珠…… 这件事始终是无法解开的谜。", "t": [138, 2538]}, {"en": "In reality, he was named Antoine de Saint-Exupéry.", "zh": "要是有天晚上他忘了给花罩上玻璃罩，或者绵羊在夜里悄悄地溜出来呢……”于是，铃铛全变成了泪珠…… 这件事始终是无法解开的谜。", "t": [2538, 6425]}, {"en": "He is one of the greatest French writers.", "zh": "要是有天晚上他忘了给花罩上玻璃罩，或者绵羊在夜里悄悄地溜出来呢……”于是，铃铛全变成了泪珠…… 这件事始终是无法解开的谜。", "t": [6425, 9150]}, {"en": "He is also one of the pioneers of aviation.", "zh": "要是有天晚上他忘了给花罩上玻璃罩，或者绵羊在夜里悄悄地溜出来呢……”于是，铃铛全变成了泪珠…… 这件事始终是无法解开的谜。", "t": [9150, 12362]}, {"en": "Here is his story.", "zh": "在宇宙中不知哪个角落，我们不认识的绵羊有没有吃掉一朵玫瑰花，你们——喜爱小王子的人，和我一样，看法绝不相同…… 请你们仰望星空吧。", "t": [12362, 13550]}]}, {"id": "ch27p13", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Saint-Exupéry was born in Lyon in 1900.", "zh": "在宇宙中不知哪个角落，我们不认识的绵羊有没有吃掉一朵玫瑰花，你们——喜爱小王子的人，和我一样，看法绝不相同…… 请你们仰望星空吧。", "t": [125, 3875]}, {"en": "At an early age, he dreamt of adventure.", "zh": "在宇宙中不知哪个角落，我们不认识的绵羊有没有吃掉一朵玫瑰花，你们——喜爱小王子的人，和我一样，看法绝不相同…… 请你们仰望星空吧。", "t": [3875, 6862]}, {"en": "His greatest ambition was to be an officer in the Navy.", "zh": "在宇宙中不知哪个角落，我们不认识的绵羊有没有吃掉一朵玫瑰花，你们——喜爱小王子的人，和我一样，看法绝不相同…… 请你们仰望星空吧。", "t": [6862, 10462]}, {"en": "In order to become a Naval officer, one had to pass a very difficult exam.", "zh": "在宇宙中不知哪个角落，我们不认识的绵羊有没有吃掉一朵玫瑰花，你们——喜爱小王子的人，和我一样，看法绝不相同…… 请你们仰望星空吧。", "t": [10462, 15250]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry took the exam and failed...", "zh": "在宇宙中不知哪个角落，我们不认识的绵羊有没有吃掉一朵玫瑰花，你们——喜爱小王子的人，和我一样，看法绝不相同…… 请你们仰望星空吧。", "t": [15250, 18025]}, {"en": "there was, fortunately, another solution-- aviation.", "zh": "在宇宙中不知哪个角落，我们不认识的绵羊有没有吃掉一朵玫瑰花，你们——喜爱小王子的人，和我一样，看法绝不相同…… 请你们仰望星空吧。", "t": [18025, 21588]}, {"en": "At this time, aviation was extremely dangerous.", "zh": "请你们问问自己：绵羊有没有吃掉花儿？", "t": [21588, 25225]}, {"en": "Danger, risk-- this is precisely for what Saint-Exupéry wished.", "zh": "请你们问问自己：绵羊有没有吃掉花儿？", "t": [25225, 29512]}, {"en": "During his military service, he learned to pilot airplanes.", "zh": "请你们问问自己：绵羊有没有吃掉花儿？", "t": [29512, 33475]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry had only one idea in his head: to fly.", "zh": "请你们问问自己：绵羊有没有吃掉花儿？", "t": [33475, 37200]}]}, {"id": "ch27p14", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "After his military service, he presented himself to the director of an airline company and expressed to him his desire to become a pilot.", "zh": "你们就会看到，天上所有的星星发生了变化…… 没有一个大人明白，弄清楚这个问题有多重要！", "t": [138, 7975]}, {"en": "The director told him, \"Do like everyone else.", "zh": "你们就会看到，天上所有的星星发生了变化…… 没有一个大人明白，弄清楚这个问题有多重要！", "t": [7975, 11238]}, {"en": "First, you must become a mechanic.\"", "zh": "你们就会看到，天上所有的星星发生了变化…… 没有一个大人明白，弄清楚这个问题有多重要！", "t": [11238, 13562]}]}, {"id": "ch27p15", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Saint-Exupéry worked to become a mechanic.", "zh": "我认为这幅图画是世界上最凄美的图画了。", "t": [112, 3162]}, {"en": "In 1927, he finally reached his goal.", "zh": "我认为这幅图画是世界上最凄美的图画了。", "t": [3162, 6762]}, {"en": "He was the pilot of a formation.", "zh": "我认为这幅图画是世界上最凄美的图画了。", "t": [6762, 9150]}, {"en": "He completed dangerous missions over the Mediterranean, over the Sahara.", "zh": "它与前一幅的画面一样。", "t": [9150, 13888]}, {"en": "He had many accidents over the middle of the desert.", "zh": "它与前一幅的画面一样。", "t": [13888, 17100]}, {"en": "Later, he was named the director of his own aviation company in South America.", "zh": "我再一次画它，是为了让你们好好地看看它。", "t": [17100, 22338]}, {"en": "There also, he accomplished many dangerous missions over the Andes.", "zh": "我再一次画它，是为了让你们好好地看看它。", "t": [22338, 26438]}]}, {"id": "ch27p16", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "For Saint-Exupéry, flying wasn't just piloting an airplane.", "zh": "小王子就是在这里出现在地球上的，然后又是从这里离开了地球。", "t": [125, 4312]}, {"en": "It was also meditating, reflecting.", "zh": "小王子就是在这里出现在地球上的，然后又是从这里离开了地球。", "t": [4312, 7325]}, {"en": "During his missions, Saint-Exupéry thought deeply about solitude, friendship, the meaning of life, the human condition, and liberty.", "zh": "请你们仔细看清楚这幅画，有朝一日你们到沙漠，到非洲旅行，才能认出这地方来。", "t": [7325, 15925]}, {"en": "He published his reflections.", "zh": "请你们仔细看清楚这幅画，有朝一日你们到沙漠，到非洲旅行，才能认出这地方来。", "t": [15925, 18150]}, {"en": "His books had immediate success.", "zh": "请你们仔细看清楚这幅画，有朝一日你们到沙漠，到非洲旅行，才能认出这地方来。", "t": [18150, 20200]}]}, {"id": "ch27p17", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Unfortunately, the aviation company for which Saint-Exupéry worked was having serious financial problems.", "zh": "请你们仔细看清楚这幅画，有朝一日你们到沙漠，到非洲旅行，才能认出这地方来。", "t": [112, 6812]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry had to quit the company.", "zh": "如果你经过这个地方，我恳求你们，别匆忙离去，请在那颗星下稍待片刻！", "t": [6812, 9500]}, {"en": "He became a journalist.", "zh": "如果你经过这个地方，我恳求你们，别匆忙离去，请在那颗星下稍待片刻！", "t": [9500, 11412]}, {"en": "He went to Spain, Russia, and Germany.", "zh": "如果你经过这个地方，我恳求你们，别匆忙离去，请在那颗星下稍待片刻！", "t": [11412, 14488]}, {"en": "He flew when he could.", "zh": "如果你经过这个地方，我恳求你们，别匆忙离去，请在那颗星下稍待片刻！", "t": [14488, 15774]}]}, {"id": "ch27p18", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In 1939, France went to war with Germany.", "zh": "如果你经过这个地方，我恳求你们，别匆忙离去，请在那颗星下稍待片刻！", "t": [138, 3938]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry enlisted immediately in the army.", "zh": "如果你经过这个地方，我恳求你们，别匆忙离去，请在那颗星下稍待片刻！", "t": [3938, 7312]}, {"en": "Defeat came soon.", "zh": "如果你经过这个地方，我恳求你们，别匆忙离去，请在那颗星下稍待片刻！", "t": [7312, 9050]}, {"en": "France was occupied by Hitler's troops.", "zh": "如果有个孩子向你走过来；如果他笑吟吟的；如果他长着一头金发；如果你向他提问题，他不回答；你们就会猜到他是谁了。", "t": [9050, 11587]}]}, {"id": "ch27p19", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "Saint-Exupéry didn't accept the defeat.", "zh": "如果有个孩子向你走过来；如果他笑吟吟的；如果他长着一头金发；如果你向他提问题，他不回答；你们就会猜到他是谁了。", "t": [112, 3062]}, {"en": "He decided to leave France.", "zh": "如果有个孩子向你走过来；如果他笑吟吟的；如果他长着一头金发；如果你向他提问题，他不回答；你们就会猜到他是谁了。", "t": [3062, 5275]}, {"en": "He settled in the United States, where he continued to write.", "zh": "如果有个孩子向你走过来；如果他笑吟吟的；如果他长着一头金发；如果你向他提问题，他不回答；你们就会猜到他是谁了。", "t": [5275, 9275]}, {"en": "It was in New York that he published The Little Prince, one of his most celebrated books.", "zh": "如果有个孩子向你走过来；如果他笑吟吟的；如果他长着一头金发；如果你向他提问题，他不回答；你们就会猜到他是谁了。", "t": [9275, 14324]}]}, {"id": "ch27p20", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "In 1942, American troops landed in North Africa.", "zh": "果真如此，请你们行行好！", "t": [112, 4550]}, {"en": "Saint-Exupéry decided to join the American army.", "zh": "果真如此，请你们行行好！", "t": [4550, 8000]}, {"en": "At age 42, he volunteered to be a pilot.", "zh": "果真如此，请你们行行好！", "t": [8000, 11575]}, {"en": "He was told that he was too old.", "zh": "果真如此，请你们行行好！", "t": [11575, 13962]}, {"en": "He persisted.", "zh": "果真如此，请你们行行好！", "t": [13962, 15338]}, {"en": "Finally he obtained satisfaction.", "zh": "果真如此，请你们行行好！", "t": [15338, 18025]}, {"en": "He was given an airplane.", "zh": "别眼睁睁看着我为思念他而悲伤，别坐视不理，别无动于衷：请你们快点写信告诉我，他回来了…… 【注释】 [1] 美国的一个州。", "t": [18025, 19888]}, {"en": "He accomplished many missions over occupied France.", "zh": "别眼睁睁看着我为思念他而悲伤，别坐视不理，别无动于衷：请你们快点写信告诉我，他回来了…… 【注释】 [1] 美国的一个州。", "t": [19888, 23126]}]}, {"id": "ch27p21", "audio": true, "sents": [{"en": "On the 31st of July, 1944, Saint-Exupéry left for his last mission.", "zh": "别眼睁睁看着我为思念他而悲伤，别坐视不理，别无动于衷：请你们快点写信告诉我，他回来了…… 【注释】 [1] 美国的一个州。", "t": [138, 6138]}, {"en": "His airplane was destroyed by Germans over the Mediterranean.", "zh": "别眼睁睁看着我为思念他而悲伤，别坐视不理，别无动于衷：请你们快点写信告诉我，他回来了…… 【注释】 [1] 美国的一个州。", "t": [6138, 10188]}, {"en": "On that day, Saint-Exupéry didn't return...", "zh": "别眼睁睁看着我为思念他而悲伤，别坐视不理，别无动于衷：请你们快点写信告诉我，他回来了…… 【注释】 [1] 美国的一个州。", "t": [10188, 13100]}, {"en": "in the open sky, he found risk, death, and glory.", "zh": "别眼睁睁看着我为思念他而悲伤，别坐视不理，别无动于衷：请你们快点写信告诉我，他回来了…… 【注释】 [1] 美国的一个州。", "t": [13100, 16712]}]}]}]}